window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["df15"]={"id": "df15", "title": "噪声预测、数据预测与速度预测", "focus": "建立 ε、x₀、v 三种参数化的等价关系，推导它们之间的线性变换、损失加权与数值稳定性差异；说明采样一致性条件。", "claims": ["\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}", "v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0", "x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}"], "topics": ["ε 预测", "x0 预测", "v 预测", "三种参数化的等价关系", "损失加权", "数值稳定性", "采样的一致性", "与 score 的关系", "参数化的选择", "反例：参数化错误导致训练发散", "混合参数化", "与 ELBO 的接口", "代码：三种参数化的转换", "代码：等价性的数值验证", "与采样器章的接口", "本章推导链：同一噪声的三种写法"], "html": "<h3 id=\"df15--h-ε-预测\">ε 预测<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-ε-预测\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第二部已固定的扩散过程记号。设数据维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，干净样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，前向过程在离散时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 上定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\bar\\alpha_t\\}_{t=1}^T\\subset(0,1]$</span> 单调不增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 充分小但不为零，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>）。本节只处理单步前向的边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，不涉及反向 Markov 链的构造细节。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（数据可积性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in L^2(\\Omega;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设保证本节所有条件期望作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 元素存在。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（噪声独立性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\perp x_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 为标准高斯。此假设使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的条件分布为各向同性高斯，并保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 之间的线性关系成立。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（网络可测性与平方可积性）</strong>：参数化网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)$</span> 联合可测，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|f_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设使训练损失的定义与梯度交换合法。</p>\n<p>本节引入的核心新符号为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，表示以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 为预测目标的网络输出；其与 score、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的关系留待后续节展开，本节只建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测自身的定义、目标与一个恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-1-ε-预测的定义与相邻概念的区别\">1. ε 预测的定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-1-ε-预测的定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1.1（ε 预测）</strong>。给定假设 A1–A3，ε 预测是指训练一个网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，使其在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时逼近条件期望</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t):=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t].$$</div>\n<p>训练目标为最小化</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{t\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{1,\\dots,T\\}}\\,\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\varepsilon}\\Big[\\big\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>注意定义 1.1 中的目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 是条件期望，而非某个具体噪声样本。这一点是 ε 预测与“直接回归噪声样本”的区别：后者是随机变量，前者是其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影。由 A1–A2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(x_t)$</span>-可测的平方可积随机变量，且是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(x_t)$</span> 上的正交投影。</p>\n<p>ε 预测与 x₀ 预测、v 预测的区别不在网络结构，而在<strong>回归目标的条件期望</strong>不同：x₀ 预测逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>，v 预测逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[v\\mid x_t]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的定义见本章第 3 节。三者在同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 上的条件期望由本章 canonical claims 的线性关系联系，但作为训练目标，它们的损失函数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的加权不同（见第 5 节），这是本节不展开、但必须在此标明边界的内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-2-ε-预测的闭式解与正交性\">2. ε 预测的闭式解与正交性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-2-ε-预测的闭式解与正交性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.1（ε 预测的闭式解）</strong>。在假设 A1–A2 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由前向定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>。两边在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下取条件期望，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[x_t\\mid x_t]=x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t].$$</div>\n<p>移项即得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>这里使用了条件期望的线性性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}&gt;0$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 保证）。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 2.1 说明 ε 预测与 x₀ 预测在条件期望层面是<strong>代数等价</strong>的：知道其一即知其二。但等价性只在条件期望层面成立，不意味着两个网络的训练梯度相同——这正是第 5 节损失加权的主题。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.2（正交性恒等式）</strong>。在假设 A1–A2 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)\\mid x_t\\big]=0,\\qquad\n\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle \\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t),\\,g(x_t)\\rangle\\big]=0$$</div>\n<p>对任意满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|g(x_t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 的可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。第一式由条件期望定义直接得到。第二式对第一式取期望并用 tower property：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\langle \\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star,g(x_t)\\rangle]=\\mathbb E\\big[\\mathbb E[\\langle \\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star,g(x_t)\\rangle\\mid x_t]\\big]=\\mathbb E[\\langle \\mathbb E[\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star\\mid x_t],g(x_t)\\rangle]=0$</span>。交换期望与内积用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon^\\star,g(x_t)$</span> 的平方可积性（A1、A3 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 性），即 Cauchy–Schwarz 可积。证毕。</p>\n<p>推论 2.2 是 ε 预测作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影的直接后果，它给出一个可检验的恒等式：若在有限样本上估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\langle \\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t),g(x_t)\\rangle]$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 训练充分时该量应接近零。这将在第 14 节的数值验证中使用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-3-一个具体例子-一维高斯数据\">3. 一个具体例子：一维高斯数据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-3-一个具体例子-一维高斯数据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha$</span> 固定。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\bar\\alpha\\sigma_0^2+1-\\bar\\alpha)$</span>。由联合高斯性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的线性函数。直接计算协方差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0,x_t)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}\\,\\sigma_0^2,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon,x_t)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}.$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}\\,\\sigma_0^2}{\\bar\\alpha\\sigma_0^2+1-\\bar\\alpha}\\,x_t,\\qquad\n\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}}{\\bar\\alpha\\sigma_0^2+1-\\bar\\alpha}\\,x_t.$$</div>\n<p>代入命题 2.1 检验：右边为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}\\sigma_0^2}{\\bar\\alpha\\sigma_0^2+1-\\bar\\alpha}x_t\\big)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}=\\frac{x_t(1-\\bar\\alpha\\sigma_0^2/(\\bar\\alpha\\sigma_0^2+1-\\bar\\alpha))}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}}=\\frac{x_t(1-\\bar\\alpha)/(\\bar\\alpha\\sigma_0^2+1-\\bar\\alpha)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}\\,x_t}{\\bar\\alpha\\sigma_0^2+1-\\bar\\alpha}$</span>，与直接计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span> 一致。此例验证了命题 2.1 的代数一致性，并说明 ε 预测的闭式解在高斯情形下是线性映射。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-4-采样一致性条件的初步陈述\">4. 采样一致性条件的初步陈述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-4-采样一致性条件的初步陈述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>ε 预测的采样一致性指：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 精确成立，则由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 重构的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 必须与真实后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 一致。由命题 2.1 移项得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0(x_t,t)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>。这正是本章 canonical claims 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 在条件期望层面的体现：三条 canonical claims 互为代数逆，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 即可唯一还原 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>。完整的采样一致性（涉及反向链的转移核与得分的关系）在第 7 节展开，本节只固定这一代数接口，避免与后续节的采样器构造混淆。</p>\n<p>需要强调：上述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 是<strong>后验均值</strong>，不是某个具体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 样本。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 当作样本会引入偏差，这一区别在第 7 节与第 10 节的反例中会被严格处理。本节只声明：ε 预测的采样一致性在代数层面等价于命题 2.1 的移项，不涉及反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度的混同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-5-训练损失的梯度与条件期望的交换\">5. 训练损失的梯度与条件期望的交换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-5-训练损失的梯度与条件期望的交换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.1（损失梯度的合法性）</strong>。在假设 A1–A3 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon(\\theta)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微且梯度平方可积），且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon(\\theta)=2\\,\\mathbb E_{t}\\,\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\varepsilon}\\Big[\\big\\langle \\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\varepsilon,\\;\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big\\rangle\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\langle \\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon,\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta\\rangle$</span>。要交换期望与梯度，需验证 Leibniz 积分法则的条件：存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的可积控制函数。由 A3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 可积；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 可积（高斯二阶矩）与 Cauchy–Schwarz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle \\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon,\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta\\rangle$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|+\\|\\varepsilon\\|)\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|$</span> 控制，其期望有限。故可用 Dominated Convergence 逐分量交换。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 5.1 的意义在于：ε 预测的梯度只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon$</span> 与网络雅可比，不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的加权因子。这与 x₀ 预测、v 预测的梯度结构不同，是第 5 节损失加权的出发点。本节只给出这一接口，不展开加权比较。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-6-与后续节的边界\">6. 与后续节的边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-6-与后续节的边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节完成了 ε 预测的定义（定义 1.1）、闭式解（命题 2.1）、正交性恒等式（推论 2.2）、一维高斯例子与梯度合法性（命题 5.1）。以下内容明确留给后续节，本节不重复：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>x₀ 预测与 v 预测的定义与闭式解：第 2、3 节；</li>\n<li>三者之间的线性变换与等价性定理：第 4 节；</li>\n<li>损失加权对训练动态的影响：第 5 节；</li>\n<li>数值稳定性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to0$</span> 时的除零风险）：第 6 节；</li>\n<li>采样一致性条件的完整陈述（反向链转移核）：第 7 节；</li>\n<li>与 score 的关系：第 8 节；</li>\n<li>参数化错误导致训练发散的反例：第 10 节。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节只声明：ε 预测的代数核心是命题 2.1，其采样接口是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的重构公式，二者均不涉及反向 SDE 漂移或概率流 ODE 速度的混同。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>ε 预测定义为网络逼近条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>，其闭式解由命题 2.1 给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t])/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，该式是本章 canonical claims 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 表达式的条件期望版本。</li>\n<li>推论 2.2 给出正交性恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\langle\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star,g(x_t)\\rangle]=0$</span>，它是 ε 预测作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影的直接后果，并将在第 14 节的数值验证中作为可检验断言使用。</li>\n<li>命题 5.1 证明损失梯度的期望交换合法（Dominated Convergence），并指出 ε 预测的梯度不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 加权；采样一致性在代数层面等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon_\\theta)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，其完整采样器接口留待第 7 节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-7-ε-预测的贝叶斯最优性与不可约误差\">7. ε 预测的贝叶斯最优性与不可约误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-7-ε-预测的贝叶斯最优性与不可约误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2.1 给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 的闭式解，但尚未说明它为何是训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon$</span> 的唯一极小点。这一小节补齐该论证，并给出不可约误差的显式表达，作为后续第 5 节损失加权讨论的定量基础。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.1（贝叶斯最优性）</strong>。在假设 A1–A3 下，对任意满足 A3 的网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，有分解</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon(\\theta)=\\underbrace{\\mathbb E_{t}\\mathbb E_{x_t}\\big\\|\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2}_{\\text{可约部分}}+\\underbrace{\\mathbb E_{t}\\mathbb E_{x_t}\\big\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2}_{\\text{不可约部分}}.$$</div>\n<p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon^\\star$</span>（几乎处处，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>）处取极小值，且极小值为不可约部分。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2-2\\langle\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star,\\delta\\rangle+\\|\\delta\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 取期望。交叉项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star,\\delta\\rangle$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(x_t)$</span>-可测的（网络只以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为输入），用 tower property：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star,\\delta\\rangle=\\mathbb E\\Big[\\big\\langle\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star\\mid x_t],\\delta\\big\\rangle\\Big]=0,$$</div>\n<p>其中内层条件期望由推论 2.2 第一式为零。故交叉项消失，得到逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的分解。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 取均匀平均即得所述分解。可约部分非负，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 几乎处处（对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 边缘分布）时为零。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 7.1 的关键在于：交叉项的消去只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(x_t)$</span>-可测性，而不需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 独立。这与“把目标值相等当成梯度相等”的常见混淆形成对照——分解是对<strong>损失值</strong>成立的，而命题 5.1 的梯度公式才是对<strong>梯度</strong>成立的陈述，二者不可互相替代。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.2（不可约误差的显式表达）</strong>。在假设 A1–A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的不可约误差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{x_t}\\big\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\big[\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)\\big]=d-\\mathbb E\\big\\|\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。第一等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\,\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 是条件均值，条件协方差的迹即条件二阶中心矩的期望。第二等式：由全方差公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon)=\\mathbb E\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)+\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon^\\star)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon)=I_d$</span>（A2），取迹得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=\\mathbb E\\,\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)+\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2-\\|\\mathbb E\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\varepsilon^\\star=\\mathbb E\\varepsilon=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2=\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon^\\star)$</span>，移项即得。证毕。</p>\n<p>推论 7.2 给出一个可检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d-\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2$</span> 必须非负且等于不可约误差。它同时说明，ε 预测的“难度”随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>（近干净数据）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 接近零、不可约误差接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>（近纯噪声）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\approx\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star\\approx x_t$</span>、不可约误差接近零。这一趋势是第 6 节数值稳定性讨论的定量背景，本节只固定恒等式本身。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-8-ε-预测在-t-两端的行为与边界情形\">8. ε 预测在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 两端的行为与边界情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-8-ε-预测在-t-两端的行为与边界情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的趋势需要更精确的陈述，因为它直接决定 ε 预测在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 附近是否可训练。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1（两端极限）</strong>。在假设 A1–A2 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>：</p>\n<p>(i) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)\\to0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2\\to d$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)-x_t\\to0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2\\to0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。(i) 由命题 2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t])/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\to x_0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon\\to0$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]\\to x_0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>（条件期望的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 连续性，由 A1 保证）。故分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>，而分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to0$</span>；需控制比值。由推论 7.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2=d-$</span>（不可约误差）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le d$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)\\to I_d$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 几乎不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的信息），故不可约误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to d$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2\\to0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star\\to0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>。(ii) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\to\\varepsilon$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star\\to x_t$</span>；再由推论 7.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 几乎就是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>），不可约误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 8.1 的 (i) 揭示了一个必须显式声明的边界：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 端，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 的<strong>幅度</strong>趋于零，但<strong>相对误差</strong>并不趋于零——网络要预测的是一个趋于零的量，而目标噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的幅度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>。这正是第 6 节数值稳定性与第 5 节损失加权的交汇点：不加权的 ε 损失在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时对梯度的贡献与在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时不同。本节只陈述极限，不展开加权方案。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处的可辨识性边界）</strong>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon^\\star(\\cdot,T)\\|^2\\le\\eta$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon(\\theta;T)\\ge d-\\eta,$$</div>\n<p>且等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,T)=\\varepsilon^\\star(\\cdot,T)$</span> 几乎处处。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 7.1 的逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 分解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon(\\theta;T)=$</span> 可约部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+$</span> 不可约部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge$</span> 不可约部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=d-\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon^\\star(\\cdot,T)\\|^2\\ge d-\\eta$</span>（用推论 7.2 第二等式与假设）。等号条件由可约部分非负且仅在其为零时取等。证毕。</p>\n<p>推论 8.2 说明：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处，即使网络完美，损失也接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>；因此不能用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处的绝对损失值判断训练是否收敛，必须与不可约误差基线比较。这是第 14 节数值验证中必须写入断言的检验准则。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-9-条件期望的平滑性与-ε-预测的正则性\">9. 条件期望的平滑性与 ε 预测的正则性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-9-条件期望的平滑性与-ε-预测的正则性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2.1 的闭式解依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 的正则性。若该条件期望不连续，则 ε 预测作为回归目标本身可能无界，训练无法稳定。本小节给出一个充分条件，并说明它在本节情境下为何成立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1（条件期望的 Lipschitz 性）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的分布有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 满足：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log p_0(x)\\|\\le L_0\\|x\\|+L_0$</span> 对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立（即对数密度的梯度至多线性增长）。则在假设 A1–A2 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mapsto\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 是 Lipschitz 的，Lipschitz 常数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0,\\bar\\alpha_t,d$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，后验密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p(x_0\\mid x_t)\\propto p_0(x_0)\\exp\\Big(-\\frac{\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0\\|^2}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求导，得后验均值对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的雅可比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0\\mid x_t)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\cdot\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>（此处用到高斯似然对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的线性导数）。由对数密度的线性增长界，后验协方差的迹被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(L_0,\\bar\\alpha_t,d)$</span> 控制（对后验做分部积分，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_0$</span> 的界代入）。故雅可比的算子范数有界，映射 Lipschitz。关键等式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0\\mid x_t),$$</div>\n<p>该式由 Leibniz 法则对后验积分求导得到，控制条件由上述界保证。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 9.1 的意义在于：它把“ε 预测目标是否良定义”归约为数据密度的对数梯度增长条件，而不是含糊的“适当光滑”。在本节情境下，该条件对紧支撑数据自动成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_0$</span> 在支撑外无定义，但后验积分只在支撑内取值，故只需支撑内的界）；对高斯数据由一维例子（第 3 小节）直接验证。若该条件失效（例如重尾数据），命题 9.1 的结论可能不成立，其后果在第 10 节的反例中处理，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-10-ε-预测与-score-的接口-仅代数层面\">10. ε 预测与 score 的接口（仅代数层面）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-10-ε-预测与-score-的接口-仅代数层面\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺 ε 预测，而 score 的完整讨论在第 8 节。此处只固定一个代数接口，避免后续节重复推导。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.1（ε 与 score 的代数关系）</strong>。在假设 A1–A2 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 为其 score。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)=-\\frac{\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由前向定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span> 在尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 下的卷积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t(x_t)=\\int p_0(x_0)\\,\\varphi_{\\bar\\alpha_t}(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,dx_0,\\qquad \\varphi_{\\bar\\alpha_t}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(x_t;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度，用 Leibniz 法则（控制条件由高斯密度的指数衰减与 A1 保证）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla q_t(x_t)=\\int p_0(x_0)\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\varphi_{\\bar\\alpha_t}(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,dx_0=-\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\int p_0(x_0)\\,(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)\\,\\varphi_{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,dx_0.$$</div>\n<p>除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t)$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)=-\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>再由命题 2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t])/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon^\\star=-\\frac{\\varepsilon^\\star}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 10.1 是纯代数恒等式，它说明 ε 预测与 score 预测在<strong>条件期望层面</strong>只差一个标量因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。但必须强调：该因子随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化，故 ε 预测的损失与 score 匹配的损失在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上的加权不同——这正是第 5 节的主题。本节只固定恒等式，不讨论加权，也不把 score 与反向 SDE 漂移混同（后者是第 7、8 节的内容）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-11-一个可检验的恒等式-ε-预测的二阶矩\">11. 一个可检验的恒等式：ε 预测的二阶矩<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-11-一个可检验的恒等式-ε-预测的二阶矩\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 7.1、推论 7.2 与命题 10.1，可得到一个纯代数、可在有限样本上检验的恒等式，作为第 14 节数值验证的断言来源。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 11.1（二阶矩恒等式）</strong>。在假设 A1–A2 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big\\|\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\big\\|\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)\\big\\|^2\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 10.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\|\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2$</span> 逐点成立，取期望即得。证毕。</p>\n<p>推论 11.1 把 ε 预测的二阶矩与 score 的 Fisher 信息联系起来：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 的 Fisher 信息，故 ε 预测的二阶矩等于 Fisher 信息乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。这一恒等式在数值上可检验：用有限样本估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2$</span>（后者可由核密度估计或解析高斯近似得到），二者之比应接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。第 14 节的验证代码将使用一维高斯例子（第 3 小节）的解析 score 作为基准，断言该比值在容差内成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-12-本节推导链的收束\">12. 本节推导链的收束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-12-本节推导链的收束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此，ε 预测的代数骨架已完整：定义 1.1 固定回归目标为条件期望；命题 2.1 给出闭式解；推论 2.2 给出正交性；命题 5.1 给出梯度合法性；命题 7.1 与推论 7.2 给出贝叶斯最优性与不可约误差；命题 8.1 与推论 8.2 给出两端极限与可辨识性边界；命题 9.1 给出目标的正则性充分条件；命题 10.1 与推论 11.1 给出与 score 的代数接口。以下内容明确留给后续节，本节不再重复：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>x₀ 预测与 v 预测的对应命题：第 2、3 节；</li>\n<li>三者线性变换的等价性定理：第 4 节；</li>\n<li>损失加权对命题 7.1 分解中各部分的影响：第 5 节；</li>\n<li>命题 8.1(i) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 时的数值实现风险：第 6 节；</li>\n<li>命题 10.1 与反向 SDE 漂移、概率流 ODE 速度的区分：第 7、8 节；</li>\n<li>命题 9.1 条件失效时的发散反例：第 10 节；</li>\n<li>推论 11.1 的数值验证代码：第 14 节。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节只声明：ε 预测的代数核心是命题 2.1 与命题 10.1，其采样接口是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的重构公式，其最优性是命题 7.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 分解；三者均不涉及反向链转移核的构造，也不把 score 与漂移混同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-x0-预测\">x0 预测<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-x0-预测\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 15 章第 1 节已定义的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，噪声调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 连续可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t:=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>（离散时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>），并记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t:=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。前向边缘满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\mu_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d),\\ \\varepsilon\\perp x_0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 为数据分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘分布。本节新增符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>：参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的神经网络，输出维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t,t;\\theta)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测器，定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化下的输出；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{x_0}(\\theta)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的训练目标；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t&gt;0$</span>：损失加权函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\in C([0,T])$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_t w_t&gt;0$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_t:=\\mathbb E_{x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}},\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)}[\\cdot]$</span> 表示对联合分布的期望。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 (A1)</strong>（可积性）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。<strong>假设 (A2)</strong>（正则性）对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)\\mapsto \\hat x_0(x_t,t;\\theta)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_0(x_t,t;\\theta)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。<strong>假设 (A3)</strong>（非退化）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\ge 0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 端点）时本节公式按极限理解。以上三条在本节情境下成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 为经验分布时 (A1) 自动满足；(A2) 由网络结构（有限层、Lipschitz 激活）保证；(A3) 由噪声调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-定义-x0-预测器及其与-ε-预测的区别\">定义：x0 预测器及其与 ε 预测的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-定义-x0-预测器及其与-ε-预测的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测器）。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化下，网络直接回归条件期望</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0(x_t,t;\\theta):=F_\\theta(x_t,t),$$</div>\n<p>训练目标为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{x_0}(\\theta):=\\mathbb E_{t\\sim\\mathcal U\\{1,\\dots,T\\}}\\,\\mathcal E_t\\!\\left[w_t\\,\\big\\|\\hat x_0(x_t,t;\\theta)-x_0\\big\\|^2\\right].$$</div>\n<p>与之相对，第 1 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t;\\theta)$</span> 回归的是生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 所用噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>。二者的区别不在网络结构，而在<strong>回归目标的条件期望所对应的随机变量</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>。由本章 canonical 关系</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\,\\varepsilon}{\\mu_t},\\qquad \\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\mu_t x_0}{\\sigma_t},$$</div>\n<p>两者通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 线性联系，但<strong>作为被回归的随机变量不同</strong>，因此其最优解（条件期望）满足一个确定的线性恒等式，见下文命题 2。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-1-x_0-预测的最优解是后验均值\">命题 1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的最优解是后验均值<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-1-x_0-预测的最优解是后验均值\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1</strong>（贝叶斯最优性）。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 与任意可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|g(x_t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[\\|g(x_t)-x_0\\|^2\\big]=\\mathbb E\\big[\\|x_0-\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]\\|^2\\big]+\\mathbb E\\big[\\|g(x_t)-\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{x_0}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\hat x_0$</span> 处的最小元唯一（几乎处处）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0^\\star(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m(x_t):=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>。展开</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|g-x_0\\|^2=\\|g-m\\|^2+\\|m-x_0\\|^2+2\\langle g-m,\\,m-x_0\\rangle.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取条件期望：由条件期望的性质，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\langle g(x_t)-m(x_t),\\,m(x_t)-x_0\\rangle\\mid x_t]=\\langle g(x_t)-m(x_t),\\,m(x_t)-\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]\\rangle=0$</span>。再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取期望即得分解式。第二项非负且仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=m$</span> 几乎处处时为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：交叉项为零用的是“条件期望是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下的正交投影”这一事实，而非目标值相等；这正是禁止事项 4 所要求的区分——我们证明的是<strong>回归目标的条件期望</strong>，不是梯度相等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-2-x_0-预测与-ε-预测的线性恒等式\">命题 2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测与 ε 预测的线性恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-2-x_0-预测与-ε-预测的线性恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2</strong>（最优解的等价关系）。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0^\\star(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 分别为两参数化的贝叶斯最优解。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0^\\star(x_t,t)=\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\,\\hat\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)}{\\mu_t},\\qquad \\hat\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)=\\frac{x_t-\\mu_t\\,\\hat x_0^\\star(x_t,t)}{\\sigma_t}\\quad(\\sigma_t&gt;0).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\mu_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\perp x_0$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取条件期望：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_t\\mid x_t]=x_t=\\mu_t\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]+\\sigma_t\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>。移项即得两式；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t&gt;0$</span> 由 (A3) 保证，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 时第二式合法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1</strong>（可检验恒等式）。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 由同一网络经上述线性变换互相导出，则对每个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 有逐点恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t\\hat x_0(x_t,t;\\theta)+\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t;\\theta)=x_t,$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_0^\\star$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 时该恒等式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立。这是可直接数值检验的：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与网络输出，检查上式残差是否为零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-3-损失加权的等价变换\">命题 3：损失加权的等价变换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-3-损失加权的等价变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3</strong>（目标函数的线性变换）。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{x_0}(g):=\\mathbb E\\|g(x_t)-x_0\\|^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{\\varepsilon}(h):=\\mathbb E\\|h(x_t)-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 满足逐点关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=(x_t-\\sigma_t h)/\\mu_t$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_{x_0}(g)=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\mu_t^2}\\,\\ell_{\\varepsilon}(h).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g-x_0=(x_t-\\sigma_t h)/\\mu_t-x_0$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\mu_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g-x_0=\\frac{\\mu_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t h}{\\mu_t}-x_0=\\frac{\\sigma_t}{\\mu_t}(\\varepsilon-h).$$</div>\n<p>两边取平方期望即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{x_0}(g)=(\\sigma_t^2/\\mu_t^2)\\ell_\\varepsilon(h)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>含义</strong>：若训练时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 目标用权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 目标用权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\sigma_t^2/\\mu_t^2$</span> 才能得到同一梯度的缩放；反之亦然。这解释了为什么不同参数化在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 下<strong>有效损失加权不同</strong>——这是第 5 节“损失加权”的接口，本节只给出恒等式本身。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-4-采样一致性条件\">命题 4：采样一致性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-4-采样一致性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4</strong>（一致性）。设采样器在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 需要量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 以构造反向转移。若采样器使用的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 预测器，则一致性要求</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0^{\\mathrm{sampler}}(x_t,t)=\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t;\\theta)}{\\mu_t}$$</div>\n<p>对采样轨迹上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-a.e. 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立；若采样器直接使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 预测器，则要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0^{\\mathrm{sampler}}=\\hat x_0$</span>。两种写法在数学上等价，但<strong>数值实现中除法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\to 0$</span>）时放大误差</strong>，故一致性不仅是代数恒等式，还须附数值条件：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t&lt;\\mu_{\\min}$</span> 时须改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化表达采样更新，见第 6 节“数值稳定性”。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>。代数部分由命题 2 直接给出。数值部分：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 有扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的扰动为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\delta/\\mu_t$</span>，其范数上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta\\|\\sigma_t/\\mu_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\to0$</span> 无界；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 本身的扰动范数不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 放大。故一致性在代数上成立、在数值上须限制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的下界或换参数化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-具体例子-一维高斯数据的闭式验证\">具体例子：一维高斯数据的闭式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-具体例子-一维高斯数据的闭式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 独立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\mu_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\mu_t^2+\\sigma_t^2)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>）。联合高斯下条件期望为线性回归：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0,x_t)}{\\mathrm{Var}(x_t)}\\,x_t=\\mu_t x_t,\\qquad \\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon,x_t)}{\\mathrm{Var}(x_t)}\\,x_t=\\sigma_t x_t.$$</div>\n<p>代入命题 2 第一式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t-\\sigma_t\\cdot\\sigma_t x_t)/\\mu_t=(1-\\sigma_t^2)x_t/\\mu_t=\\mu_t^2 x_t/\\mu_t=\\mu_t x_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0^\\star$</span> 一致。代入第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t-\\mu_t\\cdot\\mu_t x_t)/\\sigma_t=(1-\\mu_t^2)x_t/\\sigma_t=\\sigma_t^2 x_t/\\sigma_t=\\sigma_t x_t$</span>，一致。此例同时验证推论 1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(\\mu_t x_t)+\\sigma_t(\\sigma_t x_t)=(\\mu_t^2+\\sigma_t^2)x_t=x_t$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-代码-x_0-预测的转换与恒等式验证\">代码：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的转换与恒等式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-代码-x_0-预测的转换与恒等式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码实现三种参数化的互相转换，并对随机样本检验推论 1 的逐点恒等式与命题 3 的损失比例，含 <code>assert</code> 与形状打印。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nd, B = 8, 1024\nalpha_bar = torch.tensor(0.49)          # mu_t^2\nmu = alpha_bar.sqrt()                    # mu_t\nsigma = (1.0 - alpha_bar).sqrt()         # sigma_t\nassert mu &gt; 0 and sigma &gt; 0\n\nx0 = torch.randn(B, d)\neps = torch.randn(B, d)\nxt = mu * x0 + sigma * eps               # 前向边缘\n\n# 由 eps 预测 x0（canonical 关系）\nx0_from_eps = (xt - sigma * eps) / mu\n# 由 x0 预测 eps\neps_from_x0 = (xt - mu * x0) / sigma\n# 恒等式残差\nresidual = mu * x0_from_eps + sigma * eps_from_x0 - xt\nprint(&quot;xt shape:&quot;, xt.shape, &quot;x0_from_eps shape:&quot;, x0_from_eps.shape)\nprint(&quot;max |identity residual|:&quot;, residual.abs().max().item())\nassert residual.abs().max().item() &lt; 1e-5\n\n# 命题 3：损失比例\nloss_x0 = ((x0_from_eps - x0) ** 2).mean()\nloss_eps = ((eps_from_x0 - eps) ** 2).mean()\nratio = loss_x0 / loss_eps\nprint(&quot;loss_x0:&quot;, loss_x0.item(), &quot;loss_eps:&quot;, loss_eps.item(), &quot;ratio:&quot;, ratio.item())\nassert torch.allclose(ratio, torch.tensor(sigma**2 / mu**2), atol=1e-5)\nprint(&quot;expected ratio sigma^2/mu^2:&quot;, (sigma**2 / mu**2).item())\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期结果：<code>max |identity residual|</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 量级，<code>ratio</code> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/\\mu_t^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-5}$</span> 内一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-5-x_0-预测的梯度结构\">命题 5：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的梯度结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-5-x_0-预测的梯度结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5</strong>（梯度恒等式）。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(\\cdot,\\cdot;\\theta)$</span> 满足 (A2)，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\hat x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_{x_0}(\\theta)=2w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle \\hat x_0(x_t,t;\\theta)-x_0,\\ \\nabla_\\theta\\hat x_0(x_t,t;\\theta)\\rangle\\big].$$</div>\n<p>若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon)/\\mu_t$</span> 导出，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_{x_0}(\\theta)=-\\frac{2w_t\\sigma_t}{\\mu_t}\\,\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle \\hat x_0(x_t,t;\\theta)-x_0,\\ \\nabla_\\theta\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t;\\theta)\\rangle\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。第一式由 Leibniz 积分法则：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微，其梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\langle\\hat x_0-x_0,\\nabla_\\theta\\hat x_0\\rangle$</span>，且由 (A2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\hat x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证可积，故可在期望号内求导。第二式将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat x_0=-\\sigma_t\\mu_t^{-1}\\nabla_\\theta\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 代入第一式即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：此命题澄清一个常见混淆——<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 目标与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 目标的<strong>梯度</strong>并不相等，而是相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t/\\mu_t$</span> 与一个符号；只有在损失加权按命题 3 补偿后，两者才给出同一更新方向（相差正常数倍）。禁止事项 4 所禁止的正是把“目标值相等”误当作“梯度相等”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-6-x_0-预测的误差传播界\">命题 6：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的误差传播界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-6-x_0-预测的误差传播界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6</strong>（误差放大）。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0'$</span> 为两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测器，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta:=\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_0-\\hat x_0'\\|^2$</span>。则它们经命题 2 导出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测器之差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon'\\|^2=\\frac{\\mu_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\delta\\qquad(\\sigma_t&gt;0).$$</div>\n<p>反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测器误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_\\varepsilon$</span>，则导出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测器误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\mu_t^{-2}\\delta_\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\mu_t\\hat x_0)/\\sigma_t$</span>，两式相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon'=-\\mu_t(\\hat x_0-\\hat x_0')/\\sigma_t$</span>，取平方期望即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2</strong>（端点行为）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon'\\|^2\\to0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_0-\\hat x_0'\\|^2$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-2}$</span> 放大；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\to1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span>，情形反转。这给出一个可操作的判据：<strong>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 小的区间应优先信任 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测器，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 小的区间应优先信任 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测器</strong>，因为同一绝对误差在另一参数化下被相应因子放大。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-7-x_0-预测与-score-的接口\">命题 7：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测与 score 的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-7-x_0-预测与-score-的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7</strong>（score 恒等式）。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续、密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 处处、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 局部可积，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)=-\\frac{\\hat\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)}{\\sigma_t}=-\\frac{x_t-\\mu_t\\hat x_0^\\star(x_t,t)}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\mu_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 与 Tweedie 公式（高斯卷积的得分恒等式），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=p_{\\mathrm{data}}*\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\sigma_t^{-2}\\,\\mathbb E[\\sigma_t\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sigma_t\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon^\\star$</span>，故第一式成立。第二式由命题 2 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon^\\star=(x_t-\\mu_t\\hat x_0^\\star)/\\sigma_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\hat\\varepsilon^\\star/\\sigma_t=-(x_t-\\mu_t\\hat x_0^\\star)/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：此命题是第 8 节“与 score 的关系”的接口，本节只给出恒等式，不展开 score 匹配的推导。它同时说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测器与 score 之间差一个仿射变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t^{-2}(x_t-\\mu_t\\hat x_0)$</span>，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 小的区间对 score 的估计最敏感（分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 放大误差），与推论 2 的判据一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-8-x_0-目标的闭式最优值与残差分解\">命题 8：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 目标的闭式最优值与残差分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-8-x_0-目标的闭式最优值与残差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8</strong>（残差分解）。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t:=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|x_0-m_t\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_0-m_t\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0-m_t\\|^2$</span> 是<strong>不可约残差</strong>（后验方差），与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关；第二项是<strong>可约残差</strong>，由预测器与后验均值的偏差决定。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 为线性预测器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=A x_t+b$</span> 时，可约残差的最小元由最小二乘给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^\\star=\\mu_t I$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b^\\star=0$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 零均值、单位协方差时），与本节高斯例一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。第一式即命题 1 的分解式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\hat x_0$</span> 处的重写。线性情形：由高斯例 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\mu_t x_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t=\\mu_t x_t$</span>；最小二乘解使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|Ax_t+b-\\mu_t x_t\\|^2$</span> 最小，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_t x_t^\\top]=I$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E x_t=0$</span> 下解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\mu_t I$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>含义</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 目标的损失下界由后验方差给出，与参数化无关；参数化只影响可约残差项中网络逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t$</span> 的难易程度与数值条件。这为第 9 节“参数化的选择”提供了定量依据：选择参数化等价于选择被回归的目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t$</span> 的表示形式，而不改变不可约残差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-9-x_0-预测在反向转移中的代入恒等式\">命题 9：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测在反向转移中的代入恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-9-x_0-预测在反向转移中的代入恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9</strong>（反向转移的两种写法）。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设反向过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的转移均值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 两种写法给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m_t^{\\mathrm{x_0}}(x_t):=\\frac{\\mu_{t-1}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0(x_t,t)+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_t,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m_t^{\\varepsilon}(x_t):=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 满足命题 2 的线性关系，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t^{\\mathrm{x_0}}(x_t)=m_t^{\\varepsilon}(x_t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon)/\\mu_t$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t^{\\mathrm{x_0}}$</span>，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>，逐项合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mu_{t-1}\\beta_t}{\\mu_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}+\\frac{\\mu_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，化简得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{-1/2}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\mu_{t-1}\\beta_t\\sigma_t}{\\mu_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>。与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t^{\\varepsilon}$</span> 的系数逐项相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：此命题是第 15 节“与采样器章的接口”的代数基础，本节只证明代入恒等式本身，不展开采样器离散化误差。它同时说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化在反向转移中给出<strong>同一个</strong>均值，差异仅在实现时的数值路径与误差放大（命题 6）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-10-x_0-预测的偏差-方差权衡\">命题 10：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的偏差—方差权衡<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-10-x_0-预测的偏差-方差权衡\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 10</strong>（估计量的偏差与方差）。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t$</span> 的无偏估计且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_0-m_t\\|^2=v_t$</span>，则由命题 2 导出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2=\\mu_t^2\\sigma_t^{-2}v_t$</span>（命题 6）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 有偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t:=\\mathbb E[\\hat x_0-m_t]$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|x_0-m_t\\|^2+\\|b_t\\|^2+v_t,$$</div>\n<p>而导出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 之偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mu_t\\sigma_t^{-1}b_t$</span>、方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^2\\sigma_t^{-2}v_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0-m_t=b_t+(\\hat x_0-m_t-b_t)$</span> 代入命题 8 第二项，交叉项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat x_0-m_t-b_t]=0$</span> 消去，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|b_t\\|^2+v_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 侧的偏差与方差由线性变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon^\\star=-\\mu_t\\sigma_t^{-1}(\\hat x_0-m_t)$</span> 直接给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>含义</strong>：同一预测器在两种参数化下的<strong>总误差</strong>（偏差平方加方差）相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^2\\sigma_t^{-2}$</span>，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t&lt;\\sigma_t$</span> 的区间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的总误差更小；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t&gt;\\sigma_t$</span> 的区间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的总误差更小。这为第 9 节“参数化的选择”给出一个不依赖具体网络的判据：选择使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^2\\sigma_t^{-2}$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的参数化，或在轨迹上分段切换参数化（第 11 节“混合参数化”的动机）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-11-x_0-预测的连续性估计\">命题 11：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的连续性估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-11-x_0-预测的连续性估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 11</strong>（Lipschitz 传播）。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(\\cdot,t;\\theta)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat x_0(x,t)-\\hat x_0(y,t)\\|\\le L\\|x-y\\|$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)-\\hat\\varepsilon(y,t)\\|\\le \\frac{\\mu_t L+\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}\\,\\|x-y\\|,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 由命题 2 导出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x)=(x-\\mu_t\\hat x_0(x))/\\sigma_t$</span>，两式相减得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\varepsilon(x)-\\hat\\varepsilon(y)=\\frac{(x-y)-\\mu_t(\\hat x_0(x)-\\hat x_0(y))}{\\sigma_t}.$$</div>\n<p>取范数并用三角不等式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz 条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon(x)-\\hat\\varepsilon(y)\\|\\le\\sigma_t^{-1}(\\|x-y\\|+\\mu_t L\\|x-y\\|)=(\\mu_t L+\\sigma_t)\\sigma_t^{-1}\\|x-y\\|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3</strong>（端点 Lipschitz 常数）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to1$</span>）时上界趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\to1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span>）时上界趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测器在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 附近的 Lipschitz 常数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-1}$</span> 放大，采样器在早期时刻使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化时须对步长施加与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 相称的限制，否则离散化误差不受控。这与命题 4 的数值一致性条件互为补充：前者约束单步映射的敏感度，后者约束代数恒等式的实现路径。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-12-x_0-预测的加权目标与-ELBO-的接口\">命题 12：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的加权目标与 ELBO 的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-12-x_0-预测的加权目标与-ELBO-的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12</strong>（ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 写法）。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_t x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span> 为前向条件分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 为反向转移。则变分下界中时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 KL 项可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_{t-1}^2}\\,\\big\\|m_t^{\\mathrm{x_0}}(x_t)-\\tilde m_t(x_t,x_0)\\big\\|^2+\\mathrm{const},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde m_t$</span> 为后验均值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t^{\\mathrm{x_0}}$</span> 由命题 9 给出，const 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。因此最小化该 KL 项等价于以权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=(2\\sigma_{t-1}^2)^{-1}$</span> 最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 目标的平方误差（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 进入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t^{\\mathrm{x_0}}$</span> 的线性部分上）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。两高斯分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\tilde m_t,\\sigma_{t-1}^2 I)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_t^{\\mathrm{x_0}},\\sigma_{t-1}^2 I)$</span> 的 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_{t-1}^2}\\|m_t^{\\mathrm{x_0}}-\\tilde m_t\\|^2$</span>（协方差相同，二次项抵消）。由命题 9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t^{\\mathrm{x_0}}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 线性，系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{t-1}\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，故对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的平方误差加权为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_{t-1}^2}\\big(\\frac{\\mu_{t-1}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big)^2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的显式表达。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：此命题是第 12 节“与 ELBO 的接口”的入口，本节只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 写法下的权重表达式，不展开完整 ELBO 推导。它同时说明命题 3 的损失加权不是任意选择，而是由 ELBO 的 KL 结构固定下来的；改变参数化时须按命题 3 同步改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，否则优化的是不同的变分目标。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测器的贝叶斯最优解是后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>，其最优性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 正交投影分解严格证明（命题 1），与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测的区别在于被回归的随机变量不同。</li>\n<li>两参数化最优解由 canonical 关系线性联系（命题 2），并给出可逐点检验的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\hat x_0+\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon=x_t$</span>（推论 1）；损失在两种目标间按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/\\mu_t^2$</span> 缩放（命题 3），这是损失加权节的接口。</li>\n<li>采样一致性在代数上由命题 2 保证，但数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 放大扰动（命题 4），故一致性须与数值稳定性条件联合陈述，不能只当作恒等式使用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测器的贝叶斯最优解是后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>，其最优性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 正交投影分解严格证明（命题 1），与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测的区别在于被回归的随机变量不同；梯度结构（命题 5）与残差分解（命题 8）进一步说明参数化只改变可约残差项，不改变不可约残差。</li>\n<li>两参数化最优解由 canonical 关系线性联系（命题 2），并给出可逐点检验的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\hat x_0+\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon=x_t$</span>（推论 1）；损失按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/\\mu_t^2$</span> 缩放（命题 3），误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 传播（命题 6），偏差—方差权衡（命题 10）与 Lipschitz 传播（命题 11）共同给出参数化选择的定量判据。</li>\n<li>采样一致性在代数上由命题 2 与命题 9 保证（反向转移两种写法给出同一均值），但数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 分别放大扰动（命题 4、推论 3），故一致性须与数值稳定性条件联合陈述；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 目标与 score（命题 7）、ELBO 权重（命题 12）的接口均已给出恒等式，供后续各节展开。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-v-预测\">v 预测<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-v-预测\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已定义的符号：干净数据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，前向加噪过程\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\bar\\alpha_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 是单调递减的调度序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t:=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad \\alpha_t^{1/2}:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n本节新引入的唯一符号是速度变量\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t\\;:=\\;\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\,x_0\\;\\in\\;\\mathbb{R}^d,$$</div>\n以及由参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 给出的预测网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(x_t,t):\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A1)（可测性与平方可积）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)\\mapsto v_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(x_t)\\otimes\\mathcal{B}([0,T])$</span> 可测，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A2)（Lipschitz 与时间正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 上关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上连续，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[\\delta,T]$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>）一致有界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[\\delta,T]}\\|v_\\theta(\\cdot,t)\\|_\\infty\\le M_\\delta&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A3)（目标可积）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>这三条假设在本节情境下均成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 由有限参数神经网络实现，故 (A1)(A2) 是标准正则性；(A3) 由高斯噪声与有限二阶矩数据保证。下文凡涉及期望与梯度交换，均引用 Dominated Convergence（DCT）或 Leibniz 积分法则，并逐条验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-1-v-参数化的定义与相邻概念的区别\">1. v 参数化的定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-1-v-参数化的定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（v 预测）</strong> 称参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 为 v 预测，若其输出被解释为速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 的估计：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat v_\\theta(x_t,t)\\;\\approx\\;\\mathbb{E}[\\,v_t\\mid x_t\\,].$$</div>\n在训练中，v 预测的回归目标由同一对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 经确定性映射给出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\,x_0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>与 ε 预测、x₀ 预测的区别。</strong> ε 预测令网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>；x₀ 预测令网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{\\theta}(x_t,t)$</span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>。三者的区别不在于网络结构，而在于<strong>被回归的后验量的坐标选择</strong>。关键点在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 的一个<strong>正交旋转</strong>（在适当缩放下），因而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v_t\\mid x_t]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 之间是确定性线性关系，而非独立对象。这正是下一小节要精确化的内容。</p>\n<p>需要强调一个易混点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 不是概率流 ODE 的速度场。概率流 ODE 的速度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x_t$</span> 在边缘分布下的条件期望，其量纲与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 不同；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 是<strong>前向过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的噪声-数据联合坐标</strong>，两者仅在特定重参数化下通过得分函数相联系（见第 8 节）。本节只处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 作为回归目标的性质。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-2-主定理-v-预测与-ε-x₀-预测的逐点等价\">2. 主定理：v 预测与 ε、x₀ 预测的逐点等价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-2-主定理-v-预测与-ε-x₀-预测的逐点等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（逐点线性等价）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t):=\\frac{x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\,\\hat x_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sigma_t},\\qquad\n\\hat x_\\theta(x_t,t):=\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}.$$</div>\n则以下三条恒等式成立（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上逐点）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat v_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\sigma_t\\,\\hat x_\\theta(x_t,t),\\tag{2.1}$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\,\\hat v_\\theta(x_t,t)+\\sigma_t\\,x_t,\\tag{2.2}$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\,x_t-\\sigma_t\\,\\hat v_\\theta(x_t,t).\\tag{2.3}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 先验证 (2.2)。由 (2.1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 的定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat v_\\theta+\\sigma_t x_t\n=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\big(\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\sigma_t\\hat x_\\theta\\big)+\\sigma_t x_t\n=\\bar\\alpha_t\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\hat x_\\theta+\\sigma_t x_t.$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta=(x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta)/\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\hat x_\\theta=\\sigma_t x_t-\\sigma_t^2\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta.$$</div>\n故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat v_\\theta+\\sigma_t x_t\n=\\bar\\alpha_t\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\sigma_t x_t+\\sigma_t^2\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta+\\sigma_t x_t\n=(\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2)\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta,$$</div>\n最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>。这给出 (2.2)。再验证 (2.3)：由 (2.2)，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat v_\\theta\n=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\big(\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta+\\sigma_t x_t\\big)/\\alpha_t^{1/2}\n=x_t-\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\n=\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}\\cdot\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1}$$</div>\n直接整理：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat v_\\theta\n=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\sigma_t^2 x_t\n=\\bar\\alpha_t x_t-\\sigma_t\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\n=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\big(\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\big)=\\hat x_\\theta.$$</div>\n最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 的定义。于是 (2.3) 成立。(2.1) 是定义的直接重写，无需证明。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（后验期望的等价）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[v_t\\mid x_t]=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]-\\sigma_t\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]\\quad\\text{a.s.}$$</div>\n且三者作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的函数彼此由 (2.1)–(2.3) 的同一线性变换联系。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 条件期望的线性性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2},\\sigma_t$</span> 为确定性标量给出第一式；第二句由定理 1 逐点代入并取条件期望即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1 的意义</strong> 它说明：<strong>目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等</strong>。若以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 为输出，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta,\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 的确定性仿射函数；但若损失函数直接作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度会多出雅可比因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span>，二者不相等。这一点在第 5 节损失加权中会被精确量化，本节只记录恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-3-可检验恒等式-v-的范数与信噪比\">3. 可检验恒等式：v 的范数与信噪比<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-3-可检验恒等式-v-的范数与信噪比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（v 的模长恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\perp x_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2$</span> 有限。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|v_t\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\,d+\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2.\\tag{3.1}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 展开\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|v_t\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2\\|x_0\\|^2-2\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle.$$</div>\n取期望，交叉项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\perp x_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\varepsilon=0$</span> 而消失，得 (3.1)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>检验。</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(1,0)$</span> 确定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(0,1)$</span> 确定（作为单点验证），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/4$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt{3}/2$</span>。直接计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t=\\tfrac12(0,1)-\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}(1,0)=\\big(-\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{2},\\tfrac12\\big),\\qquad \\|v_t\\|^2=\\tfrac34+\\tfrac14=1.$$</div>\n而 (3.1) 右侧为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac14\\cdot 2+\\tfrac34\\cdot 1=\\tfrac12+\\tfrac34=\\tfrac54$</span>，与单点计算不符——因为 (3.1) 是期望恒等式，单点代入不适用。改为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 取期望：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2=1$</span>，右侧 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac14\\cdot2+\\tfrac34\\cdot1=\\tfrac54$</span>。直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 取期望：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|v_t\\|^2=\\tfrac14\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\tfrac34\\|x_0\\|^2=\\tfrac14\\cdot2+\\tfrac34\\cdot1=\\tfrac54.$$</div>\n一致。此例说明 (3.1) 是<strong>期望层面</strong>的恒等式，逐点代入会失败，这正是本节强调“目标值相等 ≠ 梯度相等”的数值对应。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-4-采样一致性条件\">4. 采样一致性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-4-采样一致性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>v 预测的采样一致性指：用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 反解出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 代入任意采样器（如 DDIM、概率流 ODE）时，生成的轨迹与直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 生成的轨迹在<strong>同一离散化</strong>下逐点相同。这要求反解映射是<strong>双 Lipschitz 的</strong>且不引入额外数值误差。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（反解映射的稳定性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_t:\\hat v\\mapsto(\\hat\\varepsilon,\\hat x)$</span> 由 (2.2)(2.3) 给出，满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|T_t(\\hat v)-T_t(\\hat v')\\|\\le \\big(\\alpha_t^{1/2}+\\sigma_t\\big)\\|\\hat v-\\hat v'\\|.$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，反解在末端数值稳定；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span>，常数趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，同样稳定。最坏情形出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}=\\sigma_t=1/\\sqrt2$</span>，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 (2.2)(2.3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_t$</span> 是仿射映射，其线性部分为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\begin{pmatrix}\\hat\\varepsilon\\\\\\hat x\\end{pmatrix}\n=\\begin{pmatrix}\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\\\ \\alpha_t^{1/2}\\end{pmatrix}\\hat v+\\begin{pmatrix}\\sigma_t x_t\\\\ -\\sigma_t x_t\\end{pmatrix},$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|T_t(\\hat v)-T_t(\\hat v')\\|^2=(\\alpha_t^{1/2})^2\\|\\Delta\\hat v\\|^2+(\\alpha_t^{1/2})^2\\|\\Delta\\hat v\\|^2=2\\bar\\alpha_t\\|\\Delta\\hat v\\|^2$</span>。取平方根得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\bar\\alpha_t}\\le\\sqrt2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span> 取最大。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（采样一致性）</strong> 若采样器在每一步仅通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 进入更新式，且这些量由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 经 (2.2)(2.3) 反解，则在 (A1)–(A3) 下，轨迹与直接参数化逐点相同，误差仅来自浮点舍入，其量级被命题 3 的 Lipschitz 常数控制。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 采样器更新式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的确定性函数；由定理 1，反解值与直接参数化值逐点相等，故代入同一更新式得同一轨迹。浮点误差传播由命题 3 的 Lipschitz 界控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-5-代码-三种参数化的转换与等价性数值验证\">5. 代码：三种参数化的转换与等价性数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-5-代码-三种参数化的转换与等价性数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ndef eps_to_x0(x_t, eps, abar):\n    a = abar.sqrt()\n    s = (1.0 - abar).sqrt()\n    return (x_t - s * eps) / a\n\ndef x0_to_eps(x_t, x0, abar):\n    a = abar.sqrt()\n    s = (1.0 - abar).sqrt()\n    return (x_t - a * x0) / s\n\ndef x0_eps_to_v(x0, eps, abar):\n    a = abar.sqrt()\n    s = (1.0 - abar).sqrt()\n    return a * eps - s * x0\n\ndef v_to_eps(x_t, v, abar):\n    a = abar.sqrt()\n    s = (1.0 - abar).sqrt()\n    return a * v + s * x_t\n\ndef v_to_x0(x_t, v, abar):\n    a = abar.sqrt()\n    s = (1.0 - abar).sqrt()\n    return a * x_t - s * v\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nd = 8\nx0 = torch.randn(d)\neps = torch.randn(d)\nabar = torch.tensor(0.37)\n\nx_t = abar.sqrt() * x0 + (1.0 - abar).sqrt() * eps\nv = x0_eps_to_v(x0, eps, abar)\n\neps_rec = v_to_eps(x_t, v, abar)\nx0_rec = v_to_x0(x_t, v, abar)\nassert torch.allclose(eps_rec, eps, atol=1e-6)\nassert torch.allclose(x0_rec, x0, atol=1e-6)\n\neps2 = x0_to_eps(x_t, x0, abar)\nx02 = eps_to_x0(x_t, eps, abar)\nassert torch.allclose(eps2, eps, atol=1e-6)\nassert torch.allclose(x02, x0, atol=1e-6)\n\nprint(&quot;x_t shape:&quot;, x_t.shape)\nprint(&quot;v shape:&quot;, v.shape)\nprint(&quot;eps_rec:&quot;, eps_rec)\nprint(&quot;x0_rec:&quot;, x0_rec)\nprint(&quot;expected eps:&quot;, eps)\nprint(&quot;expected x0:&quot;, x0)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果：<code>x_t shape: torch.Size([8])</code>，<code>v shape: torch.Size([8])</code>，<code>eps_rec</code> 与 <code>eps</code> 逐元素误差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，<code>x0_rec</code> 与 <code>x0</code> 同理。三个 <code>assert</code> 全部通过，验证了定理 1 的三条恒等式在浮点精度内成立。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>v 预测把回归目标取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t x_0$</span>，它与 ε、x₀ 预测之间由定理 1 的三条仿射恒等式逐点联系，三者是同一后验量的不同坐标，而非独立对象。</li>\n<li>反解映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span> 处取最大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt2$</span>，在两端趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 v 预测的采样一致性由该常数控制，浮点误差不放大。</li>\n<li>目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等：损失若作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span>，梯度会多出雅可比因子，这一差异将在损失加权节精确量化。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-6-v-预测的损失函数与梯度结构\">6. v 预测的损失函数与梯度结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-6-v-预测的损失函数与梯度结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节的代码只验证了<strong>前向转换</strong>的数值等价性，尚未触及训练时的梯度行为。本节补足这一环节：给出 v 预测的回归损失，并证明它与 ε、x₀ 预测的损失在梯度层面并不相等，从而为第 5 节损失加权提供精确的代数接口。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（v 回归损失）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，v 预测的训练损失定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_v(\\theta):=\\mathbb{E}_{t\\sim\\mathcal{U}(0,T)}\\;\\mathbb{E}_{(x_0,\\varepsilon)\\sim p_{\\text{data}}\\otimes\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)}\\Big[\\big\\|v_\\theta(x_t,t)-v_t\\big\\|^2\\Big],\\tag{6.1}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t x_0$</span>，期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的均匀分布取。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A4)（梯度可积）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta v_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 存在且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon,t)$</span> 平方可积：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{t}\\mathbb{E}_{x_0,\\varepsilon}\\big\\|\\nabla_\\theta v_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2&lt;\\infty.$$</div>\n此假设在有限参数神经网络下由 (A1)(A2) 与参数紧性保证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（v 损失的梯度恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_v$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}_v(\\theta)=2\\,\\mathbb{E}_{t}\\mathbb{E}_{x_0,\\varepsilon}\\Big[\\big(\\nabla_\\theta v_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)^{\\top}\\big(v_\\theta(x_t,t)-v_t\\big)\\Big].\\tag{6.2}$$</div>\n若进一步假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{x_t}v_\\theta$</span> 有界（由 (A2) 的 Lipschitz 性保证），则 (6.2) 中的期望与梯度可交换。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(\\theta;x_0,\\varepsilon)=\\|v_\\theta(x_t,t)-v_t\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微（(A4)），且其梯度\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta F=2(\\nabla_\\theta v_\\theta)^{\\top}(v_\\theta-v_t)$$</div>\n被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta v_\\theta\\|\\,(\\|v_\\theta\\|+\\|v_t\\|)$</span> 控制。由 (A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v_\\theta\\|$</span> 有界，由 (A3) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v_t\\|$</span> 平方可积，由 (A4) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta v_\\theta\\|$</span> 平方可积，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta F\\|$</span> 可积。由 Leibniz 积分法则（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导与对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 积分交换），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb{E}_{x_0,\\varepsilon}F=\\mathbb{E}_{x_0,\\varepsilon}\\nabla_\\theta F.$$</div>\n再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 用 Fubini（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的测度有限，被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可测且绝对值可积），得 (6.2)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（三种损失的梯度不相等）</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_\\varepsilon(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{x_0}(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat x_\\theta(x_t,t)-x_0\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta,\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 经定理 1 的反解给出。则在 (A1)–(A4) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}_\\varepsilon=2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\big(\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta\\big)^{\\top}\\big(\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat v_\\theta+\\sigma_t x_t-\\varepsilon\\big)\\Big],\\tag{6.3}$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}_{x_0}=2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\big(-\\sigma_t\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta\\big)^{\\top}\\big(\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat v_\\theta-x_0\\big)\\Big],\\tag{6.4}$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}_v$</span> 与 (6.3)(6.4) 一般不等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由定理 1 的 (2.2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat v_\\theta+\\sigma_t x_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta$</span>；代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_\\varepsilon$</span> 的链式法则得 (6.3)。同理由 (2.3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat v_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat x_\\theta=-\\sigma_t\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta$</span>，代入得 (6.4)。不等性由雅可比因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span> 的出现直接看出：它们分别乘在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 上，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_v$</span> 的梯度 (6.2) 中雅可比因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6 的要点</strong> 它精确回答了“为什么三种参数化在训练中不等价”：即使网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 相同，损失作用于不同坐标时，梯度被不同的确定性标量（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）加权。这正是第 5 节损失加权的代数根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-7-v-预测的闭式最优解与后验均值\">7. v 预测的闭式最优解与后验均值<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-7-v-预测的闭式最优解与后验均值\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（v 的闭式最优预测器）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_{\\text{data}}$</span> 具有有限二阶矩，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 独立。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，最小化\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|f(x_t,t)-v_t\\|^2$$</div>\n关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的最优可测函数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f^\\star(x_t,t)=\\mathbb{E}[v_t\\mid x_t]=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]-\\sigma_t\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t].\\tag{7.1}$$</div>\n且其最小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v_t-\\mathbb{E}[v_t\\mid x_t]\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 这是 Hilbert 空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\sigma(x_t))$</span> 上的正交投影问题。对任意可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|f-v_t\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|f-\\mathbb{E}[v_t\\mid x_t]\\|^2+\\mathbb{E}\\|\\mathbb{E}[v_t\\mid x_t]-v_t\\|^2,$$</div>\n交叉项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v_t-\\mathbb{E}[v_t\\mid x_t]\\mid x_t]=0$</span> 而消失。故最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=f^\\star$</span> 处取到。再由推论 1 得 (7.1)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 7 与 ε、x₀ 预测的关系</strong> 由推论 1，(7.1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 的线性组合一致。因此 v 预测的闭式最优解不是新对象，而是同一后验均值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 坐标下的旋转。这一点在数值上体现为：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 已收敛到各自后验均值，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\sigma_t\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 自动收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v_t\\mid x_t]$</span>，无需额外训练。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-8-采样一致性条件的显式验证\">8. 采样一致性条件的显式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-8-采样一致性条件的显式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 只给出了反解映射的 Lipschitz 界，尚未说明该界如何进入采样器的每一步。本节补足这一接口，给出<strong>逐步一致性</strong>的显式条件。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 3（逐步一致性）</strong> 设采样器在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的更新式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-\\Delta}=G\\big(x_t,\\;\\hat x_\\theta(x_t,t),\\;\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t),\\;\\Delta\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 关于第二、三自变量 Lipschitz，常数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{x},L_{\\varepsilon}$</span>。称 v 预测在该采样器下<strong>逐步一致</strong>，若用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 经 (2.2)(2.3) 反解得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 与直接参数化代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 产生相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-\\Delta}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（逐步一致性的充分条件）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若采样器更新式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 满足上述 Lipschitz 条件，则 v 预测逐步一致，且单步误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|G(x_t,\\hat x_\\theta^{v},\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta^{v})-G(x_t,\\hat x_\\theta^{\\text{dir}},\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta^{\\text{dir}})\\|\n\\le (L_x+L_\\varepsilon)\\sqrt{2\\bar\\alpha_t}\\;\\|\\hat v_\\theta-\\hat v_\\theta^{\\text{dir}}\\|,$$</div>\n其中上标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 表示由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 反解，上标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{dir}$</span> 表示直接参数化。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由定理 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta^{v}=\\hat x_\\theta^{\\text{dir}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta^{v}=\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta^{\\text{dir}}$</span> 逐点成立，故左端为零。误差界来自命题 3 的 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数之和，用于控制浮点舍入的传播。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9（一致性不依赖采样器形式）</strong> 只要采样器通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 进入更新式，v 预测与直接参数化的轨迹逐点相同。一致性是<strong>参数化转换的代数性质</strong>，而非采样器的数值性质。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由定理 1 逐点相等，代入任意确定性更新式得同一结果。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-9-一个具体例子-bar-alpha_t-1-2-处的数值行为\">9. 一个具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span> 处的数值行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-9-一个具体例子-bar-alpha_t-1-2-处的数值行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=1$</span>（单点验证），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}=\\sigma_t=1/\\sqrt2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1/\\sqrt2+1/\\sqrt2=\\sqrt2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=1/\\sqrt2-1/\\sqrt2=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>由 (2.2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat v+\\sigma_t x_t=\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\hat v+1$</span>；由 (2.3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat v=1-\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\hat v$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v=0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x=1$</span>，与真值一致。反解映射的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt2$</span>，这是三种参数化中数值放大最严重的点。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 的误差，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x$</span> 各有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta/\\sqrt2$</span> 的误差，二者之和的平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^2$</span>，与命题 3 的界一致。</p>\n<p>此例说明：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span> 附近，v 预测的反解对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 的误差最敏感，但敏感度上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt2$</span>，不会爆炸。这为第 6 节数值稳定性的讨论提供了定量锚点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-10-与-score-的接口-本节只给出恒等式-不展开\">10. 与 score 的接口（本节只给出恒等式，不展开）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-10-与-score-的接口-本节只给出恒等式-不展开\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 10（v 与 score 的恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t$</span> 为其得分。则在 (A1)–(A3) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=-\\sigma_t\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t),\\qquad\n\\mathbb{E}[v_t\\mid x_t]=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]-\\sigma_t\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t].$$</div>\n合并得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[v_t\\mid x_t]=-\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t)-\\sigma_t\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t].\\tag{10.1}$$</div>\n<strong>证明。</strong> 第一式是 Tweedie 公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 坐标下的形式（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 与高斯卷积的得分恒等式给出）；第二式是推论 1。合并即得 (10.1)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>要点</strong> (10.1) 表明 v 预测同时编码了得分与后验均值，二者通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的权重混合。第 8 节将把这一恒等式与概率流 ODE 的速度场区分开：后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x_t$</span> 的条件期望，量纲不同，不能与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 混为一谈。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-11-本节推导链的收束\">11. 本节推导链的收束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-11-本节推导链的收束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节从 v 的定义出发，经定理 1 建立与 ε、x₀ 的逐点等价，经推论 1 提升到后验期望层面，经命题 2 给出模长恒等式，经命题 3 与命题 8 给出采样一致性的 Lipschitz 控制，经命题 5 与推论 6 揭示梯度层面的不等价，经命题 7 给出闭式最优解，经命题 10 接入 score。整条链的代数核心是同一个正交旋转：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\begin{pmatrix}\\alpha_t^{1/2}&amp;-\\sigma_t\\\\ \\sigma_t&amp;\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\end{pmatrix}\n\\begin{pmatrix}\\varepsilon\\\\ x_0\\end{pmatrix}\n=\\begin{pmatrix}v_t\\\\ x_t\\end{pmatrix},$$</div>\n其逆给出 (2.1)–(2.3)。三种参数化的全部差异——损失加权、数值稳定性、采样一致性——都可由这一旋转矩阵的谱性质读出：其特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\pm i\\sigma_t$</span>，模长恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故旋转不放大范数；但作用在梯度上时，雅可比因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span> 分别加权不同坐标，导致梯度不等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-12-旋转矩阵的谱性质与范数守恒\">12. 旋转矩阵的谱性质与范数守恒<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-12-旋转矩阵的谱性质与范数守恒\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节以旋转矩阵的谱性质收束，但未把“范数守恒”与“梯度不等”这两件事的代数根源分开。本节补足这一区分：前者是矩阵本身的等距性，后者是雅可比因子作用在不同坐标上的结果，二者不可混为一谈。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（旋转矩阵的等距性）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R_t:=\\begin{pmatrix}\\alpha_t^{1/2}&amp;-\\sigma_t\\\\ \\sigma_t&amp;\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\end{pmatrix}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{2\\times2}.$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 是正交矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t^{\\top}R_t=I_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det R_t=\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|v_t\\|^2+\\|x_t\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\|x_0\\|^2.\\tag{12.1}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 直接计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R_t^{\\top}R_t=\\begin{pmatrix}\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2&amp;-\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t+\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\\\ -\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t+\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t&amp;\\sigma_t^2+\\bar\\alpha_t\\end{pmatrix}=I_2,$$</div>\n最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>。行列式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det R_t=\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>。等距性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 作用在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 的每个坐标对上保持欧氏范数，逐坐标求和得 (12.1)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>要点</strong> (12.1) 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 的正交旋转像，<strong>联合范数守恒</strong>。这解释了为什么 v 预测在训练中不会因坐标变换而损失信息：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_t,x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 携带相同的二阶矩总量。但范数守恒<strong>不蕴含梯度守恒</strong>——下一命题精确说明这一点。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12（雅可比因子的非等距性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 为网络输出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat v_\\theta+\\sigma_t x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 为反解。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta\\|^2,\\qquad\n\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\hat x_\\theta\\|^2=\\sigma_t^2\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta\\|^2,\\tag{12.2}$$</div>\n且二者之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2+\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\hat x_\\theta\\|^2=\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta\\|^2.\\tag{12.3}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由定理 1 的 (2.2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关），取范数平方得第一式。由 (2.3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta$</span>，取范数平方得第二式。相加并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span> 得 (12.3)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 13（梯度总量守恒但分布不均）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，三种参数化的梯度范数平方满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}_v\\|^2\\;\\text{与}\\;\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}_\\varepsilon\\|^2,\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}_{x_0}\\|^2$$</div>\n之间不存在恒等比例关系；但 (12.3) 表明，反解坐标的梯度总量等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 的梯度总量，只是被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 按坐标分配。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的梯度趋于零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 的梯度趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span>）时反之。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> (12.2)(12.3) 已给出分配律。比例关系的缺失由推论 6 的雅可比因子不同直接看出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_\\varepsilon$</span> 的梯度含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 与残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon)$</span> 的乘积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{x_0}$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 与残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat x_\\theta-x_0)$</span> 的乘积，残差本身也随坐标变换而变，故无恒等比例。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 13 的意义</strong> 它把“范数守恒”与“梯度不等”这两件事在代数上分开：命题 11 的等距性是<strong>联合坐标</strong>的性质，命题 12 的非等距性是<strong>单个坐标</strong>的性质。v 预测的训练动力学因此既保留了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 的全部二阶矩信息，又在梯度层面按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 重新分配了学习信号。这正是第 5 节损失加权要利用的结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-13-时间加权的可积性与端点行为\">13. 时间加权的可积性与端点行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-13-时间加权的可积性与端点行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>v 预测的损失 (6.1) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 取均匀期望。若把时间权重改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega(t)$</span>，则需验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega(t)\\mathbb{E}\\|v_\\theta-v_t\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可积，否则损失无定义。本节给出端点行为的定量刻画。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14（端点残差的极限）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}_v(t):=\\mathbb{E}\\|v_\\theta(x_t,t)-v_t\\|^2$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{t\\to0}\\mathcal{R}_v(t)=\\mathbb{E}\\|v_\\theta(x_0,0)-\\varepsilon\\|^2,\\qquad\n\\lim_{t\\to T}\\mathcal{R}_v(t)=\\mathbb{E}\\|v_\\theta(x_T,T)+x_0\\|^2,\\tag{13.1}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T=\\varepsilon$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T=1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\to x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t\\to\\varepsilon$</span>。由 (A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> Lipschitz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(x_t,t)\\to v_\\theta(x_0,0)$</span> 逐点成立；由 (A2) 的一致有界性与 (A3) 的平方可积性，DCT 给出期望收敛，得第一式。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\to\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t\\to-x_0$</span>；同理得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15（端点权重的必要性）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处不衰减，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\omega(t)\\mathcal{R}_v(t)\\,dt$</span> 可能发散，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}_v$</span> 在端点趋于零。由 (13.1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}_v(0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}_v(T)$</span> 一般非零（除非网络在端点恰好完美），故时间加权必须在端点衰减以保证可积性。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 (13.1) 端点极限非零，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span> 在端点取正常数，则被积函数在端点邻域有正下界，积分发散。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>要点</strong> 推论 15 是第 5 节损失加权中“端点权重衰减”要求的代数来源。它同时说明：v 预测在端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 的残差分别度量网络对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-x_0$</span> 的拟合精度，这两个量在采样中分别对应初始噪声与终端数据，故端点权重不能任意设置。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-14-一个可检验的恒等式-v-与-x₀-ε-的联合二阶矩\">14. 一个可检验的恒等式：v 与 x₀、ε 的联合二阶矩<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-14-一个可检验的恒等式-v-与-x₀-ε-的联合二阶矩\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16（联合二阶矩的旋转不变性）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|v_t\\|^2+\\|x_t\\|^2\\big]=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2.\\tag{14.1}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 11 的 (12.1)，逐点有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v_t\\|^2+\\|x_t\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\|x_0\\|^2$</span>。取期望即得 (14.1)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>数值检验。</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(1,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/4$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt3/2$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\tfrac12(1,0)+\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}(0,1)=\\big(\\tfrac12,\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\big),\\qquad\nv_t=\\tfrac12(0,1)-\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}(1,0)=\\big(-\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{2},\\tfrac12\\big).$$</div>\n计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_t\\|^2=\\tfrac14+\\tfrac34=1,\\qquad\\|v_t\\|^2=\\tfrac34+\\tfrac14=1,$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v_t\\|^2+\\|x_t\\|^2=2$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\|x_0\\|^2=1+1=2$</span>。一致。此例同时验证了命题 2 的 (3.1) 在单点情形下的对应：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v_t\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2\\|x_0\\|^2$</span> 当交叉项为零时成立，本例交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle=0$</span>，故逐点也成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-15-与采样器章的接口-v-预测进入更新式的三条路径\">15. 与采样器章的接口：v 预测进入更新式的三条路径<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-15-与采样器章的接口-v-预测进入更新式的三条路径\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后补足与采样器章的接口。v 预测进入采样器更新式有三条代数路径，三者由定理 1 逐点等价，但在数值实现中误差传播不同。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 4（三条路径）</strong> 设采样器在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>。三条路径为：\n- <strong>路径 A（直接反解）</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 经 (2.2)(2.3) 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta,\\hat x_\\theta$</span>；\n- <strong>路径 B（先转 ε 再转 x₀）</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 经 (2.2) 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta=(x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta)/\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span>；\n- <strong>路径 C（先转 x₀ 再转 ε）</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 经 (2.3) 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span>，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta=(x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat x_\\theta)/\\sigma_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17（三条路径的逐点相等与误差界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，三条路径在精确算术下逐点相等。在浮点算术下，路径 A 的误差被命题 3 的 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 控制；路径 B 与 C 多一次除法，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 时除法放大误差，故在端点附近路径 A 更稳定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 精确算术下，三条路径均由定理 1 的恒等式导出，故相等。浮点误差：路径 A 的两次乘法各引入相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span>，总误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}\\sqrt{2\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span>；路径 B 的除法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span> 倍，路径 C 的除法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 时放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t$</span> 倍。故端点附近路径 A 的误差界最小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>要点</strong> 命题 17 给出实现建议：在采样器中优先使用路径 A，避免在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 接近零时做除法。这与第 6 节数值稳定性的结论一致，但本节只给出代数误差界，具体的浮点分析留给数值稳定性节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-16-本节推导链的补足-旋转不变量的完整清单\">16. 本节推导链的补足：旋转不变量的完整清单<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-16-本节推导链的补足-旋转不变量的完整清单\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 11 小节以旋转矩阵收束，但未列出该旋转作用下的全部不变量。本节补足这一清单，作为本节推导链的最终代数总结。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18（旋转不变量）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 作用在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 上，以下量在旋转下不变：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|v_t\\|^2+\\|x_t\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\|x_0\\|^2,\\qquad\n\\langle v_t,x_t\\rangle=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\big(\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2-\\|x_0\\|^2\\big)+\\big(\\bar\\alpha_t-\\sigma_t^2\\big)\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle.\\tag{16.1}$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\sigma_t^2$</span>，交叉项系数为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle v_t,x_t\\rangle=\\tfrac12(\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2-\\|x_0\\|^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 第一式即命题 11 的 (12.1)。第二式：展开\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle v_t,x_t\\rangle=\\langle\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t x_0,\\;\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon\\rangle\n=\\bar\\alpha_t\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle+\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2-\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\|x_0\\|^2-\\sigma_t^2\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle,$$</div>\n合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle$</span> 项得 (16.1)。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t-\\sigma_t^2=1/2-1/2=0$</span>，交叉项消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>要点</strong> 命题 18 给出旋转作用的两个不变量：联合范数与内积的显式表达式。前者说明 v 预测不损失二阶矩总量，后者说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的相关结构由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2-\\|x_0\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle$</span> 共同决定。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span> 时相关结构最简，这正是命题 3 中 Lipschitz 常数取最大值的点，也是数值上最敏感的点——两个性质在同一参数点上重合，构成 v 预测的代数特征。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-三种参数化的等价关系\">三种参数化的等价关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-三种参数化的等价关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前三节已建立的符号：前向过程为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为数据，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 为累积噪声调度系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 为离散时间指标（连续时间版本在后续节处理）。记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha_t:=1-\\bar\\alpha_t,\\qquad s_t:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad c_t:=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2+c_t^2=1$</span>。本节只考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t&gt;0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span>）的情形；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0=0$</span> 的退化情形单独说明。</p>\n<p>三个预测网络分别记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，均取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>。本节的核心对象是这三个网络输出之间的<strong>逐点线性变换</strong>，它与网络是否训练充分无关；等价关系是代数恒等式，而非统计近似。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 逐点可测性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mapsto \\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为 Borel 可测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 同。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 逐点有界性</strong>：存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t&lt;\\infty$</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|\\le M_t$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立（或至少对采样分布支撑集成立）。此假设用于后续节中交换期望与线性变换；本节恒等式为逐点代数运算，不依赖此假设，但为与后续节接口，先行声明。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 非退化性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t&gt;0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 保证；<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t&gt;0$</span> 排除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 是某个真实噪声的条件期望，也不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\theta$</span> 是真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的条件期望。等价关系是<strong>参数化之间</strong>的恒等式，与最优预测无关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-定义-三种参数化\">定义：三种参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-定义-三种参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 15.4.1（ε 参数化）</strong>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 被解释为前向过程中所用噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的估计。由前向定义解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_0=\\frac{x_t-c_t\\,\\varepsilon}{s_t}. \\tag{15.4.1}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.4.2（x₀ 参数化）</strong>。网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 被解释为数据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的估计。由前向定义解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-s_t\\,x_0}{c_t}. \\tag{15.4.2}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.4.3（v 参数化）</strong>。网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 被解释为如下线性组合：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v=s_t\\,\\varepsilon-c_t\\,x_0. \\tag{15.4.3}$$</div>\n注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 不是前向过程的漂移，也不是概率流 ODE 的速度场；它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 在正交基下的坐标旋转。这一点在“与 score 的关系”节会进一步澄清。</p>\n<p>三个定义的区别在于<strong>网络输出所逼近的目标量</strong>不同：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化逼近噪声，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化逼近数据，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化逼近二者的正交混合。它们共享同一个输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与同一个条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，因此彼此之间存在确定的逐点线性关系。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-主定理-三者的逐点线性等价\">主定理：三者的逐点线性等价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-主定理-三者的逐点线性等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 15.4.4（等价变换）</strong>。在假设 (A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>、任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，三个网络输出满足如下逐点恒等式（若三者被一致地定义）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{x_t-c_t\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{s_t}, \\tag{15.4.4}$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{x_t-s_t\\,x_\\theta(x_t,t)}{c_t}, \\tag{15.4.5}$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_\\theta(x_t,t)=s_t\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-c_t\\,x_\\theta(x_t,t), \\tag{15.4.6}$$</div>\n以及逆变换\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=s_t\\,v_\\theta(x_t,t)+c_t\\,x_\\theta(x_t,t), \\tag{15.4.7}$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_\\theta(x_t,t)=s_t\\,x_t-c_t\\,v_\\theta(x_t,t). \\tag{15.4.8}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。全部为代数运算，逐式验证。</p>\n<p><em>(15.4.4)</em>：将 (15.4.1) 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\theta=(x_t-c_t\\varepsilon_\\theta)/s_t$</span>。此处用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t&gt;0$</span> 方可作除法，即 (A3)。</p>\n<p><em>(15.4.5)</em>：将 (15.4.2) 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\theta$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=(x_t-s_t x_\\theta)/c_t$</span>。用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>(15.4.6)</em>：直接由 (15.4.3) 替换。</p>\n<p><em>(15.4.7)</em>：由 (15.4.6) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2+c_t^2=1$</span> 解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>。具体地，将 (15.4.4) 代入 (15.4.6)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_\\theta=s_t\\varepsilon_\\theta-c_t\\cdot\\frac{x_t-c_t\\varepsilon_\\theta}{s_t}\n=\\frac{s_t^2\\varepsilon_\\theta-c_t x_t+c_t^2\\varepsilon_\\theta}{s_t}\n=\\frac{\\varepsilon_\\theta-c_t x_t}{s_t}.$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=s_t v_\\theta+c_t x_t$</span>。再用 (15.4.4) 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t x_\\theta+c_t\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta=s_t v_\\theta+c_t(s_t x_\\theta+c_t\\varepsilon_\\theta)\n=s_t v_\\theta+s_t c_t x_\\theta+c_t^2\\varepsilon_\\theta.$$</div>\n移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-c_t^2)\\varepsilon_\\theta=s_t v_\\theta+s_t c_t x_\\theta$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2\\varepsilon_\\theta=s_t(s_t v_\\theta+c_t x_\\theta)$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t&gt;0$</span> 得 (15.4.7)。</p>\n<p><em>(15.4.8)</em>：由 (15.4.7) 代入 (15.4.4)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_\\theta=\\frac{x_t-c_t(s_t v_\\theta+c_t x_\\theta)}{s_t}\n=\\frac{x_t-c_t s_t v_\\theta-c_t^2 x_\\theta}{s_t}.$$</div>\n移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t x_\\theta+c_t^2 x_\\theta=x_t-c_t s_t v_\\theta$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(s_t+c_t^2)x_\\theta=x_t-c_t s_t v_\\theta$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t+c_t^2=s_t+(1-s_t^2)=1+s_t-s_t^2$</span>，此式一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span>；直接验证更简的路径：由 (15.4.6) 与 (15.4.7) 联立，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_\\theta=s_t(s_t v_\\theta+c_t x_\\theta)-c_t x_\\theta=(s_t^2-c_t)x_\\theta+s_t^2 v_\\theta,$$</div>\n移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-s_t^2)v_\\theta=(s_t^2-c_t)x_\\theta$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^2 v_\\theta=(s_t^2-c_t)x_\\theta$</span>。此式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2\\ne c_t$</span> 时给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\theta=c_t^2 v_\\theta/(s_t^2-c_t)$</span>，与 (15.4.8) 不一致，说明上述联立路径有误。回到正确路径：由 (15.4.3) 与 (15.4.1)，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_\\theta=s_t\\varepsilon_\\theta-c_t\\cdot\\frac{x_t-c_t\\varepsilon_\\theta}{s_t}\n=\\frac{\\varepsilon_\\theta-c_t x_t}{s_t},$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=s_t v_\\theta+c_t x_t$</span>。代入 (15.4.1)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_\\theta=\\frac{x_t-c_t(s_t v_\\theta+c_t x_t)}{s_t}\n=\\frac{x_t-c_t s_t v_\\theta-c_t^2 x_t}{s_t}\n=\\frac{s_t^2 x_t-c_t s_t v_\\theta}{s_t}\n=s_t x_t-c_t v_\\theta.$$</div>\n此即 (15.4.8)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.4.5（正交性与范数守恒）</strong>。在 (A3) 下，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)\\mapsto(v,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)\\mapsto(v,\\varepsilon)$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的正交变换（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 的直积坐标下）。特别地，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\|x_0\\|^2=\\|v\\|^2+\\|x_0\\|^2=\\|v\\|^2+\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2. \\tag{15.4.9}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。将 (15.4.3) 写成矩阵形式。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=(\\varepsilon,x_0)\\in\\mathbb R^{2d}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=(v,x_0)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w=\\begin{pmatrix}s_t I_d &amp; -c_t I_d\\\\ 0 &amp; I_d\\end{pmatrix}u.$$</div>\n该块矩阵的行列式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^d\\ne0$</span>，且其列向量两两正交：第一块列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(s_t I,0)$</span> 与第二块列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-c_t I,I)$</span> 的内积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-s_t c_t\\mathrm{tr}(I)+0=-s_t c_t d$</span>，一般不为零，故该矩阵<strong>不是</strong>正交矩阵。因此 (15.4.9) 的第一等号不成立。正确的正交陈述是：变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)\\mapsto(v,x_0)$</span> 保持的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 的<strong>加权</strong>范数，而非欧氏范数。具体地，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=s_t\\varepsilon-c_t x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2+c_t^2=1$</span> 直接计算：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|v\\|^2=s_t^2\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2-2s_t c_t\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle+c_t^2\\|x_0\\|^2,$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v\\|^2+\\|x_0\\|^2$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\|x_0\\|^2$</span>。仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+c_t^2\\|x_0\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 时成立。因此 (15.4.9) 作为恒等式是<strong>错误的</strong>，应删除。正确的恒等式是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t^2\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+c_t^2\\|x_0\\|^2=\\|v\\|^2+2s_t c_t\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle+\\|x_0\\|^2\\cdot 0,$$</div>\n此式无简洁守恒形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：上述推论的陈述需按证明中的计算校正；可检验的恒等式是下面的推论 15.4.6。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.4.6（复合变换的恒等性）</strong>。在 (A3) 下，先由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 经 (15.4.4) 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\theta$</span>，再由 (15.4.5) 回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，恒有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{x_t-s_t\\cdot\\dfrac{x_t-c_t\\varepsilon_\\theta}{s_t}}{c_t}=\\varepsilon_\\theta. \\tag{15.4.10}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-s_t\\cdot(x_t-c_t\\varepsilon_\\theta)/s_t=x_t-(x_t-c_t\\varepsilon_\\theta)=c_t\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t&gt;0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明三参数化之间的变换构成一个<strong>群作用</strong>：任意两个参数化之间的变换是另一个参数化的逆，复合回到原值。这正是“等价”一词的精确含义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-具体例子-一维数值验证\">具体例子：一维数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-具体例子-一维数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0.36$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=0.8$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=0.6\\cdot2+0.8\\cdot1=2.0$</span>。三个目标量为：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon=1,\\qquad x_0=2,\\qquad v=0.6\\cdot1-0.8\\cdot2=-1.0.$$</div>\n验证 (15.4.4)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(2.0-0.8\\cdot1)/0.6=1.2/0.6=2=x_0$</span>。验证 (15.4.5)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(2.0-0.6\\cdot2)/0.8=0.8/0.8=1=\\varepsilon$</span>。验证 (15.4.6)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6\\cdot1-0.8\\cdot2=-1=v$</span>。验证 (15.4.7)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6\\cdot(-1)+0.8\\cdot2=1=\\varepsilon$</span>。验证 (15.4.8)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6\\cdot2.0-0.8\\cdot(-1)=1.2+0.8=2=x_0$</span>。全部吻合。</p>\n<p>注意此例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\|x_0\\|^2=1+4=5$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v\\|^2+\\|x_0\\|^2=1+4=5$</span>，看似 (15.4.9) 成立，但这只是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle=2\\ne0$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+c_t^2\\|x_0\\|^2=0.36+2.56=2.92\\ne5$</span> 抵消，纯属巧合；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1,\\varepsilon=2$</span> 即破坏。这印证了推论 15.4.5 的更正。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-采样一致性条件\">采样一致性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-采样一致性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>三个参数化在<strong>训练目标</strong>上等价，但在<strong>采样</strong>中必须与采样器使用的离散化格式一致。设采样器在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 需要从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>，其更新式写作\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=a_t x_t+b_t\\,\\hat z_t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat z_t$</span> 是采样器所要求的预测量（可能是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t,b_t$</span> 为采样器系数。<strong>采样一致性条件</strong>是：网络输出的参数化必须与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat z_t$</span> 的类型匹配，且变换 (15.4.4)–(15.4.8) 必须在<strong>与采样器相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span></strong> 下执行。若网络以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化训练，而采样器要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，则必须先经 (15.4.4) 转换；若转换时使用了错误的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（例如把离散索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与连续时间混淆），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t,c_t$</span> 失配，采样轨迹偏离目标分布。此条件在“采样的一致性”节将展开为命题；本节只指出：等价变换的<strong>逐点性</strong>保证了只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 一致，转换不引入额外误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-本节小结\">本节小结<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-本节小结\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<ol>\n<li>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t&gt;0,c_t&gt;0$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 三种参数化由 (15.4.4)–(15.4.8) 逐点线性互化，复合变换恒等（推论 15.4.6），等价性是代数恒等式而非统计近似。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$v=s_t\\varepsilon-c_t x_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 的正交旋转坐标，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)\\mapsto(v,x_0)$</span> 的块矩阵一般不正交，故不保持欧氏范数；任何“范数守恒”陈述须以加权形式或附加正交条件重述。</li>\n<li>采样一致性要求网络参数化与采样器所需预测量匹配，且变换使用与采样器相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>；逐点性保证一致时无额外误差，失配时误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t,c_t$</span> 偏差直接传播。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-变换矩阵的显式结构与条件数\">变换矩阵的显式结构与条件数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-变换矩阵的显式结构与条件数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节通过复合恒等确立了“等价”的代数含义，但尚未量化三个参数化在数值实现上的差异。本节引入变换矩阵并计算其条件数，为后续“数值稳定性”节提供可直接引用的量。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.4.7（参数化变换矩阵）</strong>。在 (A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=(\\varepsilon,x_0)\\in\\mathbb R^{2d}$</span>。定义三个线性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\varepsilon,P_x,P_v:\\mathbb R^{2d}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_\\varepsilon u=\\varepsilon,\\qquad P_x u=x_0,\\qquad P_v u=s_t\\varepsilon-c_t x_0.$$</div>\n对应的矩阵表示为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_\\varepsilon=\\begin{pmatrix}I_d&amp;0\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\nP_x=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;I_d\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\nP_v=\\begin{pmatrix}s_t I_d&amp;-c_t I_d\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n三个参数化网络所逼近的目标分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\varepsilon u$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_x u$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_v u$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.4.8（变换矩阵的奇异值）</strong>。在 (A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_x$</span> 的奇异值均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 重），<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_v$</span> 的奇异值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 重），因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P_v u\\|^2=s_t^2\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2-2s_t c_t\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle+c_t^2\\|x_0\\|^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle=0$</span> 时等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+c_t^2\\|x_0\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>，此式一般不对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_v$</span> 的算子范数不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_x$</span> 显然是坐标投影，算子范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_v$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=(\\varepsilon,0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P_v u\\|=s_t\\|\\varepsilon\\|$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=(0,x_0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P_v u\\|=c_t\\|x_0\\|$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P_v\\|=\\max(s_t,c_t)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t\\ne c_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P_v\\|\\ne1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的目标量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 坐标下的算子范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max(s_t,c_t)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时显著偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在不同噪声水平下梯度尺度变化的代数根源，将在“损失加权”节与“数值稳定性”节分别定量化。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.4.9（从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的放大因子）</strong>。在 (A3) 下，若已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span>，则由 (15.4.7) 与 (15.4.8)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta=s_t v_\\theta+c_t x_t,\\qquad x_\\theta=s_t x_t-c_t v_\\theta.$$</div>\n两式的系数绝对值分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|s_t|,|c_t|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|s_t|,|c_t|$</span>，均不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。因此从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> <strong>不放大</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 的误差：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v_\\theta-v\\|=\\delta$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\|\\le s_t\\delta\\le\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_\\theta-x_0\\|\\le c_t\\delta\\le\\delta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 (15.4.7) 减去真实关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=s_t v+c_t x_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon=s_t(v_\\theta-v)$</span>，取范数并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t\\le1$</span>。对 (15.4.8) 同理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_\\theta-x_0\\|=c_t\\|v_\\theta-v\\|\\le\\delta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论与直觉相反：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的目标量本身算子范数可达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max(s_t,c_t)$</span>，但从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 出发恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 是收缩映射。真正放大误差的方向是反向：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 时，误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 加权，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 都接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt2$</span> 时两路误差叠加。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.4.10（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to x_0$</span> 的放大因子）</strong>。在 (A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\|=\\delta$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_\\theta-x_0\\|=\\frac{c_t}{s_t}\\delta.$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_\\theta-x_0\\|=\\delta$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\|=\\frac{s_t}{c_t}\\delta.$$</div>\n两个放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t/s_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t/c_t$</span> 互为倒数，其乘积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 (15.4.4) 减去 (15.4.1)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\theta-x_0=-c_t(\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon)/s_t$</span>，取范数得第一式。由 (15.4.5) 减去 (15.4.2)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon=-s_t(x_\\theta-x_0)/c_t$</span>，取范数得第二式。乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$（c_t/s_t)(s_t/c_t)=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的定量结论：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 小）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的小误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t/s_t$</span> 压缩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的更小误差，反之 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t/c_t$</span> 放大为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的大误差；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 小）时情形反转。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化在低噪声端（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的估计精度天然优于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的估计精度，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化在高噪声端（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的估计精度天然优于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的估计精度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化通过正交混合使两个方向的放大因子都等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（推论 15.4.9），从而在两端都避免极端放大。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-期望意义下的等价-条件期望的线性性\">期望意义下的等价：条件期望的线性性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-期望意义下的等价-条件期望的线性性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>逐点等价只保证网络输出之间的代数关系。训练中真正被优化的是期望损失，因此需要确认：若某个参数化网络的最优解是条件期望，则经线性变换得到的另一参数化也是对应目标的条件期望。这一步依赖条件期望的线性性，而非逐点恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.4.11（最优预测的等价性）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0,x_t)$</span> 为前向过程诱导的联合分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)&gt;0$</span> 处处。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta^\\star(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E_q[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的逐点最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 预测，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_\\theta^\\star(x_t,t):=\\frac{x_t-c_t\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta^\\star(x_t,t)}{s_t}$$</div>\n等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta^\\star:=s_t\\varepsilon_\\theta^\\star-c_t x_\\theta^\\star$</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[v\\mid x_t]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由前向定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=s_t x_0+c_t\\varepsilon$</span>，在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为常数，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\frac{x_t-c_t\\,\\mathbb E_q[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]}{s_t}.$$</div>\n这里用到条件期望的线性性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t&gt;0$</span> 的确定性（非随机系数可提出）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta^\\star$</span> 代入即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\theta^\\star=\\mathbb E_q[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=s_t\\varepsilon-c_t x_0$</span> 与条件期望线性性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[v\\mid x_t]=s_t\\mathbb E_q[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]-c_t\\mathbb E_q[x_0\\mid x_t]=s_t\\varepsilon_\\theta^\\star-c_t x_\\theta^\\star=v_\\theta^\\star.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的关键在于：变换系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t,c_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的确定性函数，不依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，因此可以与条件期望交换。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>（例如某些自适应调度），则交换不成立，等价性破裂。这正是“采样一致性条件”中强调 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 必须与采样器一致的原因之一。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.4.12（最优损失的等价下界）</strong>。在命题 15.4.11 的假设下，三个参数化的最小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 损失满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\min_\\theta\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\|^2\n=\\frac{c_t^2}{s_t^2}\\min_\\theta\\mathbb E\\|x_\\theta-x_0\\|^2\n=\\min_\\theta\\mathbb E\\|v_\\theta-v\\|^2\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\max(s_t^2,c_t^2)}\\cdot\\kappa_t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 坐标下的条件数平方。此式说明三个参数化的<strong>不可约损失</strong>（即最优预测下的残差方差）通过确定性因子相互关联，但因子随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化，故不同参数化在不同噪声水平上的有效学习难度不同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon^\\star-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>（正交分解）。最小损失为第二项，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon(t)$</span>。由推论 15.4.10 的逐点关系，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_\\theta-x_0\\|^2=(c_t^2/s_t^2)\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的关系是逐点线性时成立；在期望意义下，需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的残差做同样分解，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_x(t)=(c_t^2/s_t^2)L_\\varepsilon(t)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v(t)=\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star-v\\|^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star-v=s_t(\\varepsilon^\\star-\\varepsilon)-c_t(x_0^\\star-x_0)$</span>，两项在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下不独立（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 由同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 决定），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v$</span> 不能简单地用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_x$</span> 的线性组合表示；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 的显式表达需在“损失加权”节给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论的证明只完成了前两个等号；第三个等号涉及交叉项，留待“损失加权”节处理。本节只声明：三参数化的最优损失通过确定性因子关联，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的损失不能由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的损失线性组合得到，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star-v$</span> 的两项在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下相关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-离散时间指标与连续时间的符号一致性\">离散时间指标与连续时间的符号一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-离散时间指标与连续时间的符号一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有恒等式以离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 表述。在后续“与采样器章的接口”节将引入连续时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)$</span>。为避免符号冲突，本节明确：离散情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>；连续情形下记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(t),c(t)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)$</span> 需满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(0)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(1)=0$</span> 与单调性。变换 (15.4.4)–(15.4.8) 在连续情形逐点成立，只需将下标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t)$</span>。<strong>采样一致性条件</strong>在连续情形要求采样器的离散化格式（如 Euler-Maruyama 或 DDIM 型更新）所使用的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 与网络训练时的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在同一时间网格上取值一致；若训练用离散索引、采样用连续插值，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s,c$</span> 在网格点之间失配，误差量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>，此量级将在“采样的一致性”节定量化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-与-score-参数的接口-仅声明-不展开\">与 score 参数的接口（仅声明，不展开）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-与-score-参数的接口-仅声明-不展开\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节不展开 score 参数化，但需指出：score 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t)=-\\varepsilon/c_t$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)&gt;0$</span> 且可微时），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化与 score 参数化的变换是逐点乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/c_t$</span>。此变换的放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/c_t$</span> 在高噪声端（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\to1$</span>）有界，在低噪声端（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\to0$</span>）发散，这正是 score 参数化在低噪声端数值不稳定的代数根源。完整推导见“与 score 的关系”节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-一个反例边界-c_t-0-处的退化\">一个反例边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=0$</span> 处的退化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-一个反例边界-c_t-0-处的退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节假设 (A3) 排除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=0$</span>。若强行在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>）处使用 (15.4.5)，则除以零。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=s_t x_0=x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 不可从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 恢复（前向过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 无噪声注入），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处无定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处退化为恒等映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\theta=x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta=-x_t$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=1,c_t=0$</span>）。三者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处不再等价：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 无定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的变换 (15.4.6) 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=-x_0$</span>，仍成立但信息量减半（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 只差符号）。训练中若在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处采样并计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 损失，会因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=0$</span> 导致目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 不可识别；标准做法是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 开始采样或对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 做特殊处理。完整反例构造见第 10 节。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>三种参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0,v)$</span> 由同一前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=s_tx_0+c_t\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性变换联系，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2+c_t^2=1$</span>。</li>\n<li>三组互逆公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-s_tx_0)/c_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_t-c_t\\varepsilon)/s_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=s_t\\varepsilon-c_tx_0$</span>；给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时三者两两可逆，逆映射的系数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>。</li>\n<li>残差范数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_\\theta-x_0\\|=(c_t/s_t)\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v_\\theta-v\\|=(1/s_t)\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\|$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\to0$</span>（高噪声端）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的误差被放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t/s_t$</span> 倍。</li>\n<li>条件期望的线性性给出三种最优预测子的等价关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=s_t\\varepsilon^\\star-c_tx_0^\\star$</span>，故三者在同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 上的条件期望完全一致。</li>\n<li>最优不可约损失通过确定性因子相互关联，但因子随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化，因此不同参数化在不同噪声水平上的有效学习难度不同。</li>\n<li>边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>）处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化无定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 退化为恒等与反号映射，三者不再等价；标准采样从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 开始或对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 特殊处理。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-损失加权\">损失加权<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-损失加权\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s\\in(0,1)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 充分小但不为零。记三种参数化的预测网络为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{\\theta}(x_t,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，均为可测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>。记真实条件期望\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t],\\qquad\nx_0^\\star(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t],\\qquad\nv^\\star(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[v\\mid x_t],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0$</span> 按本章 canonical claim 定义。本节引入的加权函数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t:\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to(0,\\infty)$</span>，并假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t w_t&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_t w_t&gt;0$</span>，即权重有界且一致远离零与无穷。</p>\n<p>本节所需的假设统一列如下，后文每个命题只引用其实际需要的条目。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可积性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)\\mapsto w_t\\,\\|\\hat u_\\theta(x_t,t)-u^\\star(x_t,t)\\|^2$</span> 关于联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x_0)\\mathcal N(\\varepsilon;0,I_d)$</span> 可积，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in\\{\\varepsilon,x_0,v\\}$</span>。此假设在本节情境下成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u_\\theta$</span> 为神经网络实现的连续（因而有界于紧集上）映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 有界，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的二阶矩有限（数据分布二阶矩有限是本章的 standing assumption）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 条件期望的线性变换封闭性.</strong> 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)\\mapsto(\\varepsilon,x_0,v)$</span> 是逐点的线性双射，因而条件期望与该线性变换可交换：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[v\\mid x_t]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t].$$</div>\n此式由条件期望的线性性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的可测性直接得到，无需额外正则性，仅需 (A1) 保证各条件期望存在。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 权重与参数化的解耦.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 只依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，不依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 或样本。这是本节讨论“损失加权”的基准情形；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，则下述命题中的期望交换需额外的可积性控制，本节不展开。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 采样一致性所需的近似误差控制.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u_\\theta$</span> 在加权损失下达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 精度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[w_t\\|\\hat u_\\theta-u^\\star\\|^2]\\le\\delta^2$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。此假设用于推论 15.5.3 的误差传播界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-定义-15-5-1-加权参数化损失\">定义 15.5.1（加权参数化损失）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-定义-15-5-1-加权参数化损失\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in\\{\\varepsilon,x_0,v\\}$</span>，定义加权损失\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_u(\\theta;w)=\\sum_{t=1}^T w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\varepsilon}\\Big[\\big\\|\\hat u_\\theta(x_t,t)-u\\big\\|^2\\Big],$$</div>\n其中期望取于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 由前向过程生成。与之对照，<strong>未加权</strong>损失即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\equiv1$</span> 的特例。本节的核心问题是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon,\\mathcal L_{x_0},\\mathcal L_v$</span> 在何种意义下等价，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的选择如何改变最小化问题的解与数值行为。</p>\n<p>注意定义 15.5.1 与相邻概念的区别：它是对<strong>回归目标</strong>的加权，而非对<strong>时间步采样分布</strong>的加权；后者改变的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t$</span> 中各项的出现频率，前者改变的是每项内部的尺度。二者在期望意义下可互相吸收（若采样分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t q_t\\,\\mathbb E[\\cdot]=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E[\\cdot]$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\propto q_t$</span>），但梯度方差的传播规律不同，这一点在数值稳定性节展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-15-5-2-三种加权损失的逐点等价恒等式\">命题 15.5.2（三种加权损失的逐点等价恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-15-5-2-三种加权损失的逐点等价恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v=\\hat v_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>。若三者由本章 canonical claims 的线性变换互相定义，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0,\\qquad\n\\hat x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n则对任意样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，有逐点恒等式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon\\|^2=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\,\\|\\hat v-v\\|^2. \\tag{15.5.1}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span> 与 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，两式相减得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon,\\qquad\nx_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,(\\hat x_0-x_0)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,(\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon),$$</div>\n两边平方即得第一个等号。对第二个等号，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的定义与 (A2) 的逐点版本（线性变换对逐点样本同样成立）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat v-v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,(\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon)-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,(\\hat x_0-x_0).$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(\\hat x_0-x_0)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon)$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat v-v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,(\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon)+\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,(\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon)\n=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,(\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon)\n=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,(\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon).$$</div>\n两边平方得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat v-v\\|^2=\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon\\|^2/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\|\\hat v-v\\|^2$</span>。另一方面，第一段已得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon\\|^2=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2$</span>。三个量两两成比例，比例系数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.5.2 的关键在于：<strong>逐点</strong>（对每个样本、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>）三种残差平方成固定比例，比例只依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。这比“期望相等”强得多，因为它排除了“期望相等但逐点差异被平均掉”的可能。由此立刻得到损失层面的等价性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-推论-15-5-3-损失等价与梯度等价\">推论 15.5.3（损失等价与梯度等价）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-推论-15-5-3-损失等价与梯度等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意有界权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon(\\theta;w)=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_\\theta-x_0\\|^2\n=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\bar\\alpha_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\hat v_\\theta-v\\|^2. \\tag{15.5.2}$$</div>\n特别地，若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{x_0}=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{v}=1/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon(\\theta;1)=\\mathcal L_{x_0}(\\theta;w^{x_0})=\\mathcal L_v(\\theta;w^{v}),$$</div>\n且三者的梯度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处处相等（在 (A1) 保证的交换条件下）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon(\\theta;1)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{x_0}(\\theta;w^{x_0})=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_v(\\theta;w^{v}). \\tag{15.5.3}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对 (15.5.2)，将 (15.5.1) 逐点代入定义 15.5.1 的期望内，再用 (A1) 的可积性保证期望线性运算合法（此处用 Fubini 的离散版本：有限和与期望交换无需额外条件，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 有限）。对 (15.5.3)，梯度交换需 (A1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的可微性；在神经网络参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat u_\\theta$</span> 在紧参数集上有界，故由 Leibniz 积分法则（对离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和即有限和）可交换。三式右端作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数逐点相同，故梯度相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 15.5.3 的实践含义是：<strong>若权重选得恰好抵消比例因子，三种参数化的训练目标在数学上完全同一</strong>，梯度也同一。因此“选哪种参数化”在无权重时并非优化问题层面的差异，而是数值实现层面的差异——这正是后续数值稳定性节要处理的内容。但必须强调：梯度相等的前提是 (A1) 与可微性，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u_\\theta$</span> 在某些 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 上不可微（如含 hard tanh 或量化），则 (15.5.3) 失效，此时只能断言损失值相等而不能断言梯度相等。禁止把目标值相等当成梯度相等，正是此处的纪律。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-15-5-4-权重的最优选择与方差传播\">命题 15.5.4（权重的最优选择与方差传播）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-15-5-4-权重的最优选择与方差传播\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>，考虑加权损失的<strong>单步梯度方差</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}\\big(w_t\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\hat u_\\theta-u\\|^2\\big)$</span>（方差取于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 的联合分布）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2(u)=\\mathrm{Var}\\big(\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\hat u_\\theta-u\\|^2\\big)$</span> 有限。则对固定总权重预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t=W$</span>，使总方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t^2\\sigma_t^2(u)$</span> 最小的权重为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t^\\star=\\frac{W\\,\\sigma_t^{-2}(u)}{\\sum_s\\sigma_s^{-2}(u)}. \\tag{15.5.4}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 这是约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t=W$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t&gt;0$</span> 下最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t^2\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的拉格朗日问题。拉格朗日函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=\\sum_t w_t^2\\sigma_t^2-\\lambda(\\sum_t w_t-W)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 求偏导并令其为零：<span class=\"math-inline\">$2w_t\\sigma_t^2=\\lambda$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\lambda/(2\\sigma_t^2)$</span>。代入约束得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda/2=W/\\sum_s\\sigma_s^{-2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^\\star=W\\sigma_t^{-2}/\\sum_s\\sigma_s^{-2}$</span>。二阶条件：目标函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的 Hessian 为对角阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(2\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，正定，故为全局最小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.5.4 说明：<strong>方差最优权重与参数化无关地反比于该参数化下梯度的方差</strong>。结合 (15.5.1) 的比例关系，若三种参数化的梯度方差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2(\\varepsilon)=\\big(\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big)^2\\sigma_t^2(x_0)=\\bar\\alpha_t^2\\,\\sigma_t^2(v)$</span>（这是 (15.5.1) 逐点比例在梯度上的直接推论，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 与逐点线性变换交换，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u_\\theta$</span> 的线性读出层），则三种参数化在各自最优权重下的总方差相同。这解释了为何“等价参数化”在方差意义下也等价，前提是读出层线性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-例-15-5-5-一维具体验算\">例 15.5.5（一维具体验算）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-例-15-5-5-一维具体验算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.3$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot0.3\\approx0.7071+0.2121=0.9192$</span>。设网络预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=0.5$</span>，则由 canonical claim 反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot0.5)/\\sqrt{0.5}=(0.9192-0.3536)/0.7071\\approx0.8000$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v=\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot0.5-\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot0.8\\approx0.3536-0.5657=-0.2121$</span>。验算 (15.5.1)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon\\|^2=0.04$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2=0.5\\cdot0.04=0.02$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\|\\hat v-v\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot0.3-\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot1\\approx-0.4949$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v-v\\approx0.2828$</span>，平方约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.08$</span>，乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.04$</span>。三式一致，验证通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-15-5-6-采样一致性的误差传播界\">命题 15.5.6（采样一致性的误差传播界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-15-5-6-采样一致性的误差传播界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设采样器使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 做单步预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{1-\\alpha_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)+\\sigma_t z$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 为采样噪声尺度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>）。若真实后验均值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 给出，则单步均值误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\mathbb E[x_{t-1}\\mid x_t]-\\mathbb E[x_{t-1}\\mid x_t]_{\\hat\\varepsilon}\\big\\|\\le\\frac{1-\\alpha_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon^\\star\\|. \\tag{15.5.5}$$</div>\n特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 在权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=1$</span> 下达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 精度，则单步均值误差的期望平方被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(1-\\alpha_t)^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\,\\delta^2$</span> 控制。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 后验均值公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_{t-1}\\mid x_t]=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{1-\\alpha_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon^\\star\\big)$</span>，这是本章前序节已建立的后验均值表达（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\varepsilon'$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的联合高斯性推出）。两式相减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 项抵消，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[x_{t-1}\\mid x_t]-\\mathbb E[x_{t-1}\\mid x_t]_{\\hat\\varepsilon}\n=-\\frac{1-\\alpha_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,(\\varepsilon^\\star-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta).$$</div>\n取范数即得 (15.5.5)。对期望平方，用 (A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span> 的凸性（Jensen）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2\\le\\delta^2$</span>，再乘系数平方。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.5.6 的意义：<strong>采样一致性要求预测误差在正确的参数化下度量</strong>。若采样器用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 但训练用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 且未加权，则 (A4) 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的精度，需先由 (15.5.1) 换算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的精度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_0-x_0^\\star\\|^2$</span>。若忘记换算，误差界会被错误放大或缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 倍，导致对采样步长的错误估计。这就是“采样一致性条件”的精确表述：<strong>训练损失所用的参数化必须与采样器读取的参数化一致，或在二者之间显式乘以 (15.5.1) 的比例因子</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-15-5-7-权重有界性的必要性\">命题 15.5.7（权重有界性的必要性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-15-5-7-权重有界性的必要性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 无下界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_t w_t=0$</span>）或无上界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t w_t=\\infty$</span>），则 (15.5.2) 的损失等价性仍逐点成立，但 (15.5.3) 的梯度等价性可能失效：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 与网络参数化使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon(\\theta;1)\\neq\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{x_0}(\\theta;w^{x_0})$</span>。构造思路：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{x_0}=1/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时发散，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 的梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 上无界（如无归一化的线性读出），则加权梯度的期望可能不存在，(A1) 失效。完整构造见反例节。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路.</strong> (A1) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\|\\hat u_\\theta-u^\\star\\|^2$</span> 可积；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 发散且残差平方不衰减，则可积性破坏，Leibniz 交换不合法，梯度等价不成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-15-5-8-加权损失对-score-的接口恒等式\">命题 15.5.8（加权损失对 score 的接口恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-15-5-8-加权损失对-score-的接口恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star(x_t,t)=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t)$</span> 为边缘得分函数，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘密度（假设存在且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s^\\star(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>）。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s^\\star(x_t,t)=-\\frac{\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\n=-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0^\\star(x_t,t)-x_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=-\\frac{v^\\star(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}. \\tag{15.5.6}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由前向过程，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mid x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=\\int p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x_0)\\,\\mathcal N(x_t;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)\\,dx_0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度并用 Leibniz 法则（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\mathcal N$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 可积控制，此由高斯核的指数衰减与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 二阶矩有限保证）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}p_t(x_t)=\\int p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x_0)\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\mathcal N(x_t;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)\\,dx_0.$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\mathcal N(x_t;\\mu,\\Sigma)=-\\Sigma^{-1}(x_t-\\mu)\\mathcal N$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}p_t(x_t)=-\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\int p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x_0)\\,(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0)\\,\\mathcal N\\,dx_0.$$</div>\n两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)$</span>，右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E[x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s^\\star(x_t,t)=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=-\\frac{\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n第一个等号得证。第二个等号由 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0-x_t)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 代入，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0^\\star)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，整理即第二个等号。第三个等号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的关系：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 展开，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon^\\star-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0^\\star\n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon^\\star-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon^\\star}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\n=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t\\,\\varepsilon^\\star-(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)x_t+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\varepsilon^\\star}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\n=\\frac{\\varepsilon^\\star-(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)x_t}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n另一方面，由第一个等号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s^\\star$</span>，代入上式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=(-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s^\\star-(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)x_t)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。再用第二个等号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0^\\star=x_t+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)s^\\star$</span> 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s^\\star$</span>。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.5.8 把三种参数化的条件期望统一到同一个 score 场上，比例系数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。这三个系数正是 (15.5.1) 中残差比例的平方根倒数，因此 score 接口与损失等价性是同一组恒等式的两种读法。特别地，若训练用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 且损失未加权，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 直接给出 score 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，采样器若读取 score 则无需换算；若训练用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 且未加权，则 score 估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，其中含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的项使估计依赖于当前状态，采样器的离散化误差会通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 反馈进 score，这是数值稳定性节要展开的机制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-推论-15-5-9-加权损失下-score-估计的偏差界\">推论 15.5.9（加权损失下 score 估计的偏差界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-推论-15-5-9-加权损失下-score-估计的偏差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 在权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 下达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 精度，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[w_t\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2]\\le\\delta^2$</span>。则 score 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta=-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[w_t\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\,\\|\\hat s_\\theta-s^\\star\\|^2\\big]\\le\\delta^2. \\tag{15.5.7}$$</div>\n若改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 参数化且权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{x_0}=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则 score 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta=-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_\\theta)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 满足同一界，但需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 的精度按 (15.5.1) 换算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_\\theta-x_0^\\star\\|^2\\le\\delta^2\\bar\\alpha_t^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 (15.5.6) 第一个等号，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta-s^\\star=-(\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon^\\star)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，两边平方乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2$</span>，再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 取期望即 (15.5.7)。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 参数化，由 (15.5.6) 第二个等号，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta-s^\\star=-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(\\hat x_\\theta-x_0^\\star)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，平方乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\|\\hat x_\\theta-x_0^\\star\\|^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，与 (15.5.1) 的比例一致；代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_\\theta-x_0^\\star\\|^2\\le\\delta^2/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 即得同一界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 15.5.9 的要点：<strong>score 误差界与参数化无关，只要权重按 (15.5.1) 换算</strong>。这为“采样器读取 score”的实现提供了统一的误差预算：无论训练用哪种参数化，只要换算正确，score 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差相同。若换算错误（例如用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 训练却按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的权重读 score），误差界会被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 错误缩放，这正是采样一致性条件在 score 接口上的体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-15-5-10-权重的时间调度与信噪比\">命题 15.5.10（权重的时间调度与信噪比）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-15-5-10-权重的时间调度与信噪比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，定义信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。则 (15.5.1) 可改写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon\\|^2=\\mathrm{SNR}_t\\,\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2=\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}_t}{1+\\mathrm{SNR}_t}\\,\\|\\hat v-v\\|^2. \\tag{15.5.8}$$</div>\n若取权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\mathrm{SNR}_t$</span> 用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 损失，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{x_0}(\\theta;w)=\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon(\\theta;1)$</span>；若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=1+\\mathrm{SNR}_t$</span> 用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 损失，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_v(\\theta;w)=\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon(\\theta;1)$</span>。特别地，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 损失的权重发散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 损失权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 损失的权重趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 损失权重趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\mathrm{SNR}_t/(1+\\mathrm{SNR}_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1/(1+\\mathrm{SNR}_t)$</span> 直接代入 (15.5.1) 得 (15.5.8)。权重结论由 (15.5.2) 逐项比较系数得出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{x_0}$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\mathrm{SNR}_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{x_0}=\\mathrm{SNR}_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_v$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\mathrm{SNR}_t/(1+\\mathrm{SNR}_t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{v}=\\mathrm{SNR}_t/(1+\\mathrm{SNR}_t)$</span>。极限行为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t$</span> 的定义直接读出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.5.10 揭示了三种参数化在时间轴上的<strong>互补性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 损失在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上权重恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，是“时间均匀”的；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 损失在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（高信噪比）时权重发散，在大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时权重趋零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 损失在大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（低信噪比）时权重趋零，在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（高信噪比）时权重趋 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。因此，若不做加权而直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 损失，训练信号会被小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的高信噪比样本主导，大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的低信噪比样本贡献被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 压缩——这正是“未加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 损失在低信噪比区间欠训练”的数学根源。反之，未加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 损失在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 区间权重发散（<span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\mathrm{SNR}_t\\to\\infty$</span>），若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 的梯度在该区间无界，则 (A1) 失效，梯度等价性破坏，这与命题 15.5.7 的边界情形一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-例-15-5-11-权重调度的数值验算\">例 15.5.11（权重调度的数值验算）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-例-15-5-11-权重调度的数值验算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_3=0.7$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_3=0.504$</span>。对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_1=9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_2\\approx2.571$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_3\\approx1.016$</span>。按命题 15.5.10，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 损失的最优权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1^{x_0}\\approx1.111$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2^{x_0}\\approx1.389$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_3^{x_0}\\approx1.984$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 损失的最优权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1^{v}=10$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2^{v}\\approx3.571$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_3^{v}\\approx2.016$</span>。验算 (15.5.2)：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1 w_1^{x_0}=0.9\\cdot1.111\\approx1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)w_1^{v}=0.1\\cdot10=1$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 一致；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_3 w_3^{x_0}=0.504\\cdot1.984\\approx1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_3)w_3^{v}=0.496\\cdot2.016\\approx1$</span>，一致。验证通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-15-5-12-加权损失的凸性与唯一极小点\">命题 15.5.12（加权损失的凸性与唯一极小点）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-15-5-12-加权损失的凸性与唯一极小点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，加权损失关于预测值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u$</span> 是严格凸的二次函数，其唯一极小点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u=u^\\star(x_t,t)$</span>。因此对任意参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 与任意有界权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_u(\\theta;w)$</span> 的全局极小点（若存在）满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u_\\theta(x_t,t)=u^\\star(x_t,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat u-u^\\star\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u$</span> 的 Hessian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2I_d$</span>，正定，故严格凸，唯一极小点由一阶条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u-u^\\star=0$</span> 给出。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的极小化，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u_\\theta$</span> 的参数化能力足以表达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^\\star$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u_\\theta$</span> 的值域内），则全局极小点处逐点成立；若不足以表达，则极小点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^\\star$</span> 在值域上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(w_t p_t)$</span> 投影。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.5.12 说明：<strong>加权不改变极小点的位置，只改变极小点附近的曲率</strong>。三种参数化的极小点由 (15.5.6) 互相确定，故在参数化能力充分时，三种参数化的训练目标有相同的极小点集合（在对应的函数空间中）。这为“参数化选择不影响最优解、只影响优化路径”提供了精确表述。但须注意：极小点相同不等于梯度相同（命题 15.5.7 已指出边界情形），也不等于有限步优化的轨迹相同——后者由曲率与梯度方差决定，是数值稳定性节的内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-15-5-13-权重与-ELBO-的接口\">命题 15.5.13（权重与 ELBO 的接口）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-15-5-13-权重与-ELBO-的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设变分下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}[\\log p_\\theta(x_{0:T})-\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)]$</span> 按本章前序节的分解写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E[\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)]-\\sum_{t=2}^T\\mathbb E\\big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))\\big]-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p(x_T)).$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 取高斯形式且均值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 给出，则第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项 KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>，比例系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\alpha_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 取后验方差时）。因此 ELBO 的优化等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 损失在权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\frac{1-\\alpha_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 下的优化。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 为高斯，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_q=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>。模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 取同方差高斯，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta)$</span>。KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\mu_q-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span>（常数项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关）。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_q-\\mu_\\theta$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_q$</span>，化简得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_q-\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon)$</span>（此处用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span> 的代数关系）。取范数平方乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\bar\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^3}$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 化简得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，即所述系数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.5.13 把 ELBO 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 损失在权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 下对接。注意该权重依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，与命题 15.5.4 的方差最优权重一般不同：前者来自变分推断的 KL 结构，后者来自梯度方差最小化。二者可以叠加（先按 ELBO 权重构造目标，再按方差最优权重调整时间采样分布），但不可混为一谈——这正是“损失加权”与“时间采样加权”的区别所在。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-15-5-14-权重有界时的梯度-Lipschitz-界\">命题 15.5.14（权重有界时的梯度 Lipschitz 界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-15-5-14-权重有界时的梯度-Lipschitz-界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_u$</span>-Lipschitz 的（在参数空间中），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t w_t=W&lt;\\infty$</span>。则加权损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_u(\\theta;w)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2W L_u^2\\,\\mathbb E\\|u^\\star\\|^2$</span>-Lipschitz 的（在适当参数度量下）。特别地，三种参数化在各自最优权重下的 Lipschitz 常数之比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:(1-\\bar\\alpha_t):1$</span>，与 (15.5.1) 的比例一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\theta'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat u_\\theta-\\hat u_{\\theta'}\\|\\le L_u\\|\\theta-\\theta'\\|$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\mathcal L_u(\\theta;w)-\\mathcal L_u(\\theta';w)|\\le\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\big[\\|\\hat u_\\theta-u^\\star\\|^2-\\|\\hat u_{\\theta'}-u^\\star\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|a\\|^2-\\|b\\|^2=(a-b)\\cdot(a+b)$</span> 与 Cauchy–Schwarz，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\cdot|\\le\\|\\hat u_\\theta-\\hat u_{\\theta'}\\|\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\hat u_\\theta+\\hat u_{\\theta'}-2u^\\star\\|$</span>，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u$</span> 的有界性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^\\star$</span> 的二阶矩有限（A1）得所述界。三种参数化的比例由 (15.5.1) 逐点代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.5.14 的用途：它给出加权损失在参数空间中的光滑性界，是后续采样器章中“损失曲面曲率与步长选择”接口的输入。比例 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:(1-\\bar\\alpha_t):1$</span> 说明：在相同权重下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 损失在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时 Lipschitz 常数最小（最光滑），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 损失在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时系数趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、在大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时最粗糙，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 损失在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上居中。这与命题 15.5.10 的权重互补性一致：光滑性好的区间正是未加权损失权重大的区间。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>三种参数化的残差平方逐点成固定比例（命题 15.5.2），比例系数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，由此损失在恰当权重下完全等价（推论 15.5.3），梯度亦等价——但梯度等价需额外的可微性与可积性假设，不可由损失值相等直接推出。</li>\n<li>方差最优权重反比于梯度方差（命题 15.5.4），且三种参数化在各自最优权重下的总方差相同（读出层线性时），说明“等价参数化”在优化方差意义下也等价。</li>\n<li>采样一致性要求训练参数化与采样器读取的参数化一致，或在二者间乘以 (15.5.1) 的比例因子（命题 15.5.6）；权重必须有界且一致远离零与无穷，否则梯度等价性可能失效（命题 15.5.7）。</li>\n<li>三种参数化的条件期望通过 score 场统一（命题 15.5.8），比例系数与 (15.5.1) 的残差比例互为平方根倒数；score 误差界在正确换算下与参数化无关（推论 15.5.9）。</li>\n<li>权重的时间调度由信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 完全刻画（命题 15.5.10）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 损失时间均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 损失在高信噪比区间权重发散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 损失在低信噪比区间权重趋零、在高信噪比区间趋一；加权不改变极小点位置，只改变曲率与梯度方差（命题 15.5.12）。</li>\n<li>ELBO 的优化等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 损失在权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\frac{1-\\alpha_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 下的优化（命题 15.5.13），该权重与方差最优权重一般不同，二者分别对应变分推断结构与梯度方差最小化；权重有界时加权损失的 Lipschitz 常数之比与 (15.5.1) 的比例一致（命题 15.5.14）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-数值稳定性\">数值稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-数值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向扩散过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\in(0,1)$</span> 为前向方差调度，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调递减。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t:=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2},\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha_t^{1/2})^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>。三种参数化映射为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0}{\\sigma_t},\\qquad\nv=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t x_0,\\qquad\nx_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\varepsilon}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}.$$</div>\n记网络在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，其参数化类型记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\{\\varepsilon,x_0,v\\}$</span>，对应预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta,\\hat x_{0,\\theta},\\hat v_\\theta$</span>。本节只讨论数值稳定性，即：在浮点算术下，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与某一参数化的预测恢复其余两个量时，误差如何被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的尺度放大或抑制；以及训练损失在何种加权下使梯度尺度不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 爆炸。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t:=\\sigma_t/\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span>（信噪比的倒数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t:=\\alpha_t^{1/2}/\\sigma_t=1/\\kappa_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{fl}(\\cdot)$</span> 表示 IEEE-754 双精度浮点舍入；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的欧氏范数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\odot$</span> 为逐元素乘。假设：(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\ge\\alpha_{\\min}&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\ge\\sigma_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 取值避开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 的两个端点；(A2) 网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t&lt;\\infty$</span>；(A3) 损失函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 关于其两个宗量局部 Lipschitz 且平方可积。这些假设在本章情境下成立：调度通常取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1$</span> 很小、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_T$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 但不为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{\\min},\\sigma_{\\min}$</span> 可取为调度端点值；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 为有限深网络，在紧集上 Lipschitz。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-定义-参数化恢复算子与条件数\">定义：参数化恢复算子与条件数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-定义-参数化恢复算子与条件数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，定义三个恢复算子，把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与某一参数化的预测”映到“另一参数化的量”：</p>\n<p><div class=\"math-display\">$$R_{\\varepsilon\\to x_0}(x_t,\\hat\\varepsilon)=\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}},\\qquad\nR_{\\varepsilon\\to v}(x_t,\\hat\\varepsilon)=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t R_{\\varepsilon\\to x_0}(x_t,\\hat\\varepsilon),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R_{x_0\\to\\varepsilon}(x_t,\\hat x_0)=\\frac{x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat x_0}{\\sigma_t},\\qquad\nR_{v\\to x_0}(x_t,\\hat v)=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat v,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R_{v\\to\\varepsilon}(x_t,\\hat v)=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat v+\\sigma_t x_t .$$</div></p>\n<p>这些算子与“参数化等价关系”一节的恒等式一致，但此处关注的是它们作为线性映射的算子范数。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{\\varepsilon\\to x_0}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的 Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t/\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\,I_d=-\\kappa_t I_d$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{x_0\\to\\varepsilon}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的 Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\alpha_t^{1/2}/\\sigma_t\\,I_d=-\\rho_t I_d$</span>。因此定义时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的<strong>恢复条件数</strong>为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{cond}_t:=\\max\\{\\kappa_t,\\rho_t\\}=\\max\\{\\sigma_t/\\alpha_t^{1/2},\\ \\alpha_t^{1/2}/\\sigma_t\\}\\ge1 .$$</div>\n它与相邻概念的区别：这不是协方差矩阵的条件数，也不是 SDE 离散化的刚性比，而是“参数化换元”这一线性映射的增益；它只依赖调度，不依赖数据或网络。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-1-浮点恢复的误差放大\">命题 1（浮点恢复的误差放大）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-1-浮点恢复的误差放大\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 满足 (A1)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 由浮点计算得到，其绝对误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathrm{fl}(\\hat\\varepsilon)-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|\\le u\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|+u\\|x_t\\|/\\sigma_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 为机器 epsilon 量级；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2},\\sigma_t$</span> 精确表示。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{\\varepsilon\\to x_0}$</span> 的线性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{fl}(R_{\\varepsilon\\to x_0}(x_t,\\hat\\varepsilon))-R_{\\varepsilon\\to x_0}(x_t,\\hat\\varepsilon)\n=\\frac{1}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}\\big(\\mathrm{fl}(x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon)-(x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon)\\big).$$</div>\n括号内误差由两次舍入构成：乘法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>，减法在量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x_t|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t|\\hat\\varepsilon|$</span> 相消时绝对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\max\\{|x_t|,\\sigma_t|\\hat\\varepsilon|\\}$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\mathrm{fl}(R_{\\varepsilon\\to x_0})-R_{\\varepsilon\\to x_0}\\|\n\\le \\frac{u}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}\\big(\\|x_t\\|+\\sigma_t\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|\\big)+\\frac{\\sigma_t}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}u\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|\n\\le \\kappa_t\\,u\\big(\\|x_t\\|/\\sigma_t+2\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|\\big).$$</div>\n关键步骤是：误差上界正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span>。同理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{x_0\\to\\varepsilon}$</span> 的误差上界正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span>。取两者最大即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cond}_t$</span> 的放大因子。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（端点退化）</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\to\\infty$</span>，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的相对误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 放大；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t\\to\\infty$</span>，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的相对误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 放大。故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的早期时刻，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 恢复不稳定；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的晚期时刻，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 恢复不稳定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t x_0$</span> 的两项系数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha_t^{1/2})^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>，其恢复算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{v\\to x_0}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{v\\to\\varepsilon}$</span> 的 Jacobian 范数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span>，均不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 区间上恢复条件数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-2-损失加权下的梯度尺度\">命题 2（损失加权下的梯度尺度）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-2-损失加权下的梯度尺度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A2)(A3)；损失取逐样本平方形式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\varepsilon=\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{x_0}=\\|\\hat x_{0,\\theta}(x_t,t)-x_0\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_v=\\|\\hat v_\\theta(x_t,t)-v\\|^2$</span>；网络输出与目标同维。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由等价关系，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t}\\big((x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat x_0)-(x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0)\\big)=-\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}{\\sigma_t}(\\hat x_0-x_0)=-\\rho_t(\\hat x_0-x_0)$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_\\varepsilon=\\rho_t^2\\,\\ell_{x_0},\\qquad\n\\ell_v=\\|\\alpha_t^{1/2}(\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon)-\\sigma_t(\\hat x_0-x_0)\\|^2 .$$</div>\n后一式不能仅由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\varepsilon$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{x_0}$</span> 单独表出，但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0-x_0$</span> 共线（同一标量误差方向）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_v=(\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\rho_t-\\sigma_t)^2\\ell_{x_0}=\\big((\\alpha_t^{1/2})^2/\\sigma_t-\\sigma_t\\big)^2\\ell_{x_0}$</span>，系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^2-2+\\sigma_t^2$</span> 量级。关键等式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\varepsilon=\\rho_t^2\\ell_{x_0}$</span>：它表明若直接以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\varepsilon$</span> 训练而在采样时用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 恢复，则梯度被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t^2$</span> 加权；反之若以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{x_0}$</span> 训练而在采样时用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 恢复，则梯度被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^2$</span> 加权。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（加权一致性）</strong>：若训练损失取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\ell_\\pi$</span> 且采样恢复算子范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>，则梯度尺度正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t c_t^2$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1/\\rho_t^2$</span> 可使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的梯度尺度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上一致；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1$</span> 且用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化则梯度尺度有界，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的恢复算子范数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。这就是“损失加权”一节所述加权在数值稳定性上的来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-具体例子\">具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0.5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}=\\sigma_t=1/\\sqrt2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\rho_t=1$</span>，三种参数化恢复条件数均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，无放大。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0.99$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\approx0.995$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\approx0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t\\approx9.95$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\approx0.1$</span>；此时从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的误差放大约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span> 倍，而从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的误差缩小约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span> 倍。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0.01$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\approx0.995$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\approx9.95$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t\\approx0.1$</span>；情形反转。<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在两端均保持恢复算子范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-代码-恢复条件数与误差放大的数值验证\">代码：恢复条件数与误差放大的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-代码-恢复条件数与误差放大的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef cond_numbers(alpha_bar):\n    a = np.sqrt(alpha_bar)\n    s = np.sqrt(1.0 - alpha_bar)\n    kappa = s / a\n    rho = a / s\n    return a, s, kappa, rho, max(kappa, rho)\n\nfor ab in [0.5, 0.99, 0.01]:\n    a, s, kappa, rho, cond = cond_numbers(ab)\n    print(f&quot;alpha_bar={ab}: a={a:.4f}, s={s:.4f}, kappa={kappa:.4f}, rho={rho:.4f}, cond={cond:.4f}&quot;)\n    assert cond &gt;= 1.0\n\n# 浮点恢复误差放大验证：d=1, 固定 x_t, 注入 eps 误差\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nd = 1\nfor ab in [0.99, 0.01]:\n    a, s, kappa, rho, _ = cond_numbers(ab)\n    x0 = rng.normal(size=d)\n    eps = rng.normal(size=d)\n    xt = a * x0 + s * eps\n    eps_hat = eps + 1e-6 * rng.normal(size=d)\n    x0_rec = (xt - s * eps_hat) / a\n    err = np.linalg.norm(x0_rec - x0)\n    print(f&quot;alpha_bar={ab}: eps error norm=1e-6, x0 recovery error={err:.3e}, ratio={err/1e-6:.4f}&quot;)\n    assert err / 1e-6 &lt;= kappa * 2.0 + 1e-12\n\n# v 参数化恢复范数不超过 1\nfor ab in [0.99, 0.5, 0.01]:\n    a, s, _, _, _ = cond_numbers(ab)\n    assert s &lt;= 1.0 and a &lt;= 1.0\nprint(&quot;v-parameterization recovery operator norms &lt;= 1: OK&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：第一组打印三个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t,\\rho_t,\\mathrm{cond}_t$</span>，均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge1$</span>；第二组打印 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 恢复后的误差比，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0.99$</span> 时约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 量级），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0.01$</span> 时约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 量级），且不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\kappa_t$</span>；最后一行打印 <code>OK</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>参数化换元是线性映射，其算子范数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\sigma_t/\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t=1/\\kappa_t$</span> 刻画；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化在调度两端分别退化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的恢复算子范数在整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 区间不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</li>\n<li>浮点恢复误差的上界正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cond}_t=\\max\\{\\kappa_t,\\rho_t\\}$</span>，故数值稳定性不是训练技巧而是换元映射的条件数问题；端点处必须避免用退化参数化做恢复。</li>\n<li>损失满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\varepsilon=\\rho_t^2\\ell_{x_0}$</span>，梯度尺度正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t c_t^2$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1/\\rho_t^2$</span> 可使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的梯度尺度一致，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1$</span> 下即有界。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-3-恢复算子的联合谱界与误差传播矩阵\">命题 3（恢复算子的联合谱界与误差传播矩阵）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-3-恢复算子的联合谱界与误差传播矩阵\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 成立；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha:=\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:=\\sigma_t$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^2+\\sigma^2=1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 精确，某一参数化的预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p$</span> 带有加性误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p=p+\\delta_p$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\{\\varepsilon,x_0,v\\}$</span> 为该时刻的真实量。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：三种参数化之间的换元构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的三组线性算子。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0,v)$</span> 视为同一向量空间中的三个坐标，则真实量满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\begin{pmatrix}\\varepsilon\\\\ x_0\\\\ v\\end{pmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;I&amp;0\\\\ I&amp;0&amp;0\\\\ \\alpha I&amp;-\\sigma I&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}\\text{ 的约束},$$</div>\n更直接地，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha x_0+\\sigma\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\alpha\\varepsilon-\\sigma x_0$</span>，可把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,v)$</span> 用正交矩阵联系：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\begin{pmatrix}x_t\\\\ v\\end{pmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\\alpha&amp;\\sigma\\\\ -\\sigma&amp;\\alpha\\end{pmatrix}\n\\begin{pmatrix}x_0\\\\ \\varepsilon\\end{pmatrix},\n\\qquad\n\\begin{pmatrix}\\alpha&amp;\\sigma\\\\ -\\sigma&amp;\\alpha\\end{pmatrix}^{\\top}\n\\begin{pmatrix}\\alpha&amp;\\sigma\\\\ -\\sigma&amp;\\alpha\\end{pmatrix}\n=\n(\\alpha^2+\\sigma^2)I_2=I_2 .$$</div>\n关键步骤：该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times2$</span> 分块矩阵是正交的，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^2+\\sigma^2=1$</span>。于是映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)\\mapsto(x_t,v)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{2d}$</span> 上的等距同构，其逆也是等距。由此，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,\\hat v)$</span> 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon)$</span> 的算子范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v=v+\\delta_v$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 精确，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0=\\alpha x_t-\\sigma\\hat v=x_0-\\sigma\\delta_v,\\qquad\n\\hat\\varepsilon=\\sigma x_t+\\alpha\\hat v=\\varepsilon+\\alpha\\delta_v,$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|(\\hat x_0-x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon)\\|=\\|\\delta_v\\|$</span>。这正是命题 1 推论中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化恢复算子范数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>”的精确陈述：它不是逐坐标的界，而是联合向量的等距性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（误差椭球）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_v\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\tau^2 I_d)$</span>，则恢复出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon)$</span> 的误差协方差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}\\begin{pmatrix}\\hat x_0-x_0\\\\ \\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon\\end{pmatrix}\n=\\tau^2\\begin{pmatrix}\\sigma^2 I_d&amp;-\\alpha\\sigma I_d\\\\ -\\alpha\\sigma I_d&amp;\\alpha^2 I_d\\end{pmatrix},$$</div>\n其特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^2$</span>（各重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>），即误差集中在一维子空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}\\{(-\\sigma,\\alpha)\\}$</span> 上。这说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的误差不会在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 两个方向同时放大，只会沿一个方向平移；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时误差协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^2\\tau^2 I_d$</span>，各向同性放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^2$</span> 倍。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-4-采样迭代中的误差累积\">命题 4（采样迭代中的误差累积）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-4-采样迭代中的误差累积\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)；采样器为显式 Euler 离散，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span>，在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 用参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的预测构造漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_\\pi(x_{t_k},t_k)$</span>；每步预测误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_k\\|\\le\\delta$</span>，且漂移关于预测是 Lipschitz 的，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\pi$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：单步更新写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k-1}}=x_{t_k}+\\Delta t\\,b_\\pi(x_{t_k},t_k)+\\Delta t\\,J_\\pi\\delta_k+O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\pi$</span> 是漂移关于该参数化预测的 Jacobian，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|J_\\pi\\|=\\Lambda_\\pi$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\Delta t$</span> 步求和，误差累积上界为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_{0}^{\\text{num}}-x_0\\|\\le \\Delta t\\,\\Lambda_\\pi\\delta\\sum_{k=1}^{N}\\prod_{j=k+1}^{N}(1+\\Delta t\\,L_{t_j})+O(\\Delta t),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t_j}$</span> 为漂移关于状态的 Lipschitz 常数。关键步骤：乘积因子由离散 Gronwall 不等式控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{j}(1+\\Delta t L_{t_j})\\le e^{\\int L}$</span>。于是累积误差正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\pi\\delta$</span>。三种参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\pi$</span> 的差异由命题 1 的恢复条件数决定：若采样器内部统一以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 恢复，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的有效 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon=\\kappa_t\\Lambda_{x_0}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的有效 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_v\\le\\Lambda_{x_0}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t,\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\le1$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（端点处的步长约束）</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 大的时刻，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的有效 Lipschitz 常数按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 放大，为保持累积误差有界，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\lesssim 1/(\\kappa_t\\Lambda_{x_0})$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化无此约束。这解释了为何在调度端点附近，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化采样需要更小步长或改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-5-训练目标的数值条件与梯度方差\">命题 5（训练目标的数值条件与梯度方差）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-5-训练目标的数值条件与梯度方差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A2)(A3)；训练样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 固定，网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_\\theta$</span>，损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\pi=\\|\\hat p_\\theta-p\\|^2$</span>；记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\pi=\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_\\pi$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的 Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_\\theta\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times|\\theta|}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|G_\\theta\\|$</span> 与参数化无关（同一网络结构）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\varepsilon=2G_\\theta^{\\top}(\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{x_0}=2G_\\theta^{\\top}(\\hat x_0-x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_v=2G_\\theta^{\\top}(\\hat v-v)$</span>。由命题 2 的关键等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon=-\\rho_t(\\hat x_0-x_0)$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_\\varepsilon=-\\rho_t\\,g_{x_0}.$$</div>\n关键步骤：梯度范数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g_\\varepsilon\\|=\\rho_t\\|g_{x_0}\\|$</span>。因此若以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\varepsilon$</span> 训练，梯度范数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 大的早期时刻被放大；若以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{x_0}$</span> 训练，梯度范数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 大的晚期时刻被放大。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v-v=\\alpha(\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon)-\\sigma(\\hat x_0-x_0)$</span>，在误差共线时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g_v\\|=\\sqrt{\\alpha^2\\rho_t^2+\\sigma^2}\\,\\|g_{x_0}\\|$</span>，其平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^2\\rho_t^2+\\sigma^2=\\alpha^4/\\sigma^2+\\sigma^2$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\in(0,1)$</span> 上有界于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_{\\min}^2$</span>，不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t\\to\\infty$</span> 爆炸。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（梯度方差的一致性）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_\\theta$</span> 的误差在各坐标独立同分布、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(g_\\varepsilon)=\\rho_t^2\\,\\mathrm{Var}(g_{x_0})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(g_v)=\\alpha^2\\mathrm{Var}(g_\\varepsilon)+\\sigma^2\\mathrm{Var}(g_{x_0})-2\\alpha\\sigma\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(g_\\varepsilon,g_{x_0})$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1/\\rho_t^2$</span> 加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\varepsilon$</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\lambda_t g_\\varepsilon)=\\mathrm{Var}(g_{x_0})$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关；这正是“损失加权”一节中加权使训练方差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上平稳的精确含义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-6-alpha_t-1-2-to0-时的极限行为\">命题 6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to0$</span> 时的极限行为）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-6-alpha_t-1-2-to0-时的极限行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 放宽为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon\\|\\le M$</span>；网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 有界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\to\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\to-\\sigma_t x_0\\to-x_0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to1$</span>）。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 渐近相同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\varepsilon$</span> 的梯度趋于零（网络只需复制输入），训练信号消失；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的相关系数趋于零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{x_0}$</span> 的梯度范数按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\to\\infty$</span> 放大，训练不稳定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\to-x_0$</span> 与输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\to\\varepsilon$</span> 仍不相关，但其损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_v$</span> 的梯度范数由命题 5 有界。关键等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v-v=\\alpha(\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon)-\\sigma(\\hat x_0-x_0)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v-v\\to-\\sigma(\\hat x_0-x_0)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在晚期退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化但带因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>，故梯度被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2$</span> 抑制而非放大。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（端点参数化的选择）</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to0$</span> 的晚期，应使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化并配以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1$</span> 的损失；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 的早期，应使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在两端均不退化，是唯一在整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 上梯度尺度有界且恢复算子范数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的参数化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-7-三种参数化的稳定性序\">命题 7（三种参数化的稳定性序）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-7-三种参数化的稳定性序\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_\\varepsilon:=\\kappa_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的算子范数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{x_0}:=\\rho_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的算子范数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_v:=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 恢复联合向量的算子范数）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1 与命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_\\varepsilon=\\kappa_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{x_0}=\\rho_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_v=1$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\rho_t=1$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max\\{c_\\varepsilon,c_{x_0}\\}\\ge1=c_v$</span>，且当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\rho_t=1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span>）时三者相等。故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_v\\le\\max\\{c_\\varepsilon,c_{x_0}\\}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的恢复条件数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，严格优于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化在端点处的表现。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（稳定性序的定量形式）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cond}_v(t)=1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cond}_\\varepsilon(t)=\\kappa_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cond}_{x_0}(t)=\\rho_t$</span>，两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上互为倒数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cond}_\\varepsilon(t)\\mathrm{cond}_{x_0}(t)=1$</span>。这意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的稳定性在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上互补：一个在早期稳定、晚期退化，另一个相反；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在两端均稳定，代价是在中间时刻（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span>）三种参数化等价，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 无额外优势。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-8-数值稳定性的可检验判据\">命题 8（数值稳定性的可检验判据）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-8-数值稳定性的可检验判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)；给定调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_s\\}$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span>；给定浮点精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：定义时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的<strong>稳定裕度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t:=\\min\\{\\kappa_t,\\rho_t\\}=1/\\mathrm{cond}_t$</span>。由命题 1，恢复误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cond}_t\\,u(\\|x_t\\|/\\sigma_t+2\\|\\hat p\\|)$</span>。若要求相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，则需\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{cond}_t\\le\\frac{\\eta}{u(\\|x_t\\|/\\sigma_t+2\\|\\hat p\\|)} .$$</div>\n关键步骤：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cond}_t=\\max\\{\\kappa_t,\\rho_t\\}$</span> 只依赖调度，可在训练前对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 计算并检查该不等式；若不成立，则该时刻的该参数化不可用于恢复，必须换参数化或提高精度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8（调度设计约束）</strong>：为使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cond}_\\varepsilon(t)\\le C$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t/\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\le C$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge1/(1+C^2)$</span>；为使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化满足同样约束，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\le C^2/(1+C^2)$</span>。两者不能同时对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，故单一参数化无法在整个调度上保持稳定裕度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化无此约束，因为其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cond}_v=1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-代码-梯度尺度与误差累积的数值验证\">代码：梯度尺度与误差累积的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-代码-梯度尺度与误差累积的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef cond_numbers(alpha_bar):\n    a = np.sqrt(alpha_bar)\n    s = np.sqrt(1.0 - alpha_bar)\n    return a, s, s / a, a / s\n\n# 命题 5：梯度范数比 g_eps / g_x0 = rho_t\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\nd, n_theta = 4, 16\nG = rng.normal(size=(d, n_theta))\nfor ab in [0.99, 0.5, 0.01]:\n    a, s, kappa, rho = cond_numbers(ab)\n    x0 = rng.normal(size=d)\n    eps = rng.normal(size=d)\n    xt = a * x0 + s * eps\n    # 假设网络预测带有固定误差 delta_x0，则 g_x0 = 2 G^T delta_x0\n    delta_x0 = rng.normal(size=d) * 1e-3\n    g_x0 = 2 * G.T @ delta_x0\n    delta_eps = -rho * delta_x0          # 由命题 2 的关键等式\n    g_eps = 2 * G.T @ delta_eps\n    ratio = np.linalg.norm(g_eps) / np.linalg.norm(g_x0)\n    print(f&quot;alpha_bar={ab}: ||g_eps||/||g_x0||={ratio:.4f}, rho={rho:.4f}&quot;)\n    assert abs(ratio - rho) &lt; 1e-10\n\n# 命题 3：v 参数化恢复是等距的\nfor ab in [0.99, 0.5, 0.01]:\n    a, s, _, _ = cond_numbers(ab)\n    delta_v = rng.normal(size=d) * 1e-3\n    delta_x0_rec = -s * delta_v\n    delta_eps_rec = a * delta_v\n    joint = np.concatenate([delta_x0_rec, delta_eps_rec])\n    print(f&quot;alpha_bar={ab}: ||joint||={np.linalg.norm(joint):.6e}, ||delta_v||={np.linalg.norm(delta_v):.6e}&quot;)\n    assert abs(np.linalg.norm(joint) - np.linalg.norm(delta_v)) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 命题 7：cond_eps * cond_x0 = 1\nfor ab in [0.99, 0.5, 0.01]:\n    _, _, kappa, rho = cond_numbers(ab)\n    assert abs(kappa * rho - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;stability order checks: OK&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：第一组打印三个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g_\\varepsilon\\|/\\|g_{x_0}\\|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span>，两者相等（误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-10}$</span>）；第二组打印 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化恢复的联合误差范数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_v\\|$</span> 相等（误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-12}$</span>）；最后一行打印 <code>stability order checks: OK</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-9-恢复算子的谱范数与逐坐标误差的分离\">命题 9（恢复算子的谱范数与逐坐标误差的分离）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-9-恢复算子的谱范数与逐坐标误差的分离\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 成立；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha:=\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:=\\sigma_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^2+\\sigma^2=1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 带有误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_\\varepsilon$</span> 的各坐标独立、均值零、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{\\varepsilon\\to x_0}$</span> 的 Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\kappa_t I_d$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0-x_0=-\\kappa_t\\delta_\\varepsilon$</span>。逐坐标看，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}((\\hat x_0-x_0)_i)=\\kappa_t^2\\tau^2$</span>，各向同性。但若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon)$</span> 作为联合向量考察，其误差协方差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}\\begin{pmatrix}\\hat x_0-x_0\\\\ \\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon\\end{pmatrix}\n=\\tau^2\\begin{pmatrix}\\kappa_t^2 I_d&amp;-\\kappa_t I_d\\\\ -\\kappa_t I_d&amp;I_d\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n关键步骤：该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2d\\times2d$</span> 矩阵的秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，因为第二块行是第一块行的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\kappa_t^{-1}$</span> 倍。其特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^2(1+\\kappa_t^2)$</span>（重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>）。于是联合误差的谱范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\sqrt{1+\\kappa_t^2}$</span>，而逐坐标方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^2\\tau^2$</span>。这说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时，逐坐标误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 放大，但联合向量的误差并不比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\tau$</span> 更大；两者相差一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1+\\kappa_t^{-2}}$</span> 的因子，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\gg1$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9（逐坐标判据与联合判据的差异）</strong>：以逐坐标相对误差为判据时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 大的时刻不可用；以联合范数为判据时，放大因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1+\\kappa_t^2}$</span>，与逐坐标判据同阶。故两种判据在端点处给出相同的“不可用”结论，但在中间时刻（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\approx1$</span>）联合判据略宽于逐坐标判据。这一差异不影响命题 7 的稳定性序，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的联合恢复算子范数恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1+\\kappa_t^2}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t&gt;0$</span>）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-10-sigma_t-to0-时的极限行为与对偶性\">命题 10（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 时的极限行为与对偶性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-10-sigma_t-to0-时的极限行为与对偶性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 放宽为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon\\|\\le M$</span>；网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 有界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\to x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\to\\varepsilon$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\alpha\\varepsilon-\\sigma x_0\\to\\varepsilon$</span>）。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 渐近相同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{x_0}$</span> 的梯度趋于零，训练信号消失；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的相关系数趋于零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\varepsilon$</span> 的梯度范数按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t\\to\\infty$</span> 放大，训练不稳定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\to\\varepsilon$</span> 与输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\to x_0$</span> 仍不相关，但其损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_v$</span> 的梯度范数由命题 5 有界。关键等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v-v=\\alpha(\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon)-\\sigma(\\hat x_0-x_0)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v-v\\to\\alpha(\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在早期退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化但带因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>，故梯度被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^2$</span> 抑制而非放大。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 10（端点对偶性）</strong>：命题 6 与命题 10 互为对偶：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to0$</span> 的晚期，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 退化为带因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 的早期，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 退化为带因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化。两端的抑制因子分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^2$</span>，均不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在两端均不放大梯度，而在中间时刻（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=\\sigma=1/\\sqrt2$</span>）抑制因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，梯度尺度略小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化。这一对偶性说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的稳定性不是偶然的，而是正交换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)\\mapsto(x_t,v)$</span> 的等距性在梯度层面的直接后果。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-11-损失加权与恢复算子范数的乘积界\">命题 11（损失加权与恢复算子范数的乘积界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-11-损失加权与恢复算子范数的乘积界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)；训练损失取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\ell_\\pi$</span>，采样时用恢复算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{\\pi\\to\\pi'}$</span>，其算子范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>；网络输出关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的 Jacobian 范数与参数化无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 2 与命题 5，加权后的梯度范数满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\lambda_t g_\\pi\\|=\\lambda_t\\,c_t\\,\\|g_{\\pi'}\\|,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 恢复到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的算子范数。关键步骤：若要求训练梯度尺度与采样恢复误差在同一量级上受控，则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t c_t\\le1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化恢复到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\kappa_t$</span>，故需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\le1/\\kappa_t=\\rho_t$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化恢复到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\rho_t$</span>，故需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\le\\kappa_t$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\le1$</span> 即可。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 11（加权与恢复的联合设计）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=\\min\\{\\kappa_t,\\rho_t\\}=1/\\mathrm{cond}_t$</span> 可使三种参数化的加权梯度范数均不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g_{\\pi'}\\|$</span>。这一加权在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，在两端按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min\\{\\kappa_t,\\rho_t\\}$</span> 衰减，恰与命题 8 的稳定裕度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 一致。因此稳定裕度不仅是恢复误差的判据，也是损失加权设计的自然尺度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=\\mu_t$</span> 同时控制训练梯度与采样恢复误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-12-混合精度下的恢复误差下界\">命题 12（混合精度下的恢复误差下界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-12-混合精度下的恢复误差下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 位浮点表示，相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-b}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p$</span> 精确。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1 的误差上界，恢复误差至少含一项来自系数表示的误差。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha=\\alpha(1+\\epsilon_\\alpha)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma=\\sigma(1+\\epsilon_\\sigma)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\epsilon_\\alpha|,|\\epsilon_\\sigma|\\le2^{-b}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_{\\varepsilon\\to x_0}$</span> 的系数误差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\tilde\\sigma}{\\tilde\\alpha}-\\frac{\\sigma}{\\alpha}\n=\\kappa_t\\big((1+\\epsilon_\\sigma)(1+\\epsilon_\\alpha)^{-1}-1\\big)\n=\\kappa_t(\\epsilon_\\sigma-\\epsilon_\\alpha)+O(2^{-2b}).$$</div>\n关键步骤：该误差的绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\kappa_t\\,2^{-b}$</span>。故即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 精确，恢复误差的下界也正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\,2^{-b}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12（精度与调度的匹配）</strong>：若要求恢复相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\kappa_t\\,2^{-b}\\le\\eta$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\ge\\log_2(2\\kappa_t/\\eta)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 大的端点，所需位数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log_2\\kappa_t$</span> 增长；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的系数误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span> 的直接误差，均不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-b}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 无关。故在固定精度下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在端点处的恢复误差下界严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-13-采样一致性的数值必要条件\">命题 13（采样一致性的数值必要条件）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-13-采样一致性的数值必要条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)；采样器在每步用参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的预测构造漂移，且漂移关于预测的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\pi$</span>；每步预测误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_k\\|\\le\\delta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 4，累积误差上界正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\pi\\delta$</span>。若采样器在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化预测但内部以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 恢复，则有效 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon=\\kappa_t\\Lambda_{x_0}$</span>；若用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化，则有效 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_v\\le\\Lambda_{x_0}$</span>。关键步骤：采样一致性要求不同参数化在相同数值精度下给出相同的样本分布，这等价于要求累积误差上界与参数化无关，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\pi\\delta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 上一致有界。由命题 7，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化满足这一条件；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化需配合命题 11 的加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=\\mu_t$</span> 才能使有效 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\pi\\delta$</span> 一致有界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 13（一致性的定量形式）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=\\mu_t$</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的有效误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\kappa_t\\delta=\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的有效误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\rho_t\\delta=\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的有效误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>。三者相等，故在加权意义下三种参数化在数值上一致；不加权时只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化一致。这为“采样的一致性”一节提供了数值层面的必要条件：一致性不仅是分布层面的等式，也要求误差上界在参数化上一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-14-恢复条件数与调度端点的定量关系\">命题 14（恢复条件数与调度端点的定量关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-14-恢复条件数与调度端点的定量关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)；调度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\in(0,1)$</span>；记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\alpha_{\\mathrm{end}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\sigma_t/\\alpha_t^{1/2}=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/(1+\\kappa_t^2)$</span>。关键步骤：该式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的一一对应。在端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\alpha_{\\mathrm{end}}$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_T=\\sqrt{(1-\\alpha_{\\mathrm{end}})/\\alpha_{\\mathrm{end}}}$</span>；在起点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=1-\\beta_1$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_1=\\sqrt{(1-\\beta_1)/\\beta_1}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{\\mathrm{end}}=10^{-3}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_T\\approx31.6$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=10^{-4}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_1\\approx100$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 14（端点稳定裕度的调度约束）</strong>：为使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cond}_t\\le C$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\le C$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t\\le C$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in[1/(1+C^2),\\,C^2/(1+C^2)]$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 单调递减，这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1\\le C^2/(1+C^2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\ge1/(1+C^2)$</span>。若调度端点超出此区间，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化在端点处不可用，必须改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化或提高浮点精度。这一约束与命题 8 的推论 8 一致，但给出了端点处的显式数值：例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=10$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1\\le0.99$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\ge0.0099$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-命题-15-数值稳定性与采样一致性的联合判据\">命题 15（数值稳定性与采样一致性的联合判据）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-命题-15-数值稳定性与采样一致性的联合判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)；训练损失取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\ell_\\pi$</span>，采样用参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 恢复，恢复算子范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>；要求训练梯度尺度与采样累积误差均不超过给定阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 11，训练梯度尺度上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t c_t\\|g_{\\pi'}\\|$</span>；由命题 4，采样累积误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\,\\Lambda_{\\pi'}\\delta\\sum_k\\prod_j(1+\\Delta t L_{t_j})$</span>，其中有效 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\pi'}=c_t\\Lambda_{\\pi}$</span>。关键步骤：两个上界都正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>，故联合判据为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t c_t\\le\\Gamma/\\|g_{\\pi'}\\|$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\Lambda_\\pi\\delta\\le\\Gamma$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1/c_t$</span> 可使两个不等式同时化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g_{\\pi'}\\|\\le\\Gamma$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\pi\\delta\\le\\Gamma$</span>，与参数化无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15（联合判据的参数化无关性）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1/c_t=\\mu_t$</span> 后，训练梯度尺度与采样累积误差的上界均与参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 无关，只依赖网络 Jacobian 范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g_{\\pi'}\\|$</span>、漂移 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\pi$</span> 与预测误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>。这给出数值稳定性的最终形式：稳定性不是某一参数化的属性，而是“参数化 + 损失加权 + 恢复算子”三元组的联合属性；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1$</span> 下即满足联合判据，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=\\mu_t$</span> 才满足。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-采样的一致性\">采样的一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-采样的一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t:=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>。三种参数化在本章前六节已定义为网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{\\theta}(x_t,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，它们分别被训练去逼近条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[v\\mid x_t]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v:=\\alpha_t\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t x_0$</span> 是本章 canonical 的速度变量。</p>\n<p>本节引入的采样一致性讨论需要以下新符号，先在此定义并写入符号表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>采样映射</strong>：给定参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\{\\varepsilon,x,v\\}$</span> 与网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u_\\theta^{\\pi}(x_t,t)$</span>，采样器在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 产生一步更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=S^{\\pi}_t(x_t;\\hat u_\\theta^{\\pi})$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\pi$</span> 为该参数化诱导的<strong>单步采样映射</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性泛函</strong>：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C_t^{\\pi}(x_t):=\\big\\|S_t^{\\pi}\\big(x_t;\\hat u^{\\pi}_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)-S_t^{\\pi}\\big(x_t;u^{\\pi\\star}(x_t,t)\\big)\\big\\|_2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^{\\pi\\star}(x_t,t)$</span> 是该参数化下由真实后验给出的<strong>理想预测子</strong>（即条件期望的精确值）。</li>\n<li><strong>参数化转换算子</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf T_{\\varepsilon\\to x},\\mathsf T_{x\\to\\varepsilon},\\mathsf T_{\\varepsilon\\to v},\\mathsf T_{v\\to\\varepsilon},\\mathsf T_{x\\to v},\\mathsf T_{v\\to x}$</span>，均由本章第 4 节的三条 canonical 恒等式诱导，作用在预测子上而非仅作用在随机变量上。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设如下，逐条在命题中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(H1)（可测与可积）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)\\mapsto(x_t,\\varepsilon)$</span> 为 Borel 可测，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[v\\mid x_t]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\gamma_t)$</span> 中存在，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的律。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2)（Lipschitz 采样映射）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t^{\\pi}(x_t;u)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^{\\pi}$</span>-Lipschitz 的，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t^{\\pi}$</span>-Lipschitz 的，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\pi,M_t^\\pi&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3)（转换算子的有界性）</strong> 三个转换算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf T_{\\pi\\to\\pi'}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\gamma_t)$</span> 上有界，算子范数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{\\pi\\to\\pi'}$</span>，且由 canonical 恒等式给出显式界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{\\varepsilon\\to x}=\\sigma_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{x\\to\\varepsilon}=1/\\sigma_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{\\varepsilon\\to v}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{v\\to\\varepsilon}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{x\\to v}=\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{v\\to x}=1/\\alpha_t$</span>。这些界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t,\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 上有限，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{v\\to x}$</span> 发散，此即数值稳定性一节所讨论的退化来源。</p>\n<p><strong>(H4)（理想预测子的相容性）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，理想预测子满足本章第 4 节的等价关系逐点成立：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathsf T_{\\varepsilon\\to x}\\big(\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)\\big)=x^\\star(x_t,t),\\quad\n\\mathsf T_{\\varepsilon\\to v}\\big(\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)\\big)=v^\\star(x_t,t),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[v\\mid x_t]$</span>。该假设不是额外要求，而是 canonical 恒等式在三者上的直接推论，本节在命题 15.7.1 中验证其自洽性。</p>\n<p>本节的核心问题是：<strong>当网络预测子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u^\\pi_\\theta$</span> 与理想预测子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^{\\pi\\star}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\gamma_t)$</span> 意义下接近时，采样轨迹是否在相同意义下接近？</strong> 采样一致性就是这一逼近在采样映射层面的传递性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-一致性泛函的-Lipschitz-控制\">一致性泛函的 Lipschitz 控制<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-一致性泛函的-Lipschitz-控制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.7.1（预测误差到采样误差的传递）</strong>\n在 (H1)–(H4) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C_t^{\\pi}(x_t)\\le L_t^{\\pi}\\,\\big\\|\\hat u^{\\pi}_\\theta(x_t,t)-u^{\\pi\\star}(x_t,t)\\big\\|_2\\quad \\gamma_t\\text{-a.e.}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (H2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t^{\\pi}(x_t;\\cdot)$</span> 关于第二个变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\pi$</span>-Lipschitz，故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,u'$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|S_t^{\\pi}(x_t;u)-S_t^{\\pi}(x_t;u')\\|_2\\le L_t^{\\pi}\\|u-u'\\|_2.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\hat u^\\pi_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u'=u^{\\pi\\star}(x_t,t)$</span>，逐点代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：采样一致性误差被预测误差乘以采样映射的 Lipschitz 常数控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\pi$</span> 由采样器的具体形式决定，不同参数化诱导的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t^\\pi$</span> 形式不同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\pi$</span> 不同，这正是“参数化影响采样一致性”的数学来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-三种参数化下的一致性等价\">三种参数化下的一致性等价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-三种参数化下的一致性等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.7.2（一致性泛函的等价界）</strong>\n在 (H1)–(H4) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，存在仅依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t)$</span> 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^{\\pi\\to\\pi'}$</span>，使得对任意网络预测子，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C_t^{\\pi}(x_t)\\le c_t^{\\pi\\to\\pi'}\\,\\mathcal C_t^{\\pi'}(x_t)+L_t^{\\pi}\\,\\kappa_t^{\\pi'\\to\\pi}\\,\\big\\|\\hat u^{\\pi'}_\\theta-u^{\\pi'\\star}\\big\\|_{L^2(\\gamma_t)}.$$</div>\n特别地，当两个参数化的采样映射取相同形式（例如同为 DDIM 更新）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^{\\pi\\to\\pi'}=1$</span>，一致性泛函在三种参数化下彼此等价，等价常数由 (H3) 的算子范数给出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由三角不等式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C_t^{\\pi}\\le L_t^{\\pi}\\|\\hat u^{\\pi}_\\theta-u^{\\pi\\star}\\|_2\n\\le L_t^{\\pi}\\big(\\|\\hat u^{\\pi}_\\theta-\\mathsf T_{\\pi'\\to\\pi}\\hat u^{\\pi'}_\\theta\\|_2+\\|\\mathsf T_{\\pi'\\to\\pi}\\hat u^{\\pi'}_\\theta-\\mathsf T_{\\pi'\\to\\pi}u^{\\pi'\\star}\\|_2+\\|\\mathsf T_{\\pi'\\to\\pi}u^{\\pi'\\star}-u^{\\pi\\star}\\|_2\\big).$$</div>\n由 (H4)，最后一项为零。由 (H3)，中间项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\kappa_t^{\\pi'\\to\\pi}\\|\\hat u^{\\pi'}_\\theta-u^{\\pi'\\star}\\|_2$</span>。第一项是“同一网络在不同参数化下表示同一预测子”的转换误差，当网络输出被精确转换时为零；若网络未精确转换，该项由转换算子的有界性控制，其系数即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^{\\pi\\to\\pi'}$</span>。合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.7.2 的关键结论是：<strong>一致性不是某一参数化的私有性质，而是三者在转换算子有界意义下的等价类</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{v\\to x}=1/\\alpha_t\\to\\infty$</span>，等价界退化，这解释了为何在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的采样一致性不能被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的界控制——这是数值稳定性一节所预警的退化在采样层面的体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-采样映射的相容性条件\">采样映射的相容性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-采样映射的相容性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 15.7.3（采样映射相容）</strong> 称参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的采样映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t^{\\pi}$</span> 与理想预测子<strong>相容</strong>，若对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_t^{\\pi}\\big(x_t;u^{\\pi\\star}(x_t,t)\\big)=S_t^{\\pi'}\\big(x_t;u^{\\pi'\\star}(x_t,t)\\big)\\quad\\text{对所有 }\\pi'\\in\\{\\varepsilon,x,v\\}.$$</div>\n即三种参数化在理想预测子下产生相同的单步更新。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.7.4（相容性的充分条件）</strong>\n在 (H1)–(H4) 下，若采样映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t^{\\pi}$</span> 可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t^{\\pi}(x_t;u)=A_t x_t+B_t\\,\\mathsf T_{\\pi\\to\\text{canon}}(u)$</span> 的形式，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf T_{\\pi\\to\\text{canon}}$</span> 把任意参数化预测子转换为同一 canonical 变量（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t,B_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 无关，则三种参数化相容。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf T_{\\pi\\to\\text{canon}}(u^{\\pi\\star})=\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 对三个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 相同。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t^\\pi$</span> 的表达式，三个参数化给出同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_tx_t+B_t\\varepsilon^\\star$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题给出一个可检验的推论：<strong>DDIM 与 DDPM 的采样更新在理想预测子下对三种参数化一致</strong>，因为它们的更新都可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_tx_t+B_t\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 的形式（系数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 决定）。不一致只可能来自网络预测误差经不同转换算子放大后的差异，即命题 15.7.2 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{\\pi'\\to\\pi}$</span> 项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形下的一致性验证\">具体例子：一维高斯情形下的一致性验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形下的一致性验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\sigma_t=1/\\sqrt2$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}x_0+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\varepsilon$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。条件期望可精确计算：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t)=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}x_t,\\quad\nx^\\star(x_t)=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}x_t,\\quad\nv^\\star(x_t)=\\alpha_t\\varepsilon^\\star-\\sigma_t x^\\star=\\frac12x_t-\\frac12x_t=0.$$</div>\n验证 canonical 恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star=\\frac{x_t-\\alpha_t x^\\star}{\\sigma_t}=\\frac{x_t-\\frac12x_t}{1/\\sqrt2}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}x_t$</span>，与上式一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=\\alpha_t\\varepsilon^\\star-\\sigma_t x^\\star=\\frac12x_t-\\frac12x_t=0$</span>，与上式一致。三种理想预测子满足 (H4)。</p>\n<p>取 DDIM 更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t(x_t;u)=A_tx_t+B_tu$</span>，其中对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_t=\\sigma_t$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_t=\\alpha_t$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_t=1$</span>（系数由各参数化的 canonical 恒等式反解得到）。代入理想预测子：\n- <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_tx_t+\\sigma_t\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}x_t$</span>；\n- <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 参数化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_tx_t+\\alpha_t\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}x_t$</span>；\n- <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_tx_t+1\\cdot0=A_tx_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t$</span> 取 DDIM 的标准系数时，三者相等（可直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\sigma_t=1/\\sqrt2$</span> 验证）。这验证了命题 15.7.4 的相容性在具体数值上成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-采样一致性的可检验判据\">采样一致性的可检验判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-采样一致性的可检验判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 15.7.5（一致性判据）</strong>\n在 (H1)–(H4) 下，若网络预测误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat u^\\pi_\\theta-u^{\\pi\\star}\\|_{L^2(\\gamma_t)}\\le\\delta$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 成立，则采样轨迹的期望一致性误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[\\mathcal C_t^{\\pi}(x_t)\\big]\\le L_t^{\\pi}\\,\\delta,$$</div>\n且三种参数化之间的轨迹差异被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_{\\pi,\\pi'}L_t^{\\pi}\\kappa_t^{\\pi'\\to\\pi}\\delta$</span> 控制。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对命题 15.7.1 取期望，由 (H1) 的可积性保证期望有限；对命题 15.7.2 取期望并用 (H3) 的算子范数，即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出工程上可操作的判据：<strong>若训练损失（在三种参数化下分别度量）都小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>，则采样一致性误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 乘以采样器 Lipschitz 常数控制</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{v\\to x}$</span> 发散，判据在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时失效，这与数值稳定性一节的结论一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时不能由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的误差界控制，必须单独处理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ndef check_consistency(d=1, alpha_t=0.5**0.5, sigma_t=0.5**0.5, delta=1e-3, seed=0):\n    torch.manual_seed(seed)\n    # 构造理想预测子：一维高斯情形下三者均为 x_t 的线性函数\n    x_t = torch.randn(1000, d)\n    eps_star = (1.0 / sigma_t) * (x_t - alpha_t * (alpha_t * x_t))  # 由 canonical 恒等式\n    x_star = alpha_t * x_t - sigma_t * eps_star\n    v_star = alpha_t * eps_star - sigma_t * x_star\n    # 验证 canonical 恒等式\n    assert torch.allclose(eps_star, (x_t - alpha_t * x_star) / sigma_t, atol=1e-6)\n    assert torch.allclose(v_star, alpha_t * eps_star - sigma_t * x_star, atol=1e-6)\n    # 构造扰动预测子\n    eps_hat = eps_star + delta * torch.randn_like(eps_star)\n    x_hat = x_star + delta * torch.randn_like(x_star)\n    v_hat = v_star + delta * torch.randn_like(v_star)\n    # DDIM 形式采样映射：S(x_t;u)=A x_t + B u，三种参数化 B 不同\n    A = 0.9\n    S_eps = A * x_t + sigma_t * eps_hat\n    S_x = A * x_t + alpha_t * x_hat\n    S_v = A * x_t + 1.0 * v_hat\n    # 理想预测子下三者应一致\n    S_eps_star = A * x_t + sigma_t * eps_star\n    S_x_star = A * x_t + alpha_t * x_star\n    S_v_star = A * x_t + 1.0 * v_star\n    assert torch.allclose(S_eps_star, S_x_star, atol=1e-6)\n    assert torch.allclose(S_eps_star, S_v_star, atol=1e-6)\n    # 扰动下的一致性误差被 L*delta 控制（L 取 1 的粗界）\n    err_eps = (S_eps - S_eps_star).norm(dim=-1).mean().item()\n    err_x = (S_x - S_x_star).norm(dim=-1).mean().item()\n    err_v = (S_v - S_v_star).norm(dim=-1).mean().item()\n    print(&quot;shape:&quot;, x_t.shape, &quot;eps_star:&quot;, eps_star.shape)\n    print(&quot;ideal maps equal:&quot;, torch.allclose(S_eps_star, S_v_star, atol=1e-6))\n    print(&quot;err_eps, err_x, err_v:&quot;, err_eps, err_x, err_v)\n    assert err_eps &lt; 10 * delta and err_x &lt; 10 * delta and err_v &lt; 10 * delta\n    return True\n\nassert check_consistency()\nprint(&quot;consistency check passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>采样一致性泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C_t^\\pi$</span> 被预测误差乘以采样映射 Lipschitz 常数控制（命题 15.7.1），这是预测误差到采样误差的传递机制。</li>\n<li>三种参数化的一致性在转换算子有界意义下等价（命题 15.7.2），等价常数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{\\pi\\to\\pi'}$</span> 给出；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\to x$</span> 的等价界发散，一致性判据在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 退化。</li>\n<li>采样映射相容的充分条件是更新可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_tx_t+B_t\\mathsf T_{\\pi\\to\\text{canon}}(u)$</span> 且系数与参数化无关（命题 15.7.4），DDIM/DDPM 满足此条件，故理想预测子下三种参数化产生相同单步更新。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-多步采样的误差累积与一致性传播\">多步采样的误差累积与一致性传播<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-多步采样的误差累积与一致性传播\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>单步一致性（命题 15.7.1）只控制一次更新，而采样器实际执行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步复合。需要把单步控制提升为轨迹级控制，这要求对复合映射的 Lipschitz 常数给出显式估计。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.7.6（轨迹一致性泛函）</strong> 固定参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 与初始噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span>，记采样轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t^{\\pi,\\star}\\}_{t=T}^{0}$</span> 为使用理想预测子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^{\\pi\\star}$</span> 的确定性采样轨迹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t^{\\pi,\\theta}\\}$</span> 为使用网络预测子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat u^\\pi_\\theta$</span> 的轨迹。定义轨迹级一致性泛函\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C^{\\pi}_{\\mathrm{traj}}(x_T):=\\max_{0\\le t\\le T}\\big\\|x_t^{\\pi,\\theta}-x_t^{\\pi,\\star}\\big\\|_2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.7.7（轨迹误差的乘积界）</strong>\n在 (H1)–(H4) 下，若采样映射对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t^\\pi$</span>-Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\pi$</span>-Lipschitz，且网络预测误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\|\\hat u^\\pi_\\theta(x_t,t)-u^{\\pi\\star}(x_t,t)\\|_2\\le\\delta$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C^{\\pi}_{\\mathrm{traj}}(x_T)\\le\\delta\\sum_{t=1}^{T}L_t^{\\pi}\\prod_{s=t+1}^{T}M_s^{\\pi}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 作归纳。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_t:=\\|x_t^{\\pi,\\theta}-x_t^{\\pi,\\star}\\|_2$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t^\\pi$</span> 的双 Lipschitz 性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_{t-1}\\le M_t^{\\pi}e_t+L_t^{\\pi}\\big\\|\\hat u^\\pi_\\theta(x_t^{\\pi,\\theta},t)-u^{\\pi\\star}(x_t^{\\pi,\\star},t)\\big\\|_2.$$</div>\n右端第二项需拆分为“同一输入点上的预测误差”与“输入点漂移导致的理想预测子差异”。由 (H4) 与理想预测子关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性（记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t^\\pi$</span>，由 (H1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 可积性与条件期望的正则性保证），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\hat u^\\pi_\\theta(x_t^{\\pi,\\theta},t)-u^{\\pi\\star}(x_t^{\\pi,\\star},t)\\big\\|_2\\le\\delta+K_t^{\\pi}e_t.$$</div>\n合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{t-1}\\le(M_t^{\\pi}+L_t^{\\pi}K_t^{\\pi})e_t+L_t^{\\pi}\\delta$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde M_t^{\\pi}:=M_t^{\\pi}+L_t^{\\pi}K_t^{\\pi}$</span>，递推展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_0\\le\\delta\\sum_{t=1}^{T}L_t^{\\pi}\\prod_{s=t+1}^{T}\\tilde M_s^{\\pi}.$$</div>\n由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_T=0$</span>（同一初始噪声），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_t e_t$</span> 由上式右端控制（每一步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_t$</span> 都是同一递推的部分和），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde M_s^\\pi$</span> 的上界即得所述乘积界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题揭示了采样一致性的<strong>指数放大机制</strong>：乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=t+1}^{T}M_s^{\\pi}$</span> 随步数增长。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_s^\\pi&gt;1$</span> 时误差被放大，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_s^\\pi&lt;1$</span> 时误差被压缩。DDIM 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 递减区间上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t^\\pi&lt;1$</span>，故误差沿采样方向收缩；但在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的区间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t^\\pi$</span> 可能接近或超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，此时一致性最脆弱。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-一致性常数在三种参数化下的比较\">一致性常数在三种参数化下的比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-一致性常数在三种参数化下的比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.7.7 的乘积界依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_t^\\pi,M_t^\\pi,K_t^\\pi)$</span>，这些常数因参数化而异。需要给出三者的显式比较，才能回答“哪种参数化采样一致性更好”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.7.8（Lipschitz 常数的参数化依赖）</strong>\n在 (H1)–(H4) 下，对 DDIM 形式的采样映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t^\\pi(x_t;u)=A_tx_t+B_t^\\pi u$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t^{\\varepsilon}=\\sigma_tB_t,\\quad L_t^{x}=\\alpha_tB_t,\\quad L_t^{v}=B_t,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t^\\pi=A_t$</span> 对三种参数化相同（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 无关）。因此单步一致性误差的上界之比为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t^{\\varepsilon}:L_t^{x}:L_t^{v}=\\sigma_t:\\alpha_t:1.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t^\\pi$</span> 的线性形式，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|B_t^\\pi|$</span>。由命题 15.7.4 的相容性构造，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_t^\\varepsilon=\\sigma_tB_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_t^x=\\alpha_tB_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_t^v=B_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_t$</span> 是 canonical 变量（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>）前的系数。关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|A_t|$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题给出一个可检验的推论：<strong>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\ll\\sigma_t$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的单步一致性误差上界远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化</strong>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\ll\\sigma_t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^x\\ll L_t^\\varepsilon$</span>。反之，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\gg\\sigma_t$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的上界更小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^v=B_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 无关，在两端都保持中等大小，这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化被设计为“全区间稳定”的数学根据。</p>\n<p>但需注意：上界之比不等于实际误差之比。实际误差还取决于网络在对应参数化下的预测误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^\\pi$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^x$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\alpha_t$</span> 放大而变大（见数值稳定性一节），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^x\\delta^x$</span> 未必小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\varepsilon\\delta^\\varepsilon$</span>。一致性比较必须同时考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^\\pi$</span>，这是命题 15.7.2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{\\pi'\\to\\pi}$</span> 项的作用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-采样一致性的充要刻画\">采样一致性的充要刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-采样一致性的充要刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前面的命题给出充分条件。一个自然的问题是：单步相容（定义 15.7.3）是否也是轨迹一致的充分条件？答案是肯定的，但需要额外的稳定性条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.7.9（相容性 + 稳定性 ⇒ 轨迹一致）</strong>\n在 (H1)–(H4) 下，若三种参数化的采样映射两两相容（定义 15.7.3），且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;1$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t^\\pi\\le M$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,\\pi$</span> 成立，则对任意初始噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span>，三条理想轨迹重合，且网络轨迹之间的差异满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\max_{0\\le t\\le T}\\|x_t^{\\pi,\\theta}-x_t^{\\pi',\\theta}\\|_2\\le\\frac{L^{\\pi}\\delta^\\pi+L^{\\pi'}\\delta^{\\pi'}}{1-M},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\pi:=\\max_tL_t^\\pi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^\\pi:=\\sup_t\\|\\hat u^\\pi_\\theta-u^{\\pi\\star}\\|_2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 理想轨迹重合由相容性逐点成立直接得到（每一步更新相同，归纳即得）。对网络轨迹，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t:=\\|x_t^{\\pi,\\theta}-x_t^{\\pi',\\theta}\\|_2$</span>。由双 Lipschitz 性与相容性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_{t-1}\\le M_t^\\pi d_t+L_t^\\pi\\delta^\\pi+L_t^{\\pi'}\\delta^{\\pi'}\\le M d_t+L^\\pi\\delta^\\pi+L^{\\pi'}\\delta^{\\pi'}.$$</div>\n递推并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_0\\le(L^\\pi\\delta^\\pi+L^{\\pi'}\\delta^{\\pi'})/(1-M)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_t d_t$</span> 由同一界控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;1$</span> 是关键的稳定性条件：它保证误差不沿采样方向累积放大。DDIM 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 单调递减的区间上满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t^\\pi=A_t&lt;1$</span>，但在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t$</span> 可能接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-M)$</span> 变大，一致性界退化。这与命题 15.7.7 的乘积界一致：两者都指出采样一致性的瓶颈在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 端。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-一个反例边界-相容但不稳定\">一个反例边界：相容但不稳定<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-一个反例边界-相容但不稳定\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.7.9 的稳定性条件不可去掉。构造如下：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_1^\\pi=M_2^\\pi=2$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t=2$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\pi=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^\\pi=\\delta$</span>。相容性成立（三种参数化理想轨迹重合），但网络轨迹差异为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_0\\le 2d_1+\\delta\\le 2(2d_2+\\delta)+\\delta=4d_2+3\\delta.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_2=0$</span>（同一初始噪声）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_0\\le3\\delta$</span>，看似有界；但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_0\\le(2^T-1)\\delta$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 指数增长。这说明<strong>相容性本身不保证轨迹一致，稳定性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;1$</span>）是独立必需的条件</strong>。该反例的完整构造与失效分析归入本章第 10 节（反例节），此处仅指出边界：去掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;1$</span> 后命题 15.7.9 的界不再成立，一致性必须逐点验证而非由相容性推出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-与-score-参数化的接口-仅作衔接-不展开\">与 score 参数化的接口（仅作衔接，不展开）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-与-score-参数化的接口-仅作衔接-不展开\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的一致性分析只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon,x_0,v$</span> 三种参数化。第 8 节将证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测与 score 预测在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\gamma_t)$</span> 上通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=-\\sigma_t\\,\\nabla\\log\\gamma_t(x_t)$</span> 等价，故本节所有一致性结论可经该恒等式移植到 score 参数化。移植时需注意：score 的转换算子范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时发散，故 score 参数化的一致性界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 端比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化更差，这与第 6 节数值稳定性的结论一致。具体推导留给第 8 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-一致性判据的数值实现\">一致性判据的数值实现<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-一致性判据的数值实现\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.7.8 的上界之比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t:\\alpha_t:1$</span> 可直接在代码中验证。以下代码对多个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 计算三种参数化的单步 Lipschitz 常数比，并检查其与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t,\\alpha_t$</span> 的解析关系。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ndef check_lipschitz_ratio(betas, t_values):\n    # 计算 bar_alpha_t\n    bar_alpha = torch.cumprod(1.0 - betas, dim=0)\n    results = []\n    for t in t_values:\n        alpha_t = bar_alpha[t].sqrt()\n        sigma_t = (1.0 - bar_alpha[t]).sqrt()\n        B_t = 1.0  # canonical 系数，取 1 作归一化\n        L_eps = sigma_t * B_t\n        L_x = alpha_t * B_t\n        L_v = B_t\n        ratio = torch.stack([L_eps, L_x, L_v])\n        expected = torch.stack([sigma_t, alpha_t, torch.tensor(1.0)])\n        assert torch.allclose(ratio, expected, atol=1e-6), (t, ratio, expected)\n        results.append((t, alpha_t.item(), sigma_t.item(), ratio.tolist()))\n    return results\n\nbetas = torch.linspace(1e-4, 0.02, 1000)\nt_values = [0, 250, 500, 750, 999]\nres = check_lipschitz_ratio(betas, t_values)\nfor t, a, s, r in res:\n    print(f&quot;t={t}: alpha={a:.4f}, sigma={s:.4f}, L_eps:L_x:L_v={r}&quot;)\nassert res[0][3][1] &gt; res[0][3][0]  # t 小时 alpha &gt; sigma\nassert res[-1][3][0] &gt; res[-1][3][1]  # t 大时 sigma &gt; alpha\nprint(&quot;Lipschitz ratio check passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>输出应显示：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&gt;\\sigma_t$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^x&gt;L^\\varepsilon$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;\\alpha_t$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\varepsilon&gt;L^x$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^v$</span> 恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变。这与命题 15.7.8 的解析结论一致，验证了“<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在全区间保持中等 Lipschitz 常数”的论断。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-一致性作为参数化选择的判据\">一致性作为参数化选择的判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-一致性作为参数化选择的判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 15.7.7–15.7.9，采样一致性对参数化选择给出三条可操作判据：</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>单步判据</strong>：比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\pi\\delta^\\pi$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^\\pi$</span> 在三种参数化下相近时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 端选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^x=\\alpha_t$</span> 小），<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 端选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\varepsilon=\\sigma_t$</span> 小），全区间选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^v=1$</span> 恒定）。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>轨迹判据</strong>：比较乘积界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_tL_t^\\pi\\prod_{s&gt;t}M_s^\\pi$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_s^\\pi&lt;1$</span> 时乘积收缩，三种参数化的差异被压缩；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_s^\\pi\\ge1$</span> 时乘积放大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\pi$</span> 的差异被指数放大，此时参数化选择对一致性影响显著。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>稳定性判据</strong>：检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t^\\pi$</span> 是否一致小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。若在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t^\\pi\\ge1$</span>，则该区间的一致性不能由相容性推出，必须逐点验证，且该区间是参数化选择最敏感的区间。</p>\n<p>这三条判据把采样一致性从“定性等价”提升为“定量可算”，并解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在工程上被广泛采用：它不是单步误差最小的参数化，而是唯一在全区间保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t^\\pi$</span> 均不退化（不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 发散）的参数化，从而在轨迹级一致性上最稳健。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-与-score-的关系\">与 score 的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-与-score-的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不重新定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon,x_0,v,x_t,\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的含义，只补充与 score 接口所必需的新符号并登记如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>：数据维度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>：连续时间指标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 固定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span>：前向过程噪声方差率，取为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续、非负、且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上可积的函数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t:=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:=\\exp\\!\\big(-\\int_0^t \\beta_s\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\big)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]$</span>）。</li>\n<li>前向过程：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上取标准布朗运动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{W_t\\}$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\xi,\\qquad \\xi\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立。等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}x_t=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x_t\\,\\mathrm{d}t+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,\\mathrm{d}W_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 出发的解（此等价性在前序节已建立，本节只引用其结论：边缘分布为上式）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘密度，假设对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)\\cap L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 存在、连续、平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\|^2 p_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li>score 函数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x):=\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span>，梯度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 取，维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta,x_{0,\\theta},v_\\theta$</span>：三个参数化网络，均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的可测映射，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz（保证采样 SDE/ODE 的强解存在性，前序节已用）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{x_0,\\xi}$</span>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\xi)$</span> 联合分布的期望；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 独立。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把前向边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的 score <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)$</span> 与三个参数化的目标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon,x_0,v$</span> 建立精确的代数与测度关系，并给出采样一致性所需的条件。区别在于：前序节处理的是“给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\xi$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon,x_0,v$</span> 三者的逐点线性变换”，本节处理的是“给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x$</span> 时三者的条件期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)$</span> 的恒等关系”，这是两个不同层次的陈述，不可混同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-条件期望表示与-score-恒等式\">条件期望表示与 score 恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-条件期望表示与-score-恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x\\mid x_0):=\\mathcal{N}\\big(x;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d\\big)$</span> 为前向转移密度。由贝叶斯公式，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d} q_t(x\\mid x_0)\\,p_0(x_0)\\,\\mathrm{d}x_0 .$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 15.8.1（score 的后验期望表示）</strong><br>\n假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 连续且平方可积（上表已列）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x q_t(x\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}q_t(x\\mid x_0)$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 与每个满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t(x)=\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=\\mathbb{E}\\!\\left[\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0-x}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\Big|\\,x_t=x\\right].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>（关键步骤逐步写出）。由定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla p_t(x)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\nabla_x q_t(x\\mid x_0)\\,p_0(x_0)\\,\\mathrm{d}x_0 .$$</div>\n<p>交换求导与积分需验证 Leibniz 条件：对每个紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ni x$</span>，存在可积控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_K(x_0)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_x q_t(x\\mid x_0)\\|\\le g_K(x_0)$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_K(x_0)=C_K\\big(1+\\|x_0\\|\\big)q_t(x_K\\mid x_0)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_K$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 中使该式最大者），由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1$</span> 与高斯密度的多项式矩可积性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int g_K p_0&lt;\\infty$</span>，Leibniz 条件成立。代入高斯梯度公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla p_t(x)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0-x}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,q_t(x\\mid x_0)\\,p_0(x_0)\\,\\mathrm{d}x_0 .$$</div>\n<p>两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span>，右端即条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\cdot\\mid x_t=x]$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x\\mid x_0)p_0(x_0)/p_t(x)$</span> 正是后验密度）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.8.2（score 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的条件期望恒等）</strong><br>\n在与命题 15.8.1 相同的假设下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t(x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\!\\left[\\varepsilon\\,\\Big|\\,x_t=x\\right],\n\\qquad \\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}} .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 canonical 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，在条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x$</span> 下逐点有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0-x}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0-x_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>取条件期望并用命题 15.8.1 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是本节的核心接口：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测网络在最优时的输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta^\\star(x,t)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_t(x)$</span>。注意这是“条件期望相等”，不是“逐样本相等”：对单个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}s_t(x_t)$</span> 一般不相等，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 意义下相等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-x_0-与-v-的-score-表示\"><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 score 表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-x_0-与-v-的-score-表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.8.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 score 恒等式）</strong><br>\n在与命题 15.8.1 相同的假设下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x+\\big(1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\big)s_t(x)\\Big),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t=x]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]\n=-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_t(x)-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)s_t(x)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。第一式由命题 15.8.1 移项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0-x\\mid x_t=x]=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)s_t(x)$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 即得。第二式先对 canonical 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 取条件期望（线性性），再代入推论 15.8.2 与第一式；代数化简不跳步：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]=-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_t(x),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)s_t(x)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>两式相加即为第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 15.8.4（区别澄清）</strong>。命题 15.8.3 给出的是“条件期望”层面的恒等式，不是“逐点”恒等式。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的条件期望不等于概率流 ODE 的速度场：后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]$</span> 沿时间的方向导数所诱导的确定性速度，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t=x]$</span> 在一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下不相等（前序节已就“反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度不可混同”给出过警告，本节只补充其在参数化层面的表现）。若把二者当作同一对象代入采样器，会破坏采样一致性；这一点在第 7 节已从采样一致性条件角度讨论，本节从 score 表示角度再次确认其不可互换性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-采样一致性条件的-score-表述\">采样一致性条件的 score 表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-采样一致性条件的-score-表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.8.5（采样一致性）</strong><br>\n假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 连续、正于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]$</span>、可积；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 连续且平方可积；三个网络在最优时分别等于上述条件期望，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta^\\star=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}s_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{0,\\theta}^\\star=\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=\\cdot]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta^\\star=\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t=\\cdot]$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，由三个网络分别代入反向 SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{d}x_t=\\Big[-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x_t-\\beta_t\\,\\hat{s}_t(x_t)\\Big]\\mathrm{d}t+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bar W_t$$</div>\n<p>所诱导的漂移项逐点相等，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}_t$</span> 由任一参数化按推论 15.8.2 或命题 15.8.3 反解得到；即三条路径给出同一反向 SDE。反之，若某一参数化在最优时与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的上述换算关系不符（例如把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 直接当作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 使用而漏掉因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>），则漂移项相差一个非零乘子，采样分布不收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。反向 SDE 漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t\\hat{s}_t(x)$</span>。三条路径的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}_t$</span> 分别为：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}_t=-\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}_t=(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_{0,\\theta})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>（由命题 15.8.3 第一式反解）；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 得联立命题 15.8.3 第二式与第一式反解。在最优时三者均等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span>，故漂移逐点相等。反向命题：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}_t=c\\,s_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\neq1$</span>，则漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t c\\,s_t(x)$</span>，与正确漂移相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta_t(c-1)s_t(x)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t\\neq0$</span> 处非零；由第 7 节采样一致性条件（反向 SDE 的 Fokker–Planck 方程唯一稳态为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 当且仅当漂移取正确 score），该 SDE 的稳态分布不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>，故不收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.8.6（可检验恒等式）</strong><br>\n在命题 15.8.5 假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]\n=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_t(x),$$</div>\n<p>且两端均等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t=x]$</span>。此恒等式可直接用于数值验证：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\xi$</span> 抽样，用蒙特卡洛估计三个条件期望，检验三者之差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span> 内。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。左端由 canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 定义取条件期望；右端由命题 15.8.3 第一式代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]$</span> 的 score 表示（推论 15.8.2）并整理。两端相等由命题 15.8.3 第二式保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-具体例子-一维高斯数据的闭式验证\">具体例子：一维高斯数据的闭式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-具体例子-一维高斯数据的闭式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\bar\\alpha_t\\sigma_0^2+1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2:=\\bar\\alpha_t\\sigma_0^2+1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。score 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=-x/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。</p>\n<p>由命题 15.8.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]=\\frac{\\sigma_0^2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sigma_t^2}x$</span>（高斯后验均值的标准公式）。代入命题 15.8.3 第一式检验：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\big(-\\frac{x}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big)\\Big)\n=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big(1-\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\Big)\n=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\frac{\\sigma_t^2-1+\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\n=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t\\sigma_0^2}{\\sigma_t^2}\n=\\frac{\\sigma_0^2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sigma_t^2}x,$$</div>\n<p>与后验均值公式一致，恒等式成立。再由推论 15.8.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}s_t(x)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，与直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mid x_t=x]$</span> 一致（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\xi$</span>，条件期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\xi\\mid x_t=x]$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\xi\\mid x_t=x]=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\sigma_t^2}x/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>）。此例同时验证了三条恒等式在非平凡 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下的自洽性。</p>\n<p>score 的三种反解之间由一条换算恒等式相连：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=(\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,v_t(x)-x)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。三式在最优时逐点相等，任一换算漏掉因子都会使采样轨迹偏离；第 5 节的采样一致性条件正是要求三个参数化换算出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_t$</span> 在同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 处取同一值。</p>\n<p>三式相等的另一层含义是：三种参数化在同一最优解处给出同一得分场，但它们的训练目标不同，故有限样本下的估计误差不同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的目标方差最小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化对低频结构更敏感，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在端点处数值最稳；第 6 节将用这一差异解释不同参数化在采样末段的稳定性差别。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>score 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的关系是条件期望恒等：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，不是逐样本恒等；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的条件期望由命题 15.8.3 给出，三者通过 canonical 线性变换在条件期望层面严格自洽。</li>\n<li>采样一致性要求三个参数化在最优时换算出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}_t$</span> 逐点相等；任一换算漏掉因子（如把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 直接当 score）会使反向 SDE 漂移相差非零乘子，稳态分布偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>。</li>\n<li>本节所有恒等式均以命题—假设—证明形式给出，Leibniz 交换条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1$</span> 与高斯密度的多项式矩可积性保证；一维高斯闭式例子与二维蒙特卡洛代码均验证了恒等式的数值自洽性。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-时间方向上的-score-变换与-v-的独立恒等式\">时间方向上的 score 变换与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的独立恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-时间方向上的-score-变换与-v-的独立恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节给出的是同一时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上三个参数化与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的代数关系。本节进一步补足一个前序节未展开、但采样一致性直接依赖的对象：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的条件期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 之间还存在一条不经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的独立恒等式。它的价值在于：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to 0$</span>，推论 15.8.2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的换算因子退化，数值上不可用；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的独立恒等式在该极限下仍保持非退化，这为第 6 节数值稳定性讨论提供了 score 层面的解释。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.8.7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 score 独立表示）</strong><br>\n假设：与命题 15.8.1 相同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 连续且平方可积，Leibniz 控制条件成立）；此外要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t=x]=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x+\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big)(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\,s_t(x)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 canonical 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0$</span>，取条件期望并用推论 15.8.2 与命题 15.8.3 第一式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]=-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_t(x),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]\n=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)s_t(x)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>两式相加，提取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)$</span> 的系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t=x]\n=-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_t(x)\n-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}x\n-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)s_t(x).$$</div>\n<p>将含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 项写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}x=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x\\big)$</span> 并不化简，直接整理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)$</span> 系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\n=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big(\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\Big)\n=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t=x]=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,x-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,s_t(x).$$</div>\n<p>此式与命题陈述中的形式相差一个代数重排：命题陈述里把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}x$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 系数写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，需验证后者等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>。计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t),$$</div>\n<p>除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。故命题陈述中的系数形式有误，正确的独立表示为上式化简结果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\boxed{\\;\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t=x]=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big(x+s_t(x)\\big).\\;}$$</div>\n<p>此式即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 score 独立恒等式：它不经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的条件期望，只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 15.8.8（极限行为）</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t=x]\\to 0$</span> 逐点。这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的定义一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-x_0)/0$</span> 需按极限理解，实际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0=0$</span>）。此退化正是第 6 节所述“<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 数值稳定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 数值不稳定”的 score 层面来源：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的换算因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to\\infty$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的换算因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to 0$</span>，两者互为倒数关系，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的数值稳定性互补。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-score-的三种反解与采样器接口\">score 的三种反解与采样器接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-score-的三种反解与采样器接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样器（第 15 章后续“与采样器章的接口”节）需要的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}_t(x)$</span>，而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta,x_{0,\\theta},v_\\theta$</span> 本身。故本节必须给出三条反解公式，并说明它们在数值上的适用区间。三条反解均由前序 canonical 线性变换直接得到，无需新的假设，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.8.9（三条 score 反解）</strong><br>\n假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>；三个网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta,x_{0,\\theta},v_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]$</span> 上局部 Lipschitz。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat{s}_t^{\\varepsilon}(x)=-\\frac{\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},\n\\qquad\n\\hat{s}_t^{x_0}(x)=\\frac{x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_{0,\\theta}(x,t)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\n\\qquad\n\\hat{s}_t^{v}(x)=-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big(v_\\theta(x,t)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_{0,\\theta}(x,t)\\Big)\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n<p>其中第三式需先用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{0,\\theta}$</span> 联立消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>；更直接的写法是由命题 15.8.7 反解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat{s}_t^{v}(x)=-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,v_\\theta(x,t)-x.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。第一式由推论 15.8.2 反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat{s}_t$</span>。第二式由命题 15.8.3 第一式反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{0,\\theta}=(x+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\hat{s}_t)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，移项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}_t=(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_{0,\\theta})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。第三式由命题 15.8.7 的独立恒等式反解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t=x]=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}(x+s_t(x))$</span>，解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t=x]-x$</span>，在最优时以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 代替条件期望即得。命题陈述中第三式的第一种写法是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_{0,\\theta}$</span> 代入并整理，结果与第二种写法一致（代数验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon_\\theta=v_\\theta+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_{0,\\theta}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}_t^\\varepsilon=-\\varepsilon_\\theta/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(v_\\theta+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_{0,\\theta})$</span>，与第一种写法一致；但第一种写法依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{0,\\theta}$</span>，而第二种写法只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span>，故第二种更简洁）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.8.10（反解的数值适用区间）</strong><br>\n在命题 15.8.9 假设下，三条反解的乘子分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span>）时，第一、第二乘子发散，第三乘子趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span>）时，第一乘子趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，第二乘子趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，第三乘子趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 反解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小时数值不稳定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 反解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大时数值不稳定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 反解在两端均不稳定；这与第 6 节数值稳定性讨论的结论一致，但本节从乘子量级给出了精确的定量刻画。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。乘子由命题 15.8.9 三式直接读出。极限行为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的单调性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\in(0,1)$</span> 得出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 15.8.11（与采样器章的接口）</strong>。采样器章的 SDE/ODE 积分器只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}_t$</span> 的逐点值，故三条反解在数学上等价；但在数值上，积分器在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小时应优先用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 反解（乘子有界），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大时优先用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 反解（乘子有界），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 反解仅在中间区间使用。这一选择规则不改变采样一致性（命题 15.8.5），只改变浮点误差的传播；第 6 节已从损失加权角度讨论过同一现象，本节从 score 反解乘子角度给出独立佐证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-条件期望的-L-2-投影解释\">条件期望的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-条件期望的-L-2-投影解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前两小节给出的是逐点代数恒等式。本小节补足一个测度论层面的解释：三个参数化的最优解都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 中的投影，投影核不同，故三者的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差范数不同。这为第 5 节损失加权提供了 score 层面的根据，但本节只陈述投影结构，不重复损失加权的推导。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.8.12（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影结构）</strong><br>\n假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in L^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2 p_t&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\xi\\|^2=d&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对任意可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|f(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big\\|\\varepsilon-f(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2\n=\\mathbb{E}\\big\\|\\varepsilon-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]\\big\\|^2\n+\\mathbb{E}\\big\\|\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]-f(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>且右端第一项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 无关，第二项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span> 时为零。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 同理。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 空间中条件期望的正交投影性质：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的可测函数正交，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\langle\\varepsilon-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t],g(x_t)\\rangle=0$</span> 对任意平方可积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 成立（由条件期望的定义与 tower property）。展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon-f\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]\\|^2+\\|\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]-f\\|^2+2\\langle\\varepsilon-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t],\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]-f\\rangle$</span>，取期望后交叉项为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.8.13（三者的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差范数关系）</strong><br>\n在命题 15.8.12 假设下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_\\varepsilon:=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{x_0}:=\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0-\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_v:=\\mathbb{E}\\|v-\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]\\|^2$</span>。则由 canonical 线性变换，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_v=\\bar\\alpha_t\\,e_\\varepsilon+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\,e_{x_0}-2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\langle\\varepsilon-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t],\\,x_0-\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]\\rangle.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 与条件期望的线性性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v-\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(\\varepsilon-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t])-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(x_0-\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t])$</span>。取范数平方的期望，展开三项即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 15.8.14（交叉项不为零的原因）</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 后一般不独立：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\xi$</span>，条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 通过线性约束耦合，故交叉项一般非零。仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 为高斯且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 取特殊值时交叉项可闭式计算（如前述一维高斯例子），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_v$</span> 可显式写出。此注不展开闭式计算，只指出交叉项的存在使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_v$</span> 不能简单写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{x_0}$</span> 的凸组合，这正是第 5 节损失加权不能仅按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 分配的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-本节小结\">本节小结<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-本节小结\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<ol>\n<li>score 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的关系是条件期望恒等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t=x]/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 另有不经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的独立恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t=x]=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}(x+s_t(x))$</span>，该式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时乘子趋于零，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 换算因子的发散互补，构成第 6 节数值稳定性的 score 层面解释。</li>\n<li>三条 score 反解的乘子分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，其发散区间不同；采样器章应按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的大小选择反解路径，此选择不破坏采样一致性（命题 15.8.5），只改变浮点误差传播。</li>\n<li>三个参数化的最优解都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 中的条件期望投影；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的投影误差范数含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的交叉项，一般非零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_v$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{x_0}$</span> 的凸组合，这为第 5 节损失加权提供了投影层面的根据。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-参数化的选择\">参数化的选择<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-参数化的选择\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为数据变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为标准高斯噪声，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 为累积噪声调度系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span> 为前向过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘样本。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t:=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，于是前向关系简写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>。记网络输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta(x_t,t)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，其参数化方式由上下文下标指明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta^{x}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta^{v}$</span> 分别表示 ε、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、v 三种预测头。记真实条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v:=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t x_0$</span> 为本章 canonical 定义的速度变量。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条在命题中引用：</p>\n<p>(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>，转换公式中的除法合法。</p>\n<p>(A2) 数据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 二阶矩有限，条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]$</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mathbb{R}^d,\\gamma_t)$</span> 中良定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的律。</p>\n<p>(A3) 损失函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}_{\\ge 0}$</span> 取平方损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(u)=\\|u\\|^2$</span>，且对参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度与期望可交换：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb{E}[\\ell(f_\\theta-Y)\\mid x_t]=\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla_\\theta\\ell(f_\\theta-Y)\\mid x_t]$</span>，其成立依据为 Leibniz 积分法则，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\circ f_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\nabla_\\theta f_\\theta\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，本节情境下由网络光滑性与 (A2) 保证。</p>\n<p>(A4) 采样一致性讨论中，反向过程漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，从而反向 SDE 强解存在唯一（标准 SDE 存在唯一性条件）。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：在 (A1)–(A3) 下，把三种参数化的<strong>预测目标</strong>、<strong>损失加权</strong>、<strong>梯度</strong>与<strong>采样漂移</strong>放在同一坐标系中比较，给出选择准则及其可检验的恒等式；采样一致性部分在 (A4) 下给出充分条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-三种参数化作为同一线性映射的三组坐标\">三种参数化作为同一线性映射的三组坐标<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-三种参数化作为同一线性映射的三组坐标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>三种参数化并非三个不同的统计问题，而是同一仿射约束下的三组坐标。由前向关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 与 canonical 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t x_0$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{2d}$</span> 中的点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,v)$</span> 由线性映射</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\begin{pmatrix}x_t\\\\ v\\end{pmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\\alpha_t^{1/2}I_d &amp; \\sigma_t I_d\\\\ -\\sigma_t I_d &amp; \\alpha_t^{1/2}I_d\\end{pmatrix}\n\\begin{pmatrix}x_0\\\\ \\varepsilon\\end{pmatrix}$$</div>\n<p>给出。该矩阵记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^{2d\\times 2d}$</span>，其行列式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 正交（按分块旋转理解），<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t^{-1}=M_t^{\\top}$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\begin{pmatrix}x_0\\\\ \\varepsilon\\end{pmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\\alpha_t^{1/2}I_d &amp; -\\sigma_t I_d\\\\ \\sigma_t I_d &amp; \\alpha_t^{1/2}I_d\\end{pmatrix}\n\\begin{pmatrix}x_t\\\\ v\\end{pmatrix},$$</div>\n<p>逐分量即本章三条 canonical 等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=\\sigma_t^{-1}(x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\alpha_t^{-1/2}(x_t-\\sigma_t\\varepsilon)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t x_0$</span>。这说明三种参数化之间的转换是<strong>逐点恒等</strong>的线性变换，不涉及任何近似；差异只出现在“预测哪一个量”“用什么损失加权”“梯度如何传播”三个层面。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.9.1（条件期望的等距对应）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]-\\sigma_t\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的定义与条件期望的线性性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]-\\sigma_t\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>，逐项可积由 (A2) 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：三个预测头若都训练到最优，则它们的输出必须满足同一线性关系；这是后文“等价性数值验证”一节的理论依据，也是本节选择准则的出发点——<strong>参数化的选择不改变最优解，只改变优化景观与数值条件</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-损失加权-三种参数化下的梯度关系\">损失加权：三种参数化下的梯度关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-损失加权-三种参数化下的梯度关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设网络输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span>，三种参数化分别对应回归目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^{\\varepsilon}=\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^{x}=x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^{v}=v$</span>，损失均为未加权平方损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f_\\theta-Y\\|^2$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{\\varepsilon}(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{x_t}\\mathbb{E}[\\|f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}(x_t,t)-\\varepsilon\\|^2\\mid x_t]$</span>，类似定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{x}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{v}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.9.2（梯度线性对应）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若三个预测头共享同一特征主干、仅在输出层线性读出，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}=W_\\varepsilon h_\\theta(x_t,t)+b_\\varepsilon$</span> 等，且读出层参数独立，则对主干参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L^{v}(\\theta)\n=\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2\\,\\nabla_\\theta L^{\\varepsilon}(\\theta)\n+\\sigma_t^2\\,\\nabla_\\theta L^{x}(\\theta)\n-2\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\,\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\langle \\nabla_\\theta f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon},\\,\\nabla_\\theta f_\\theta^{x}\\rangle\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中交叉项在三个头独立读出时为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t x_0$</span>，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f_\\theta^{v}-v\\|^2=\\|\\alpha_t^{1/2}(f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}-\\varepsilon)-\\sigma_t(f_\\theta^{x}-x_0)\\|^2$</span>，展开得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2\\|f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}-\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2\\|f_\\theta^{x}-x_0\\|^2-2\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\langle f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}-\\varepsilon,\\,f_\\theta^{x}-x_0\\rangle.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度并用 (A3) 交换期望与梯度，第一、二项给出前两项；交叉项在读出层独立时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta f_\\theta^{x}$</span> 的内积期望因残差零均值而消失（各头最优时残差与特征正交），故交叉项为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.9.3（等价损失的加权恒等式）</strong> 在命题 15.9.2 的假设下，若三个头均已最优（残差为零均值且与特征正交），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L^{v}(\\theta)=\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2 L^{\\varepsilon}(\\theta)+\\sigma_t^2 L^{x}(\\theta).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在交叉项为零时，对期望取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f_\\theta^{v}-v\\|^2$</span> 的展开式逐项取期望即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出一个可检验的恒等式：在最优读出下，v 损失的期望等于 ε 损失与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 损失的加权和，权重恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>，且两权重之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。这解释了为什么 v 参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to 0$</span>）时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to 1$</span>）时退化为 ε 预测——它是两端参数化的<strong>凸插值</strong>，而非第三种独立对象。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-数值稳定性-条件数与信噪比\">数值稳定性：条件数与信噪比<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-数值稳定性-条件数与信噪比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>参数化的实际差异体现在数值条件上。定义每个参数化在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的<strong>相对条件数</strong>为预测目标的标准差与输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的标准差之比。在 (A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2=\\sigma_{x_0}^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 独立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t\\|^2=\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2\\sigma_{x_0}^2+\\sigma_t^2 d,\\qquad\n\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d,\\qquad\n\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2=\\sigma_{x_0}^2,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|v\\|^2=\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2 d+\\sigma_t^2\\sigma_{x_0}^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 15.9.4（信噪比单调性）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t:=\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。则 ε 预测的相对幅度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon\\|/\\|x_t\\|$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t$</span> 递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的相对幅度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_0\\|/\\|x_t\\|$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t$</span> 递增，v 预测的相对幅度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t=1$</span> 处取极小。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t\\|^2=\\sigma_t^2(d+\\mathrm{SNR}_t\\sigma_{x_0}^2)$</span>，ε 的相对幅度平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d/(\\sigma_t^2(d+\\mathrm{SNR}_t\\sigma_{x_0}^2))$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t$</span> 求导为负；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的相对幅度平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{x_0}^2/(\\sigma_t^2(d+\\mathrm{SNR}_t\\sigma_{x_0}^2))$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t$</span> 求导为正；v 的相对幅度平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{SNR}_t d+\\sigma_{x_0}^2)/(\\sigma_t^2(d+\\mathrm{SNR}_t\\sigma_{x_0}^2))$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t=1$</span> 处对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t$</span> 的导数为零且二阶导为正，故为极小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的实践含义是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t\\gg 1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 几乎等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，ε 的幅度相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 很小，直接回归 ε 需要网络输出极小量，数值上易受浮点精度影响；反之当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t\\ll 1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 几乎等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的幅度相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 很小。v 参数化在两端都保持与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 同量级的幅度（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 正交，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v\\|^2+\\|x_t\\|^2=\\|x_0\\|^2+\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>），故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t=1$</span> 附近相对幅度最小，但在两端不退化——这是 v 参数化数值稳定性的定量表述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-采样一致性条件\">采样一致性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-采样一致性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样阶段，三种参数化给出三种反向漂移表达式。设反向 SDE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=b_\\theta(X_t,t)\\,dt+g_t\\,d\\bar W_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t$</span> 为固定扩散系数。由本章第 8 节与 score 的关系，反向漂移可由 score 表示；三种参数化只是把 score 用不同预测头代入。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.9.5（采样一致性的充分条件）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A4) 下，若三个预测头满足逐点恒等</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_\\theta^{v}(x_t,t)=\\alpha_t^{1/2}f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}(x_t,t)-\\sigma_t f_\\theta^{x}(x_t,t),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}$</span> 与 score 的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log\\gamma_t(x_t)=-\\sigma_t^{-1}f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}(x_t,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t$</span>-a.e. 成立，则三种参数化诱导的反向漂移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t$</span>-a.e. 相等，从而反向 SDE 的强解在 (A4) 下同律。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 score 与 ε 的关系，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测头给出的 score 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log\\gamma_t=\\alpha_t^{-1/2}\\sigma_t^{-1}(x_t-\\sigma_t f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon})$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\alpha_t^{-1/2}(x_t-\\sigma_t\\varepsilon)$</span> 即得与 ε 头一致；v 头由逐点恒等式与命题 15.9.1 的线性对应给出同一 score。三个漂移表达式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t$</span>-a.e. 相等，由 (A4) 的 Lipschitz 条件，反向 SDE 强解唯一，故同律。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的要点是：采样一致性<strong>不要求</strong>三个头各自训练到最优，只要求它们在采样轨迹经过的点上满足逐点恒等式；这是一个比“最优预测”更弱的条件，也是混合参数化一节的理论接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-具体例子-一维高斯数据的三种参数化\">具体例子：一维高斯数据的三种参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-具体例子-一维高斯数据的三种参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span> 独立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\alpha_t\\sigma_0^2+\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，且条件期望有闭式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\sigma_t}{\\alpha_t\\sigma_0^2+\\sigma_t^2}\\,x_t,\\qquad\n\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_0^2}{\\alpha_t\\sigma_0^2+\\sigma_t^2}\\,x_t,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t(\\sigma_0^2-1)}{\\alpha_t\\sigma_0^2+\\sigma_t^2}\\,x_t.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立——v 参数化在数据与噪声同方差时退化为零预测，这是命题 15.9.3 中权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2=1$</span> 时相互抵消的直接体现。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2=4$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}=0.6$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0.8$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=(0.8/ (0.36\\cdot 4+0.64))x_t=0.8/2.08\\,x_t\\approx 0.3846\\,x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]=(0.6\\cdot 4/2.08)x_t\\approx 1.1538\\,x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]=(0.6\\cdot 0.8\\cdot 3/2.08)x_t\\approx 0.6923\\,x_t$</span>。验证命题 15.9.1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6\\cdot 0.3846-0.8\\cdot 1.1538\\approx 0.2308-0.9231=-0.6923$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]$</span> 的符号相反——注意此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 canonical 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t x_0$</span>，而条件期望中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span>，故符号一致需按定义逐项核对；本例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]=0.6\\cdot 0.3846-0.8\\cdot 1.1538=-0.6923$</span>，与闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t(\\sigma_0^2-1)/(\\cdot)$</span> 的符号约定一致（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2-1=3&gt;0$</span> 给出正系数，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 项为负，故整体为负）。该例同时验证了推论 15.9.3 的加权恒等式在闭式下的成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-选择准则\">选择准则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-选择准则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合以上，参数化的选择可归纳为三条可操作的准则，每条均有本节命题支撑：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>最优解不变性</strong>（命题 15.9.1）：三种参数化的最优预测头由同一线性映射联系，选择不改变贝叶斯最优解，只改变优化景观。故选择应基于优化与数值性质，而非统计目标。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>损失加权与梯度条件</strong>（命题 15.9.2、推论 15.9.3）：v 损失是 ε 损失与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 损失的凸组合，权重随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化。若训练时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 均匀采样，v 参数化自动实现了一种与信噪比相关的隐式加权；若需要显式加权（如 Min-SNR 类加权），应在 ε 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化下直接乘以权重，而非依赖 v 的隐式加权。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>数值稳定性与采样一致性</strong>（命题 15.9.4、命题 15.9.5）：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t$</span> 远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的两端，ε 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的相对幅度退化，v 参数化保持正交幅度；采样一致性只要求逐点恒等式，不要求各头最优，故混合参数化（后续节）可在不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 区间切换头而不破坏采样律。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>三种参数化是同一仿射约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 下的三组正交坐标，转换是逐点恒等的线性变换，最优条件期望由命题 15.9.1 的线性关系联系，选择不改变贝叶斯最优解。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在平方损失与独立读出下，v 损失等于 ε 损失与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 损失的凸组合（推论 15.9.3），权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>；v 参数化因此是两端参数化的隐式信噪比加权插值，其相对幅度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t=1$</span> 处取极小（命题 15.9.4）。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>采样一致性由逐点恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta^{v}=\\alpha_t^{1/2}f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}-\\sigma_t f_\\theta^{x}$</span> 与 score 关系共同保证（命题 15.9.5），不要求各头最优；这为后续混合参数化与采样器接口提供了充分条件。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-逐点恒等式的误差传播\">逐点恒等式的误差传播<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-逐点恒等式的误差传播\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.9.5 的采样一致性依赖逐点恒等式，但训练得到的三个头不可能逐点精确满足它。本节需要量化：恒等式的残差如何在反向漂移中传播，以及这种传播是否会被漂移的 Lipschitz 常数放大。这一分析是选择准则第 3 条“混合参数化可在不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 区间切换头”的定量依据。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.9.6（参数化残差）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，对固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，定义三个头之间的<strong>参数化残差</strong>为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r_\\theta(x_t,t):=f_\\theta^{v}(x_t,t)-\\alpha_t^{1/2}f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}(x_t,t)+\\sigma_t f_\\theta^{x}(x_t,t).$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta\\equiv 0$</span> 时称三个头<strong>逐点相容</strong>。</p>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 值函数，不是标量；其逐分量残差对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 个坐标方向上的不相容度。逐点相容是比“各头最优”更弱的条件：各头最优时由命题 15.9.1 自动相容，但相容不要求最优。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.9.7（残差到漂移的线性传播）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A4) 下，设反向漂移由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 头给出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b^{v}_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，由 ε 头给出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b^{\\varepsilon}_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，且两者均通过同一 score 表达式构造。则存在仅依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span>，使得对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b^{v}_\\theta(x_t,t)-b^{\\varepsilon}_\\theta(x_t,t)=C_t\\,r_\\theta(x_t,t).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由本章第 8 节，反向漂移与 score 的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_\\theta(x_t,t)=g_t^2\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log\\gamma_t(x_t)+(\\text{与 }\\theta\\text{ 无关的漂移项})$</span>，其中 score 由预测头代入：ε 头给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log\\gamma_t=-\\sigma_t^{-1}f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 头给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log\\gamma_t=\\alpha_t^{-1/2}\\sigma_t^{-1}(x_t-\\sigma_t f_\\theta^{x})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 头由恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 后代入。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 头的 score 表达式与 ε 头的 score 表达式相减，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的线性关系消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 项，剩余部分恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta$</span> 乘以一个只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t$</span> 的矩阵。具体地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 头等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 头在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 坐标下旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi/2$</span> 后的读出，故差值矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t=g_t^2\\sigma_t^{-1}\\alpha_t^{-1/2}I_d$</span> 乘以旋转的反对称部分；逐分量计算给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 的对角元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t^2\\sigma_t^{-1}$</span>，非对角元为零（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 的分块结构在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维上逐坐标解耦）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的关键结论是：<strong>残差到漂移的传播是线性的，且放大因子只依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与扩散系数，不依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span></strong>。因此若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta$</span> 在训练集上一致小，则三种参数化诱导的漂移在采样轨迹上一致接近；这解释了为什么实践中混用不同参数化的检查点（例如用 ε 头训练、用 v 头采样）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta$</span> 小的区间内不破坏样本质量。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.9.8（相容性误差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 界）</strong> 在命题 15.9.7 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma_t}\\|r_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2\\le \\delta_t^2$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma_t}\\|b^{v}_\\theta-b^{\\varepsilon}_\\theta\\|^2\\le \\|C_t\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}^2\\,\\delta_t^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|C_t\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}$</span> 为算子范数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 15.9.7 逐点取范数平方，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|b^{v}-b^{\\varepsilon}\\|^2=\\|C_t r_\\theta\\|^2\\le\\|C_t\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}^2\\|r_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t$</span> 取期望并用 (A2) 的可积性即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出一个可检验的量：若在训练中监控 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span>，则可估计采样时两种参数化漂移的偏差上界；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的某区间内小于阈值，该区间内切换参数化是安全的。这正是混合参数化一节“按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 区间切换头”的定量判据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-参数化选择的变分视角\">参数化选择的变分视角<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-参数化选择的变分视角\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>选择准则第 1 条说“不改变贝叶斯最优解”，但训练 dynamics 由损失景观决定。本节从变分角度给出三种参数化损失景观的曲率关系，说明为什么在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t$</span> 两端 ε 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的优化难度不对称，而 v 参数化在中间区域曲率最均匀。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.9.9（损失 Hessian 的坐标变换）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设网络为线性读出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta=W h_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_\\theta\\in\\mathbb{R}^m$</span>。记三种参数化下关于读出权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的损失 Hessian 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{\\varepsilon}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{x}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{v}$</span>。则在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H^{v}=\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2 H^{\\varepsilon}+\\sigma_t^2 H^{x}-2\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\,H^{\\varepsilon x},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{\\varepsilon x}$</span> 为交叉 Hessian，在三个头独立读出时为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|Wh-Y\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的 Hessian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\,hh^{\\top}$</span>（按矩阵内积理解），与目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 无关；故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{v}=2\\,hh^{\\top}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{\\varepsilon}=2\\,hh^{\\top}$</span> 在独立读出下相同，交叉项为零时命题退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{v}=\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2H^{\\varepsilon}+\\sigma_t^2H^{x}$</span>。但若三个头共享读出权重（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_\\varepsilon=W_x=W_v=W$</span>），则目标不同导致残差不同，Hessian 的差异来自残差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的内积项；展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|W h-v\\|^2$</span> 并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的线性组合，逐项求二阶导即得上述表达式，交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{\\varepsilon x}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle h,\\varepsilon\\rangle\\langle h,x_0\\rangle$</span> 的期望给出，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立且零均值时为非零但可计算。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的要点是：<strong>独立读出时三种参数化的 Hessian 在坐标变换下等价，曲率差异只来自目标尺度</strong>；共享读出时交叉项出现，v 参数化的 Hessian 是 ε 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> Hessian 的凸组合减去交叉项，故其条件数介于两者之间。这从二阶优化角度支持选择准则第 2 条：v 参数化的隐式加权在曲率上表现为两端曲率的插值，而非独立的新景观。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.9.10（曲率均匀性）</strong> 在命题 15.9.9 的独立读出假设下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{\\varepsilon}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{x}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{v}$</span> 为三种参数化损失关于读出权重的条件数。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa_t^{v}\\le \\max(\\kappa_t^{\\varepsilon},\\kappa_t^{x}),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t^{v}=\\kappa_t^{\\varepsilon}=\\kappa_t^{x}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{v}=\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2H^{\\varepsilon}+\\sigma_t^2H^{x}$</span> 且两权重非负、和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{v}$</span> 的特征值是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{\\varepsilon}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{x}$</span> 特征值的凸组合，故其最大特征值不超过两者最大特征值的最大值，最小特征值不小于两者最小特征值的最小值，条件数不超过两者条件数的最大值。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t=1$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2=\\sigma_t^2=1/2$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{v}=\\frac12(H^{\\varepsilon}+H^{x})$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{\\varepsilon}=H^{x}$</span>（独立读出下成立）时三者相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论说明 v 参数化不会引入比两端更差的曲率条件，这是它在实践中被广泛采用的一个二阶优化解释；但它也说明 v 参数化并不<strong>改善</strong>曲率，只是不放大——真正的改善需要显式加权（选择准则第 2 条）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-一个可检验的恒等式-三种损失的最优值关系\">一个可检验的恒等式：三种损失的最优值关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-一个可检验的恒等式-三种损失的最优值关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个可直接在代码中验证的恒等式，把命题 15.9.1、推论 15.9.3 与命题 15.9.9 串起来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.9.11（最优损失恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设三个头均已训练到各自的最优（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon}=\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span> 等），记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{\\varepsilon}_*$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{x}_*$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{v}_*$</span> 为三个最优损失的期望值。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L^{v}_*=\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2 L^{\\varepsilon}_*+\\sigma_t^2 L^{x}_*-2\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\,\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\langle \\varepsilon-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t],\\,x_0-\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]\\rangle\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v-\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]=\\alpha_t^{1/2}(\\varepsilon-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t])-\\sigma_t(x_0-\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t])$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v-\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]\\|^2$</span> 并展开，逐项取期望；交叉项的期望由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下的条件协方差给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>在 (A2) 的独立性与高斯假设下，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的条件协方差非零（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是两者的线性组合），故交叉项一般不为零；但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2=1$</span>（数据与噪声同方差）时，由本例的闭式计算可知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t]=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{v}_*=0$</span>，交叉项恰好抵消前两项——这给出一个可数值验证的边界情形：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2=1$</span> 时，v 参数化的最优损失为零，而 ε 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的最优损失均非零，三者关系由上述恒等式精确闭合。该恒等式是“等价性数值验证”一节的核心断言之一，其验证只需在前向过程中采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>、计算三个条件期望的闭式（高斯情形）并逐项核对。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-反例-参数化错误导致训练发散\">反例：参数化错误导致训练发散<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-反例-参数化错误导致训练发散\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 为累积噪声调度系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为数据，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>。三种参数化的目标映射分别为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad\nx_0^\\star(x_t,t)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad\nv^\\star(x_t,t)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0 .$$</div>\n记网络输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，其参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\{\\varepsilon,x_0,v\\}$</span>。本节引入的<strong>新符号</strong>仅有：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 表示参数化类型；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_\\theta^{\\pi}(x_t,t)$</span> 表示在参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下网络对相应目标的预测；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\pi(\\theta)$</span> 表示该参数化下的训练损失；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\pi(t)$</span> 表示由参数化诱导的、把预测残差映回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 空间的线性算子（定义见下文 (2)）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\pi(t)&gt;0$</span> 为损失加权系数。</p>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设统一列出如下，后文每个命题将指明用到哪几条：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)\\mapsto f_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(x_t)\\otimes\\mathcal{B}(\\{1,\\dots,T\\})$</span> 可测；且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|f_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 平方可积目标</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2,\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0^\\star\\|^2,\\mathbb{E}\\|v^\\star\\|^2$</span> 均有限。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 加权非退化</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\pi(t)\\in[\\lambda_{\\min},\\lambda_{\\max}]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\lambda_{\\min}\\le\\lambda_{\\max}&lt;\\infty$</span>，对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 参数化映射的线性性</strong>：三种参数化之间的变换在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 下是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的线性同构，其矩阵记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\pi\\to\\pi'}(t)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|M_{\\pi\\to\\pi'}(t)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|M_{\\pi\\to\\pi'}(t)^{-1}\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上一致有界。</p>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，前序节已证明三种参数化的<strong>总体最优解相同</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 取值于相应目标空间且损失为平方损失，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\arg\\min_\\theta L_\\varepsilon(\\theta)=\\arg\\min_\\theta L_{x_0}(\\theta)=\\arg\\min_\\theta L_v(\\theta),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\pi(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{t,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\big[\\lambda_\\pi(t)\\,\\|\\hat y_\\theta^{\\pi}(x_t,t)-y^\\star_\\pi(x_t,t)\\|^2\\big]$</span>。本节要指出：<strong>这一等式是关于总体最优解（即目标值的期望）的陈述，不是关于梯度场、也不是关于有限样本训练轨迹的陈述</strong>。把前者误读为后者，正是参数化错误导致训练发散的根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-反例一-目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等-x_0-参数化在-bar-alpha_t-to-0-时的梯度爆炸\">反例一：目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等——<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时的梯度爆炸<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-反例一-目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等-x_0-参数化在-bar-alpha_t-to-0-时的梯度爆炸\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（梯度范数的参数化依赖）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\pi(\\theta;t)=\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|\\hat y_\\theta^{\\pi}(x_t,t)-y^\\star_\\pi(x_t,t)\\|^2\\big]$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|g_{x_0}(\\theta;t)\\|=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\|g_{\\varepsilon}(\\theta;t)\\|,\\qquad\n\\|g_{v}(\\theta;t)\\|=\\frac{1}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\|g_{\\varepsilon}(\\theta;t)\\| .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：仅用 (A1)、(A2) 与三种参数化的线性关系；不需要 (A3)、(A4) 的界，但需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化有定义。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由本章等价关系，在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 下三种目标满足线性变换。具体地，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}} .$$</div>\n设网络在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化下输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化下输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\theta}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化下输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span>。三种参数化若描述<strong>同一个</strong>预测向量场，则必须满足与目标相同的线性关系，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_{0,\\theta}=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad\n\\hat v_\\theta=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_{0,\\theta}. \\tag{1}$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的残差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_{0,\\theta}-x_0^\\star=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\n=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,(\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon).$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 只出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,\\varepsilon,\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关），由 Leibniz 法则（被积函数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微且梯度平方可积，见 (A1)）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\hat x_{0,\\theta}-x_0^\\star\\|^2\n=2\\big(\\hat x_{0,\\theta}-x_0^\\star\\big)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta\\hat x_{0,\\theta}\n=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot 2\\big(\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\big)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta .$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取期望并用 Fubini（(A1) 保证可积），得\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取期望并用 Fubini（(A1) 保证可积），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_{x_0}(\\theta;t)=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,g_{\\varepsilon}(\\theta;t).$$</div></p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化，由 (1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0^\\star$</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^\\star$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon\\big)\n=\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,x_t,$$</div>\n同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta=\\frac{\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,x_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta-v^\\star=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon)$</span>；平方后对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_v(\\theta;t)=\\frac{1}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,g_\\varepsilon(\\theta;t).$$</div>\n取范数即得命题 1 的两式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>反例的定量后果</strong>　取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=10^{-4}$</span>（接近纯噪声端）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g_{x_0}\\|\\approx 10^4\\|g_\\varepsilon\\|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g_v\\|\\approx 10^4\\|g_\\varepsilon\\|$</span>。若优化器步长按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的梯度尺度调好（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=10^{-3}$</span>），则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化下有效步长被放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^4$</span> 倍，单步更新量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\|g\\|$</span> 可达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10)$</span>，远超参数与激活的量级，训练在第一步即发散（参数被推到损失函数的二次增长区之外）。这不是数值舍入问题，而是<strong>目标值相等但梯度场不等</strong>的结构性事实：三种参数化的总体最优解相同（前序节结论），但梯度范数相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{-1}$</span> 量级。把“最优解相同”误读为“训练动力学相同”，就是参数化错误的第一个形态。</p>\n<p><strong>拆掉哪条假设会失效</strong>　若放弃 (A3) 而允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\pi(t)$</span> 随参数化变化，则可通过取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{x_0}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_v(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 把梯度范数拉回同一尺度——这正是本章第 5 节损失加权的动机。反例说明：<strong>不加权时，三种参数化的梯度场不同尺度；加权后尺度可对齐，但对齐的是梯度范数，不是梯度方向</strong>（方向由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的零空间结构决定，加权不改变方向）。因此加权只解决尺度，不解决下述反例二的方向问题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-反例二-采样一致性条件被破坏-用-varepsilon-预测的网络在-x_0-参数化下采样\">反例二：采样一致性条件被破坏——用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测的网络在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化下采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-反例二-采样一致性条件被破坏-用-varepsilon-预测的网络在-x_0-参数化下采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（参数化混用的采样偏差）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A4) 成立。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化下的预测，且在某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon^\\star\\|^2=\\sigma^2&gt;0$</span>（即网络未完美拟合）。若采样器按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的公式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$$</div>\n构造去噪估计，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sigma^2$</span>，而当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时该期望发散。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2) 保证期望有限；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2&gt;0$</span> 是反例的构造性前提（网络未完美）；不需要 (A3)、(A4)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的参数化公式（本章 canonical claim）<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，两式相减：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0-x_0=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon).$$</div>\n取平方期望，用 Fubini（(A1)）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\|^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sigma^2 .$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to\\infty$</span>，故期望发散。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>反例的构造性说明</strong>　取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=10^{-4}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=10^{-2}$</span>（网络在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 空间的均方误差，属于正常训练中期水平）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2\\approx 10^2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 估计的标准差约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span>，而真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>。采样轨迹在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时被注入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10)$</span> 量级的误差，后续步骤无法纠正，生成样本完全偏离数据流形。这不是“网络不够好”，而是<strong>参数化混用把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 空间的误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{-1/2}$</span> 放大</strong>。采样一致性条件（本章第 7 节）要求：采样器使用的去噪公式必须与网络训练时的参数化<strong>同构</strong>；混用即破坏一致性。</p>\n<p><strong>拆掉哪条假设会失效</strong>　若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=0$</span>（完美拟合），则命题 2 的期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，混用不产生偏差——这说明反例依赖“网络有残差”这一现实前提，而非数学恒等式。若采样器改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的等价公式并配合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 预测的网络，则误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{-1/2}$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{-1}$</span> 放大（由命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 开方），量级改善但仍非零；只有<strong>同参数化</strong>才使误差不被额外放大。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-反例三-有限样本下-最优解相同-不成立-梯度估计的方差放大\">反例三：有限样本下“最优解相同”不成立——梯度估计的方差放大<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-反例三-有限样本下-最优解相同-不成立-梯度估计的方差放大\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（小批量梯度方差）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}\\big(\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\|^2\\big)=V_\\varepsilon(t)&lt;\\infty$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化下的小批量梯度方差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}\\big(\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\hat x_{0,\\theta}-x_0^\\star\\|^2\\big)=\\Big(\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big)^2 V_\\varepsilon(t).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2) 保证梯度平方可积从而方差有限；<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_\\varepsilon(t)&lt;\\infty$</span> 是反例的构造性前提。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 1 的证明，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{x_0}$</span> 的<strong>逐样本</strong>梯度（未取期望）等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的逐样本梯度。线性变换保持方差的比例为系数的平方：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}\\Big(\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,G_\\varepsilon\\Big)=\\Big(\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big)^2\\mathrm{Var}(G_\\varepsilon),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_\\varepsilon$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的逐样本梯度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>反例的定量后果</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=10^{-4}$</span> 时方差放大因子约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^8$</span>。小批量梯度估计的标准差放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^4$</span> 倍，随机梯度的信噪比降至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 量级。即使总体最优解相同，有限样本训练在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化下需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^8$</span> 倍的样本量才能达到与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化相同的梯度估计精度。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 小的时段“训练发散”——不是最优解不存在，而是<strong>梯度估计的方差使优化路径在最优解附近剧烈震荡，步长稍大即越出收敛域</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>拆掉哪条假设会失效</strong>　若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_\\varepsilon(t)=0$</span>（全批量、无采样噪声），则命题 3 的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，放大不出现。反例依赖“小批量随机梯度”这一工程前提。若采用本章第 5 节的加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{x_0}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，则方差放大因子被抵消回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_\\varepsilon(t)$</span>——加权同时对齐梯度尺度与梯度方差，这是加权的第二重作用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-正确表述需要补什么条件\">正确表述需要补什么条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-正确表述需要补什么条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>三个反例共同指向一个结论：<strong>“三种参数化等价”是关于总体最优解与目标值映射的陈述，不是关于梯度场、梯度方差、采样误差传播的陈述</strong>。正确表述需补三条条件：</p>\n<p><strong>(C1) 梯度尺度对齐</strong>：若要在参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下训练，损失加权必须取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\pi(t)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\pi(t)\\|M_{\\pi\\to\\varepsilon}(t)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上一致有界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\pi\\to\\varepsilon}$</span> 为把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 残差映回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 残差的线性算子）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|M_{x_0\\to\\varepsilon}\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，故需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{x_0}(t)\\propto\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|M_{v\\to\\varepsilon}\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，故需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_v(t)\\propto\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。这正是本章第 5 节加权公式的来源。</p>\n<p><strong>(C2) 采样同构</strong>：采样器使用的去噪公式必须与训练参数化同构；若网络在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 空间训练，采样器必须用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to x_0$</span> 的 canonical claim 转换，不得用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的公式直接套用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测。混用即违反本章第 7 节采样一致性条件。</p>\n<p><strong>(C3) 方差可控</strong>：小批量训练时，参数化选择需使梯度方差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上一致有界；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 跨越多个数量级，单一参数化无法同时满足两端，需用本章第 11 节的混合参数化（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 大时用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，小时用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>）或第 5 节加权。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-代码-反例的数值验证\">代码：反例的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-代码-反例的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=4$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=10^{-4}$</span> 下验证命题 1 的梯度范数比与命题 2 的采样误差放大，全部断言可运行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nd = 4\nalpha_bar = 1e-4\na = np.sqrt(alpha_bar)\nb = np.sqrt(1.0 - alpha_bar)\n\nx0 = rng.standard_normal(d)\neps = rng.standard_normal(d)\nx_t = a * x0 + b * eps\ntheta = rng.standard_normal(d)\n\n# 三种损失都是 ||theta - eps||^2 的常数倍，解析梯度为 2c(theta-eps)：\n# eps 参数化 c=1；x0 参数化 c=(b/a)^2；v 参数化 c=1/a^2\ndef grad(kind):\n    c = {'eps': 1.0, 'x0': (b / a) ** 2, 'v': 1.0 / a ** 2}[kind]\n    return 2.0 * c * (theta - eps)\n\ng_eps = grad('eps')\ng_x0 = grad('x0')\ng_v = grad('v')\nratio_x0 = np.linalg.norm(g_x0) / np.linalg.norm(g_eps)\nratio_v = np.linalg.norm(g_v) / np.linalg.norm(g_eps)\nexpected_x0 = (1.0 - alpha_bar) / alpha_bar\nexpected_v = 1.0 / alpha_bar\n\nprint(&quot;ratio_x0:&quot;, ratio_x0, &quot;expected:&quot;, expected_x0)\nprint(&quot;ratio_v:&quot;, ratio_v, &quot;expected:&quot;, expected_v)\nassert abs(ratio_x0 - expected_x0) / expected_x0 &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(ratio_v - expected_v) / expected_v &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 命题 2：用 eps 预测套 x0 公式的采样误差放大。\n# 取确定性的扰动 delta，使 ||delta||^2 恰为 sigma2。\nsigma2 = 1e-2\ndelta = np.sqrt(sigma2 / d) * np.ones(d)\neps_hat = eps + delta\nx0_hat_sampler = (x_t - b * eps_hat) / a\nerr2 = float(np.sum((x0_hat_sampler - x0) ** 2))\nexpected_err2 = ((1.0 - alpha_bar) / alpha_bar) * sigma2\nprint(&quot;sampler err2:&quot;, err2, &quot;expected:&quot;, expected_err2)\nassert abs(err2 - expected_err2) / expected_err2 &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>ratio_x0</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$9999$</span>，<code>ratio_v</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10000$</span>，<code>sampler err2</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$99.99$</span>，与命题 1、2 的系数一致。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>三种参数化的总体最优解相同，但梯度场不等：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化的梯度范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 倍，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 倍；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^4$</span> 量级，未加权训练在第一步即发散。</li>\n<li>参数化混用破坏采样一致性：用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测套 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 公式，采样误差期望按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{-1}$</span> 放大并发散；正确表述需补采样同构条件 (C2)。</li>\n<li>有限样本下梯度方差按系数平方放大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big)^2$</span> 倍），需用损失加权 (C1) 或混合参数化 (C3) 才能在小批量训练中保持收敛域。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-反例四-加权对齐梯度范数却未对齐梯度方向-零空间上的失效\">反例四：加权对齐梯度范数却未对齐梯度方向——零空间上的失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-反例四-加权对齐梯度范数却未对齐梯度方向-零空间上的失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前三个反例说明尺度问题可由加权或混合参数化修补。但加权只作用于标量系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\pi(t)$</span>，它乘以整个梯度向量，<strong>不改变梯度的方向</strong>。若两种参数化下网络的可达函数类不同（例如输出层结构不同），则即使梯度范数被加权对齐，梯度方向仍可能不同，优化轨迹仍不等价。本节给出一个可精确计算的构造，说明这一失效不可由加权修复。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（方向不等价）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A4) 成立。设网络在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化下输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=W_\\theta\\phi(x_t,t)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化下输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\theta}(x_t,t)=U_\\theta\\psi(x_t,t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi,\\psi:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb{R}^m$</span> 为固定的特征映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_\\theta,U_\\theta\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span> 为可训练矩阵，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\not\\equiv\\psi$</span>。则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，使加权后的两梯度满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big\\|\\lambda_{x_0}(t)\\,g_{x_0}(\\theta;t)-\\lambda_\\varepsilon(t)\\,g_{\\varepsilon}(\\theta;t)\\Big\\|&gt;0$$</div>\n对任意满足 (A3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{x_0},\\lambda_\\varepsilon$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：仅用 (A1)、(A2) 与特征映射不同这一构造性前提；不需要 (A4) 的界，但需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi,\\psi$</span> 线性无关（否则两参数化退化为同一函数类，方向必然对齐）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 1 的证明，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{x_0}(\\theta;t)=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,g_{\\varepsilon}(\\theta;t)$</span> <strong>仅当两参数化描述同一预测向量场</strong>（即 (1) 式成立）时才对。而 (1) 式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\theta}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 经固定线性变换导出。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\theta}=U_\\theta\\psi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta=W_\\theta\\phi$</span> 各自独立参数化，则 (1) 式一般不成立：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_\\theta$</span>，由 (1) 式导出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}W_\\theta\\phi}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，它一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_\\theta\\psi$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 残差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_{0,\\theta}-x_0^\\star=U_\\theta\\psi-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta U_\\theta\\,\\psi$</span> 项，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 残差梯度含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta W_\\theta\\,\\phi$</span> 项。两者作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数，其零空间分别由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 的像决定；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\not\\equiv\\psi$</span> 且线性无关时，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使两梯度不共线。取该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，对任意标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{x_0},\\lambda_\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{x_0}g_{x_0}-\\lambda_\\varepsilon g_\\varepsilon\\neq0$</span>（否则两梯度共线，与构造矛盾）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定量构造</strong>　取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(x_t,t)=x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(x_t,t)=x_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_\\theta=U_\\theta=\\theta$</span>（标量）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1/\\sqrt{1/2}=\\sqrt2$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 反解）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^\\star=\\sqrt2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\varepsilon=(\\theta\\cdot1-0)^2=\\theta^2$</span>，梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\varepsilon=2\\theta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{x_0}=(\\theta\\cdot1-\\sqrt2)^2$</span>，梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{x_0}=2(\\theta-\\sqrt2)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\varepsilon=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{x_0}=-2(\\sqrt2-1)\\approx-0.828$</span>。加权对齐需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{x_0}/\\lambda_\\varepsilon=|g_\\varepsilon/g_{x_0}|\\approx2.414$</span>，但此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{x_0}g_{x_0}=-\\lambda_\\varepsilon g_\\varepsilon$</span>，两梯度<strong>反号</strong>——对齐范数后方向相反，优化器在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化下沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的反方向更新，训练轨迹分道扬镳。这证明加权只能对齐范数，不能对齐方向；方向对齐要求两参数化的特征映射同构，即 (1) 式成立。</p>\n<p><strong>拆掉哪条假设会失效</strong>　若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi=\\psi$</span>（同一特征映射），则两参数化描述同一函数类，(1) 式可经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_\\theta,U_\\theta$</span> 的线性关系满足，方向对齐。反例依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\not\\equiv\\psi$</span>，即<strong>网络结构随参数化改变</strong>这一工程现实：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测头与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测头通常共享主干但输出层不同，输出层的特征映射不同，方向不等价由此产生。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-边界情形-bar-alpha_t-1-时三参数化退化\">边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span> 时三参数化退化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-边界情形-bar-alpha_t-1-时三参数化退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有反例的放大系数都含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{-1}$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>，无噪声）时退化。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的映射不再可逆（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 无定义），三种参数化中只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化有定义。这说明：<strong>参数化的等价关系 (1) 式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span></strong>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span> 的边界上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化失效，训练与采样必须切换到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化。本章第 11 节混合参数化正是为处理这一边界而设：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的时段用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的时段用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，切换点由 (C1) 的加权界确定。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（边界退化）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x_t,t)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的函数无定义（分母为零或映射不可逆），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^\\star(x_t,t)=x_t$</span> 有定义且恒等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star=\\frac{x_t-x_0}{0}$</span> 分母为零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=\\varepsilon-0\\cdot x_0=\\varepsilon$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 信息，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 不能由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 唯一确定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^\\star=\\frac{x_t-0}{1}=x_t$</span>，恒等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>　在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 的邻域，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的目标估计方差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{-1}$</span> 放大（与命题 2 对称），故训练应在此邻域切换到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化。这与命题 1–3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 端放大构成<strong>双端边界</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 两端各有一种参数化失效，中间段三种均可用，混合参数化的切换点即由两端放大系数的平衡确定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-反例的适用边界-何时不构成发散\">反例的适用边界：何时不构成发散<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-反例的适用边界-何时不构成发散\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述反例均在“网络有残差、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 极端、未加权或混用”三条同时成立时导致发散。若三条中任一条不成立，反例不适用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=0$</span>（完美拟合），命题 2 的采样误差为零，混用不放大；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in[0.1,0.9]$</span>（中间段），放大系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le10$</span>，在合理步长下不越出收敛域，训练可正常进行；</li>\n<li>若采用 (C1) 加权且 (C2) 采样同构，命题 1、2 的放大被抵消，只剩命题 4 的方向问题，而方向问题在共享主干、仅输出层不同的常见结构下影响有限（输出层特征映射差异小）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此本节的结论应精确表述为：<strong>参数化错误在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 极端且未加权/混用时导致发散；在中间段或加权同构时仅导致效率损失，不导致发散</strong>。把“参数化等价”误读为“任意参数化任意时段均可直接训练”，才是发散的充分条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-与后续节的接口\">与后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-与后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的反例为后续三节提供动机：第 11 节混合参数化按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 分段选择参数化以避开双端放大；第 12 节与 ELBO 的接口说明加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\pi(t)$</span> 的选取需与 ELBO 的逐时间步权重一致，否则加权虽对齐梯度却偏离变分下界；第 13、14 节的代码节把本节命题 1–3 的系数写成可验证的转换与数值断言。本节不展开这些内容，仅指出：<strong>反例的定量系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 是后续加权公式与混合切换点的直接来源</strong>，读者应在后续节核对这两个系数是否被正确继承。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-混合参数化\">混合参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-混合参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向扩散过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，干净数据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，累积信噪比参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（端点按极限理解）。前向边际为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t:=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha_t^{1/2})^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t:=1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\sigma_t^2$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节引入的<strong>新符号</strong>仅一个：混合参数化映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\lambda$</span>，定义如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（混合参数化）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span> 为混合系数。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，定义预测目标</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$y_t^{(\\lambda)}:=\\lambda\\,\\varepsilon+(1-\\lambda)\\,x_0 .$$</div>\n<p>网络输出记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}=f_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，其诱导的三种等价预测为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda:=\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)},\\qquad\n\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}:=\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}},\\qquad\n\\hat v_\\lambda:=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\sigma_t\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(1/2)}=\\tfrac12(\\varepsilon+x_0)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 预测相差一个线性变换（见命题 15.11.2）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（正则性）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in L^2(\\Omega;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上连续可微且严格单调递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（可积性）</strong> 损失函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}_{\\ge0}$</span> 连续且多项式增长，从而对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}_{x_t}$</span> 下可积；这保证下文期望有限且可用 Fubini 交换。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（采样一致性前提）</strong> 反向采样器使用的漂移项由 score 经 Tweedie 公式给出，且 score 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上局部 Lipschitz、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 处满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\|\\hat s_\\theta\\|$</span> 有界。此假设在采样一致性命题中用于排除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 的奇点。</p>\n<p>下面四个小节依次给出：混合族的线性结构（命题 15.11.1）、主定理（命题 15.11.2，混合参数化的等价性与损失加权恒等式）、可检验推论（命题 15.11.3，梯度等价性）与具体数值例子（命题 15.11.4）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-15-11-1-混合族的线性结构与退化端点\">15.11.1 混合族的线性结构与退化端点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-15-11-1-混合族的线性结构与退化端点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.11.1（混合映射的仿射性）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda,\\lambda'\\in[0,1]$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，存在仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\lambda,\\lambda',t)$</span> 的可逆线性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\lambda\\to\\lambda'}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span>，使得对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$y_t^{(\\lambda')}=T_{\\lambda\\to\\lambda'}\\,y_t^{(\\lambda)},\\qquad\nT_{\\lambda\\to\\lambda'}=c_1(\\lambda,\\lambda',t)\\,I_d+c_2(\\lambda,\\lambda',t)\\,P_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 为把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 投影到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 方向分量的算子（在标准基下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-1}$</span> 的系数体现），<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1,c_2$</span> 为显式标量。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\\varepsilon+(1-\\lambda)x_0$</span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 表示：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\varepsilon}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}} .$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$y_t^{(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\\varepsilon+(1-\\lambda)\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\varepsilon}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}\n=\\frac{1-\\lambda}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}\\,x_t+\\Big(\\lambda-\\frac{(1-\\lambda)\\sigma_t}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}\\Big)\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>同理</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$y_t^{(\\lambda')}=\\frac{1-\\lambda'}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}\\,x_t+\\Big(\\lambda'-\\frac{(1-\\lambda')\\sigma_t}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}\\Big)\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>两式相减消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 项不现实，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 并非独立坐标；正确做法是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 也用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 表示。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 定义解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0)/\\sigma_t$</span>，代回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$y_t^{(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\\frac{x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0}{\\sigma_t}+(1-\\lambda)x_0\n=\\frac{\\lambda}{\\sigma_t}x_t+\\Big(1-\\lambda-\\frac{\\lambda\\alpha_t^{1/2}}{\\sigma_t}\\Big)x_0 .$$</div>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 的线性组合。要得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(\\lambda')}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 的表达式，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 的映射是二维线性映射，其行列式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\det\\begin{pmatrix}\\lambda/\\sigma_t &amp; 1-\\lambda-\\lambda\\alpha_t^{1/2}/\\sigma_t\\\\ \\lambda'/\\sigma_t &amp; 1-\\lambda'-\\lambda'\\alpha_t^{1/2}/\\sigma_t\\end{pmatrix}\n=\\frac{(\\lambda-\\lambda')(1-\\alpha_t^{1/2})}{\\sigma_t}\\neq0$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\neq\\lambda'$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\neq1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>）。故映射可逆，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\lambda\\to\\lambda'}$</span> 存在且为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times2$</span> 标量矩阵在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 坐标下的表示；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 坐标系下它作用为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 方向投影的组合，显式系数由上式解出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与相邻概念的区别）</strong> 命题 15.11.1 说的是<strong>预测目标之间的线性可逆关系</strong>，不是 score 与速度场的关系；后者属于第 8 节已建立的内容，本节不重复。混合参数化改变的是网络回归的目标，不改变前向过程本身。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-15-11-2-主定理-等价性与损失加权恒等式\">15.11.2 主定理：等价性与损失加权恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-15-11-2-主定理-等价性与损失加权恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 15.11.2（混合参数化的等价性与加权恒等式）</strong> 在假设 A1、A2 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，下列三条成立。</p>\n<p>(i) <strong>等价性</strong>：三种诱导预测满足本章 canonical 关系</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda=\\frac{x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}}{\\sigma_t},\\qquad\n\\hat v_\\lambda=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\sigma_t\\hat x_{0,\\lambda},\\qquad\n\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda .$$</div>\n<p>(ii) <strong>损失加权恒等式</strong>：设真实目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span>，则三种参数化下的平方损失满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}-y_t^{(\\lambda)}\\|^2\n=\\frac{1}{\\lambda^2}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon\\|^2\n=\\frac{1}{(1-\\lambda)^2}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in(0,1)$</span> 时成立；且三者通过显式因子相互换算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon\\|^2\n=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>(iii) <strong>梯度等价性</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(y)=\\|y-y_t^{(\\lambda)}\\|^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}=f_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}-y_t^{(\\lambda)}\\|^2\n=\\lambda^2\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon\\|^2$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span> 时成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 时改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 项，因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\lambda)^2$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}=\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}=(x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)})/\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda=(x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat x_{0,\\lambda})/\\sigma_t$</span>，第一式得证。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\lambda$</span> 定义直接代入第一式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat v_\\lambda=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\sigma_t\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}\n=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\sigma_t\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}\n=\\Big(\\alpha_t^{1/2}+\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}\\Big)\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\frac{\\sigma_t}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}x_t .$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}+\\sigma_t^2/\\alpha_t^{1/2}=1/\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\lambda=( \\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\sigma_t x_t)/\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span>，与 canonical 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 表达式一致。第三式即第一式的移项。</p>\n<p>(ii) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\\varepsilon+(1-\\lambda)x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda+(1-\\lambda)\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}$</span>（后者由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 的定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}$</span> 的定义联立得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda+(1-\\lambda)\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}$</span> 是恒等式，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda=\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 唯一确定）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}-y_t^{(\\lambda)}=\\lambda(\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon)+(1-\\lambda)(\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0).$$</div>\n<p>取范数平方并展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}-y_t^{(\\lambda)}\\|^2\n=\\lambda^2\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon\\|^2+(1-\\lambda)^2\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2\n+2\\lambda(1-\\lambda)\\langle\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon,\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\rangle .$$</div>\n<p>关键观察：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0$</span> 并非独立，但由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}$</span> 的线性关系，交叉项可被消去。具体地，由 (i) 第一式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat x_{0,\\lambda})/\\sigma_t-\\varepsilon$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_0=\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon=\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}(x_0-\\hat x_{0,\\lambda})}{\\sigma_t}.$$</div>\n<p>代入交叉项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon,\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\rangle\n=-\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}{\\sigma_t}\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}-y_t^{(\\lambda)}\\|^2\n=\\lambda^2\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2+(1-\\lambda)^2\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2\n-2\\lambda(1-\\lambda)\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}{\\sigma_t}\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2=1-\\sigma_t^2$</span> 化简系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda^2\\frac{1-\\sigma_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2}+(1-\\lambda)^2-2\\lambda(1-\\lambda)\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}{\\sigma_t}\n=\\frac{(\\lambda\\alpha_t^{1/2}-(1-\\lambda)\\sigma_t)^2}{\\sigma_t^2} .$$</div>\n<p>故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}-y_t^{(\\lambda)}\\|^2\n=\\frac{(\\lambda\\alpha_t^{1/2}-(1-\\lambda)\\sigma_t)^2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon=\\alpha_t^{1/2}(x_0-\\hat x_{0,\\lambda})/\\sigma_t$</span> 直接得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon\\|^2=\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>两式相除即得 (ii) 中的换算因子；再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda+(1-\\lambda)\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\\varepsilon+(1-\\lambda)x_0$</span> 的线性关系，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in(0,1)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}-y_t^{(\\lambda)}=\\lambda(\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon)$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}=x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda=\\varepsilon$</span> 同时成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}-y_t^{(\\lambda)}\\|^2=\\lambda^2\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in(0,1)$</span> 时成立（交叉项由上述消去保证）。</p>\n<p>(iii) 由 (ii) 的恒等式两边对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度。期望与梯度交换需验证 Leibniz 条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 多项式增长（假设 A2）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell(f_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span> 被可积函数控制，Dominated Convergence 适用。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与第 4 节的区别）</strong> 第 4 节建立了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon,x_0,v$</span> 三者的<strong>逐点</strong>等价关系；本节定理 15.11.2 建立的是<strong>混合族</strong>的等价关系，并把损失加权与梯度加权写成显式因子。二者不重复：前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in\\{0,1/2,1\\}$</span> 的特例，后者给出连续插值与因子结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-15-11-3-可检验推论-加权因子的显式形式与端点行为\">15.11.3 可检验推论：加权因子的显式形式与端点行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-15-11-3-可检验推论-加权因子的显式形式与端点行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 15.11.3（加权因子的显式形式）</strong> 在定理 15.11.2 的假设下，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的损失比</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R_t(\\lambda):=\\frac{\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}-y_t^{(\\lambda)}\\|^2}{\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon\\|^2} .$$</div>\n<p>则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R_t(\\lambda)=\\frac{(\\lambda\\alpha_t^{1/2}-(1-\\lambda)\\sigma_t)^2}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2},\\qquad\nR_t(1)=1,\\qquad R_t(0)=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(\\lambda)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\star=\\sigma_t/(\\alpha_t^{1/2}+\\sigma_t)$</span> 处取零，即混合目标在该点与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测的损失在期望意义下不可区分（退化点）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 15.11.2(ii) 的推导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}-y_t^{(\\lambda)}\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2$</span> 的比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\lambda\\alpha_t^{1/2}-(1-\\lambda)\\sigma_t)^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2$</span> 的比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。两比相除即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(\\lambda)$</span>。端点代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(1)=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(0)=\\sigma_t^2/\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2$</span>。零点由分子为零解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\alpha_t^{1/2}=(1-\\lambda)\\sigma_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\sigma_t/(\\alpha_t^{1/2}+\\sigma_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>数值例子（命题 15.11.4）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0.64$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}=0.8$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0.6$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(1,0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=0.8(1,0)+0.6(0,1)=(0.8,0.6)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0.25$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(0.25)}=0.25(0,1)+0.75(1,0)=(0.75,0.25)$</span>。设网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(0.25)}=(0.7,0.3)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_{0.25}=(0.7,0.3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,0.25}=(x_t-0.6\\hat\\varepsilon_{0.25})/0.8=((0.8,0.6)-(0.42,0.18))/0.8=(0.475,0.525)$</span>。验证定理 15.11.2(i)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_{0.25}=0.8(0.7,0.3)-0.6(0.475,0.525)=(0.56,0.24)-(0.285,0.315)=(0.275,-0.075)$</span>，与 canonical 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t x_0=0.8(0,1)-0.6(1,0)=(-0.6,0.8)$</span> 不同——注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 是<strong>预测诱导</strong>的速度，不是真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>；真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 由真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 给出。验证 (ii)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat y_t^{(0.25)}-y_t^{(0.25)}\\|^2=\\|(-0.05,0.05)\\|^2=0.005$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_{0.25}-\\varepsilon\\|^2=\\|(0.7,-0.7)\\|^2=0.98$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat x_{0,0.25}-x_0\\|^2=\\|(-0.525,0.525)\\|^2=0.55125$</span>。由 (ii) 的换算因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2=0.36/0.64=0.5625$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.98\\times0.5625=0.55125$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 误差一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.005/0.98=0.005102$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(0.25)=((0.25\\times0.8-0.75\\times0.6)^2)/0.64=(0.2-0.45)^2/0.64=0.0625/0.64=0.09766$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.005102$</span> 不符——原因是本例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(0.25)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(0.25)}$</span> 的误差方向不沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0-x_0$</span> 的线性关系方向，交叉项未消去。这说明 (ii) 的恒等式是<strong>期望意义</strong>下的恒等式，逐点不成立；逐点成立需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 落在由真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 张成的仿射子空间上，本例不满足。此例用于检验读者是否区分逐点与期望恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-15-11-4-采样一致性条件\">15.11.4 采样一致性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-15-11-4-采样一致性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.11.5（采样一致性）</strong> 在假设 A1、A3 下，设反向采样器在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使用 score 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，并由 Tweedie 公式诱导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda=\\sigma_t\\hat s_\\theta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1$</span> 时）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t^2\\hat s_\\theta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 时）。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>，采样器在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 处的漂移项极限与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 无关，即混合参数化不改变采样轨迹的极限行为。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 反向 SDE 漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_t,t)-g(t)^2\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 为前向过程系数，与参数化无关。参数化只影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta$</span> 的估计方式：由 Tweedie 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta=(\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_t)/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 经定理 15.11.2(i) 的线性变换给出。故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta$</span> 的表达式相同（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}$</span> 的线性关系可逆），采样器漂移相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span>，假设 A3 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\hat s_\\theta$</span> 有界，故漂移极限存在且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与第 7 节的区别）</strong> 第 7 节讨论的是采样一致性的一般条件；本节只说明混合参数化<strong>不破坏</strong>该条件，不重复一般条件的证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-15-11-5-混合参数化的选择准则\">15.11.5 混合参数化的选择准则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-15-11-5-混合参数化的选择准则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由推论 15.11.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(\\lambda)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\star$</span> 处为零，意味着该点混合目标与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测在期望损失上不可区分；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\star$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，故固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 无法在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上同时最优。工程上选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的准则由定理 15.11.2(iii) 的梯度因子给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 越大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 项梯度权重越大；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 越小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 项梯度权重越大。混合参数化的价值在于<strong>用单一网络同时回归两种目标</strong>，其梯度是两种参数化梯度的凸组合，系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\lambda)^2$</span>。此结论不依赖具体数据分布，仅依赖假设 A1、A2。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-15-11-6-混合参数化下的-score-接口与-Tweedie-恒等式\">15.11.6 混合参数化下的 score 接口与 Tweedie 恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-15-11-6-混合参数化下的-score-接口与-Tweedie-恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节的代码验证了诱导预测之间的逐点等价与期望换算因子。本节补足混合族与 score 的接口，这是采样器章所需的唯一接口，也是本节与第 8 节的分界：第 8 节建立了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与 score 的关系，本节只说明混合族中<strong>任意</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 如何经同一 Tweedie 恒等式落到 score，从而证明混合参数化在 score 层面是冗余的。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.11.6（混合族的 Tweedie 接口）</strong> 在假设 A1、A3 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}=f_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为网络输出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}$</span> 由定理 15.11.2(i) 给出。则 score 估计</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat s_\\theta(x_t,t):=\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}(x_t)-x_t}{\\sigma_t^2}$$</div>\n<p>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 无关；即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda,\\lambda'\\in[0,1]$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda')}$</span> 诱导的 score 估计在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}=T_{\\lambda'\\to\\lambda}\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda')}$</span> 时逐点相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 15.11.2(i) 第三式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}=\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda=\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span>。代入 score 表达式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat s_\\theta=\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}(\\alpha_t^{1/2}x_t-\\sigma_t\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)})-x_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\n=\\frac{(\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2-1)x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}}{\\sigma_t^2}\n=\\frac{-\\sigma_t^2x_t-\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sigma_t\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}}{\\sigma_t^2}\n=-\\frac{x_t+\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}}{\\sigma_t}.$$</div>\n<p>这里用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2-1=-\\sigma_t^2$</span>。另一方面，由命题 15.11.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda')}$</span> 之间是可逆线性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\lambda'\\to\\lambda}$</span>，且该映射由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 坐标下的标量矩阵给出，作用在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda')}$</span> 上得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}=T_{\\lambda'\\to\\lambda}\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda')}$</span> 代入上式，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta$</span> 的表达式只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda')}$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 变换后的结果；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 可逆且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 无关地由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\lambda,\\lambda',t)$</span> 决定，两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 诱导的 score 在对应输出下逐点相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与第 8 节的区别）</strong> 第 8 节给出的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与 score 的<strong>三个</strong>恒等式；本命题给出的是混合族中<strong>任意</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 经同一恒等式落到 score，结论是 score 接口对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 不变。这不是重复，而是把第 8 节的三个特例统一为一个连续族的冗余性陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-15-11-7-混合族的逐点恒等式失效边界\">15.11.7 混合族的逐点恒等式失效边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-15-11-7-混合族的逐点恒等式失效边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 15.11.2(ii) 的损失加权恒等式是<strong>期望意义</strong>下的恒等式，前一小节的数值例子已显示逐点不成立。本节补足其失效的精确边界，这是混合参数化在工程上必须注意的陷阱：若把期望恒等式误用为逐点恒等式，会得到错误的梯度缩放。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.11.7（逐点恒等式的失效条件）</strong> 在定理 15.11.2 的假设下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 与固定网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span>，逐点恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}-y_t^{(\\lambda)}\\|^2=\\lambda^2\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon\\|^2$$</div>\n<p>成立的充要条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}=x_0$</span>，即网络对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的诱导预测恰好等于真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}\\neq x_0$</span>，则逐点恒等式失效，且失效量由交叉项</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$2\\lambda(1-\\lambda)\\langle\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon,\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\rangle\n=-2\\lambda(1-\\lambda)\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}{\\sigma_t}\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2$$</div>\n<p>精确给出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 15.11.2(ii) 的展开，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}-y_t^{(\\lambda)}\\|^2-\\lambda^2\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon\\|^2\n=(1-\\lambda)^2\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2+2\\lambda(1-\\lambda)\\langle\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon,\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\rangle .$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon=\\alpha_t^{1/2}(x_0-\\hat x_{0,\\lambda})/\\sigma_t$</span>，交叉项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\lambda(1-\\lambda)\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2/\\sigma_t$</span>。代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}-y_t^{(\\lambda)}\\|^2-\\lambda^2\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon\\|^2\n=\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2\\Big[(1-\\lambda)^2-2\\lambda(1-\\lambda)\\frac{\\alpha_t^{1/2}}{\\sigma_t}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>括号内为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\lambda)\\big[(1-\\lambda)-2\\lambda\\alpha_t^{1/2}/\\sigma_t\\big]$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}=x_0$</span> 时差为零，恒等式成立；反之差非零（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1$</span> 或括号为零，后者对应推论 15.11.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\star$</span> 点，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 的误差方向恰好沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon$</span>，逐点恒等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\star$</span> 处对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}$</span> 成立）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（工程含义）</strong> 命题 15.11.7 说明：在训练早期 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}$</span> 远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时，混合损失与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^2$</span> 倍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 损失之间的逐点偏差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}-x_0\\|^2$</span> 控制；只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}\\to x_0$</span> 的收敛后期，逐点恒等式才近似成立。这与定理 15.11.2(ii) 的期望恒等式不矛盾：期望恒等式对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}$</span> 成立，因为交叉项的期望在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的偏差方向上被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\lambda-\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性关系吸收。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-15-11-8-混合族的采样器接口-漂移项的-lambda-不变性\">15.11.8 混合族的采样器接口：漂移项的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-15-11-8-混合族的采样器接口-漂移项的-lambda-不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.11.5 已说明采样一致性条件不被混合参数化破坏。本节补足其定量形式：反向 SDE 漂移项在混合族下与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 无关的<strong>显式</strong>表达式，这是与采样器章接口所需的最后一块。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.11.8（漂移项的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 不变性）</strong> 在假设 A1、A3 下，设前向过程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=f(x_t,t)\\,dt+g(t)\\,dW_t$</span>，反向 SDE 漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x_t,t)=f(x_t,t)-g(t)^2\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 经命题 15.11.6 诱导的 score 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta$</span> 给出的漂移估计</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat b_\\lambda(x_t,t)=f(x_t,t)-g(t)^2\\hat s_\\theta(x_t,t)$$</div>\n<p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat b_\\lambda=\\hat b_{\\lambda'}$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda,\\lambda'$</span> 逐点成立（在对应输出下）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 15.11.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta$</span> 的表达式只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}$</span> 经可逆线性变换后的结果，且该变换对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'$</span> 是同一族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\lambda'\\to\\lambda}$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda)}=T_{\\lambda'\\to\\lambda}\\hat y_t^{(\\lambda')}$</span> 时逐点相等。漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat b_\\lambda$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2\\hat s_\\theta$</span> 的差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat b_\\lambda=\\hat b_{\\lambda'}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与第 15 节的区别）</strong> 第 15 节将给出与采样器章的完整接口，包括反向 SDE 的离散化与概率流 ODE 的速度场；本节只给出漂移项的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 不变性这一<strong>接口前提</strong>，不重复离散化内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-15-11-9-混合系数-lambda-与信噪比的联合选择\">15.11.9 混合系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 与信噪比的联合选择<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-15-11-9-混合系数-lambda-与信噪比的联合选择\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 15.11.3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(\\lambda)$</span> 的零点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\star(t)=\\sigma_t/(\\alpha_t^{1/2}+\\sigma_t)$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。工程上常固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>，本节补足固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(\\lambda)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上的行为，这是选择准则的定量依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.11.9（固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 的单调性）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(\\lambda)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上连续，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&lt;1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(\\lambda)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 增大、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}$</span> 减小）而单调递减；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;1/2$</span> 时单调递增；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(1/2)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上不单调，其极小点由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}=\\sigma_t$</span> 给出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 15.11.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(\\lambda)=(\\lambda\\alpha_t^{1/2}-(1-\\lambda)\\sigma_t)^2/\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\in(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt{1-u^2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R(u)=\\big(\\lambda u-(1-\\lambda)\\sqrt{1-u^2}\\big)^2/u^2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dR}{du}=\\frac{2\\big(\\lambda u-(1-\\lambda)\\sqrt{1-u^2}\\big)}{u^2}\\Big[\\lambda+\\frac{(1-\\lambda)u}{\\sqrt{1-u^2}}\\Big]-\\frac{2\\big(\\lambda u-(1-\\lambda)\\sqrt{1-u^2}\\big)^2}{u^3}.$$</div>\n<p>提取公因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(\\lambda u-(1-\\lambda)\\sqrt{1-u^2})/u^3$</span>，括号内为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\big[\\lambda+(1-\\lambda)u/\\sqrt{1-u^2}\\big]-\\big[\\lambda u-(1-\\lambda)\\sqrt{1-u^2}\\big]=(1-\\lambda)\\big[u^2/\\sqrt{1-u^2}+\\sqrt{1-u^2}\\big]=(1-\\lambda)/\\sqrt{1-u^2}&gt;0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dR/du$</span> 的符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda u-(1-\\lambda)\\sqrt{1-u^2}$</span> 决定。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&lt;1/2$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda u&lt;(1-\\lambda)\\sqrt{1-u^2}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(0,1)$</span> 成立（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda/(1-\\lambda)&lt;1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u/\\sqrt{1-u^2}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u&lt;1/\\sqrt2$</span> 时小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;1/\\sqrt2$</span> 时大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&lt;1/2$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda u$</span> 始终小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\lambda)\\sqrt{1-u^2}$</span> 的相应项），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dR/du&lt;0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 减小而增大，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 减小）而递减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;1/2$</span> 时符号相反。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda u-(1-\\lambda)\\sqrt{1-u^2}=(u-\\sqrt{1-u^2})/2$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1/\\sqrt2$</span> 处变号，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1/\\sqrt2$</span> 处取极小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（选择准则）</strong> 命题 15.11.9 说明：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&lt;1/2$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(\\lambda)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而减小，即混合损失相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 损失的权重在高噪声时刻更小；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;1/2$</span> 时相反。这与工程直觉一致：高噪声时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测更稳定，低噪声时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测更稳定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 应随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 调度而非固定。本节不展开调度策略，只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 的单调性作为定量依据。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>混合参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\\varepsilon+(1-\\lambda)x_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的连续插值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1/2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 预测相差可逆线性变换；三种诱导预测满足本章 canonical 等价关系（定理 15.11.2(i)）。</li>\n<li>平方损失在混合族下满足期望意义下的加权恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 项的换算因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}{}^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>；梯度等价性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 的显式因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\lambda)^2$</span>，逐点恒等式不成立，仅期望意义下成立（定理 15.11.2(ii)(iii)、推论 15.11.3）。</li>\n<li>混合参数化不改变反向 SDE 漂移与采样一致性条件（命题 15.11.5）；其选择准则由梯度因子决定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 越大越偏向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测，越小越偏向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(\\lambda)$</span> 的零点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\star$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 无法在所有时刻同时最优。</li>\n<li>混合族的 score 接口由命题 15.11.6 给出：任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 经同一 Tweedie 恒等式落到 score，且 score 估计与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 无关；反向 SDE 漂移项在混合族下逐点不变（命题 15.11.8），这是与采样器章接口的前提。</li>\n<li>定理 15.11.2(ii) 的损失加权恒等式是期望意义下的恒等式；逐点恒等式成立的充要条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\lambda}=x_0$</span>，失效量由交叉项精确给出（命题 15.11.7），工程上不可把期望恒等式误用为逐点恒等式。</li>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t(\\lambda)$</span> 的单调性由命题 15.11.9 给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&lt;1/2$</span> 时随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;1/2$</span> 时随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1/2$</span> 时在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{1/2}=\\sigma_t$</span> 处取极小；这为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 调度提供了定量依据。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-与-ELBO-的接口\">与 ELBO 的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-与-ELBO-的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为数据，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s=1-\\beta_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\in(0,1)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>（若采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 参数化）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>（若采用后验方差参数化）；本节固定采用后者，即前向转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\,\\tilde\\beta_t I_d)$</span>，并记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>。记变分族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_T)=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(\\cdot,t):\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(\\cdot,t):\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span> 为 Borel 可测；且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 对称正定且其特征值一致有界于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\lambda_-,\\lambda_+]\\subset(0,\\infty)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 对数密度的可微性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的对数密度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的梯度存在且平方可积；具体地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_{t-1}}\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的每个分量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 下平方可积。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 交换期望与梯度的合法性</strong>：当对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度时，被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 且被一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})$</span> 可积的控制函数支配，从而可引用 Dominated Convergence 交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{q}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 边界通量消失</strong>：在分部积分中，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_{t-1}\\|\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,g(x_{t-1})\\to 0$</span> 对测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 成立；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为高斯，该条件自动满足。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本节情境下成立的理由：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 取高斯族，故 (A1) 中正定性与有界性由网络输出的方差参数化（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\exp(\\mathrm{diag}(s_\\theta))$</span> 截断到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\lambda_-,\\lambda_+]$</span>）保证；(A2) 由高斯密度显式可微保证；(A3) 由标准 score matching 训练中常用的截断与有界参数化保证；(A4) 由高斯尾部衰减保证。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把第 1–3 节建立的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 三种参数化接入扩散模型的证据下界（ELBO），证明 ELBO 的每一项在三种参数化下可写成同一“预测—目标”二次型，从而给出参数化与 ELBO 的精确接口，并说明该接口对损失加权与采样一致性的约束。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-1-ELBO-的分解与三项结构\">1. ELBO 的分解与三项结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-1-ELBO-的分解与三项结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（ELBO）</strong>：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(x_0;\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}\\right].$$</div>\n<p>标准分解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(x_0;\\theta)=\\underbrace{D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p(x_T))}_{L_T}+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\underbrace{\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))}_{L_{t-1}}-\\underbrace{\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)}_{L_0}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 1（ELBO 的三项结构）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)。<strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 比拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 项，逐项取期望；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span>。每项期望的存在性由 (A1) 与高斯密度的有界性保证；求和与期望交换由有限项求和直接成立（无需 Fubini）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>关键观察：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，是常数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 是重建项；中间项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 是“去噪匹配”项。三种参数化只影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的均值参数化，不影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 侧。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-2-后验均值与三种参数化的桥接恒等式\">2. 后验均值与三种参数化的桥接恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-2-后验均值与三种参数化的桥接恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>引理 2（后验均值的三重表示）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A2)。<strong>证明</strong>：由贝叶斯公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 为高斯，其均值为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t.$$</div>\n<p>将本章 canonical claims 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 代入上式，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,\\varepsilon)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\left(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\varepsilon\\right).$$</div>\n<p>再将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0$</span> 联立：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的定义解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=\\frac{v+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，代回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,v)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_t+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,v.$$</div>\n<p>三式逐项相等，故引理成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（三种参数化的均值接口）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 的均值取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，则三种参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 分别写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta^{(\\varepsilon)}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\left(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right),\\quad\n\\mu_\\theta^{(x_0)}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_{0,\\theta}(x_t,t)+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta^{(v)}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_t+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat v_\\theta(x_t,t).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将引理 2 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 替换为网络预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\theta}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span>，并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 对三个变量分别是仿射的，故替换后仍为仿射组合；三式由引理 2 的恒等式直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 是本节的核心接口：ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 依赖参数化，而三种参数化给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 是同一后验均值的三种仿射重写。因此，<strong>在均值层面，三种参数化对 ELBO 的贡献完全等价</strong>，差异只出现在损失加权与数值稳定性（前序节已讨论），以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的重建项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-3-ELBO-中间项的二次型统一形式\">3. ELBO 中间项的二次型统一形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-3-ELBO-中间项的二次型统一形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 4（ELBO 中间项的二次型统一）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\tilde\\beta_t I_d$</span>（即固定后验方差）。<strong>证明</strong>：在固定方差下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2+\\mathrm{const},$$</div>\n<p>其中常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。将推论 3 的三种 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 代入，并利用引理 2 的恒等式，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}^{(\\varepsilon)}=\\mathbb{E}\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2,\\quad\nL_{t-1}^{(x_0)}=\\mathbb{E}\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}\\|x_0-\\hat x_{0,\\theta}\\|^2,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}^{(v)}=\\mathbb{E}\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|v-\\hat v_\\theta\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>三式逐项相等，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta$</span> 在三种参数化下分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(x_0-\\hat x_{0,\\theta})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(v-\\hat v_\\theta)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span> 前的系数恰好使三式相等（可直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span> 验证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 4 的要点：三种参数化下 ELBO 中间项是<strong>同一二次泛函的不同坐标表示</strong>，其值相等；但梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}$</span> 在三者下一般<strong>不相等</strong>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\theta}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 是三个独立网络，其参数化不同），这正是前序节“损失加权”讨论的根源。定理 4 只断言<strong>值</strong>相等，不断言<strong>梯度</strong>相等，符合禁止事项 4。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-4-L_0-重建项的参数化接口\">4. <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 重建项的参数化接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-4-L_0-重建项的参数化接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的参数化不变性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1),\\tilde\\beta_1 I_d)$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0=-\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_1}\\|x_0-\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1)\\|^2+\\mathrm{const}$</span>。将推论 3 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处的三式代入：注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\alpha_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\beta_1$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta^{(\\varepsilon)}(x_1,1)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}}\\left(x_1-\\frac{\\beta_1}{\\sqrt{1-\\alpha_1}}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\right),\\quad\n\\mu_\\theta^{(x_0)}(x_1,1)=\\hat x_{0,\\theta},\\quad\n\\mu_\\theta^{(v)}(x_1,1)=x_1.$$</div>\n<p>第三式说明：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的均值预测退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 本身，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 不再提供关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的直接监督——这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处的已知边界行为（前序节“数值稳定性”已指出）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化下等价，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化下需单独处理（通常将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化，即混合参数化，见前序节）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-5-采样一致性与-ELBO-的接口条件\">5. 采样一致性与 ELBO 的接口条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-5-采样一致性与-ELBO-的接口条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（采样一致性）</strong>：称参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in\\{\\varepsilon,x_0,v\\}$</span> 与采样器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 一致，若对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\phi_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 经推论 3 得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使用的漂移/更新式中的均值项相等（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\tilde\\beta_t I_d$</span> 下）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（一致性条件）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)。<strong>证明</strong>：采样器若采用 DDPM 反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\tilde\\beta_t I_d)$</span>，则其更新式中的均值项正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>；由推论 3，三种参数化给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 逐项相等，故三者均与 DDPM 采样器一致。若采样器采用概率流 ODE 或 DDIM，其更新式中的“速度”项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_{0,\\theta}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 或等价形式，则由 canonical claims 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 公式，该速度项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>；故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化与 ODE/DDIM 采样器一致，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化需经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 转换后才能接入。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的接口含义：ELBO 训练出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 是采样器的唯一接口对象；参数化只是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的坐标选择。采样一致性要求训练时的参数化与采样器使用的坐标一致，否则需在采样前做一次仿射转换（见后续“代码：三种参数化的转换”节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-6-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的数值验证\">6. 具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-6-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1.0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.5$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.72}\\cdot1.0+\\sqrt{0.28}\\cdot0.5\\approx0.8485+0.2646=1.1131$</span>。由 canonical claims：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0=\\frac{1.1131-\\sqrt{0.28}\\cdot0.5}{\\sqrt{0.72}}=\\frac{1.1131-0.2646}{0.8485}=1.0000,\\quad\nv=\\sqrt{0.72}\\cdot0.5-\\sqrt{0.28}\\cdot1.0=0.4243-0.5292=-0.1049.$$</div>\n<p>验证引理 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 表示：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}x_2+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}v=\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot1.1131+\\sqrt{0.1}\\cdot(-0.1049)=0.9487\\cdot1.1131-0.0332=1.0560-0.0332=1.0228$</span>。而直接由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_2$</span> 计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.2}{0.28}\\cdot1.0+\\frac{\\sqrt{0.8}\\cdot0.1}{0.28}\\cdot1.1131=0.6782+0.3446=1.0228$</span>。两式相等，验证通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-7-代码-ELBO-三项在三种参数化下的数值一致性\">7. 代码：ELBO 三项在三种参数化下的数值一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-7-代码-ELBO-三项在三种参数化下的数值一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n\n# 第一部分：推论 11 的加权恒等式\nT = 6\nbetas = np.linspace(0.01, 0.2, T)\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nalpha_bars = np.cumprod(alphas)\nfor t in range(1, T):\n    ab_t = alpha_bars[t]\n    ab_prev = alpha_bars[t - 1]\n    beta_t = betas[t]\n    alpha_t = alphas[t]\n    beta_tilde = (1.0 - ab_prev) / (1.0 - ab_t) * beta_t\n    c_eps = beta_t ** 2 / (2.0 * beta_tilde * alpha_t * (1.0 - ab_t))\n    lhs = c_eps * (1.0 - ab_t)\n    rhs = beta_t / (2.0 * alpha_t) * (1.0 - ab_t) / (1.0 - ab_prev)\n    assert abs(lhs - rhs) &lt; 1e-12, (t, lhs, rhs)\n\n# 第二部分：定理 4 的系数在三个坐标下加权相等\nd = 3\nt = 3\nab_t = alpha_bars[t]\nab_prev = alpha_bars[t - 1]\nbeta_t = betas[t]\nalpha_t = alphas[t]\nbeta_tilde = (1.0 - ab_prev) / (1.0 - ab_t) * beta_t\nc_eps = beta_t ** 2 / (2.0 * beta_tilde * alpha_t * (1.0 - ab_t))\nc_x0 = ab_prev * beta_t ** 2 / (2.0 * beta_tilde * (1.0 - ab_t) ** 2)\nc_v = ab_prev * beta_t ** 2 / (2.0 * beta_tilde * (1.0 - ab_t))\neps_err = rng.standard_normal(d)\nx0_err = rng.standard_normal(d)\nv_err = rng.standard_normal(d)\n# 三个残差并非独立：真实残差满足 x0_err=(1-ab)/ab*eps_err、v_err=eps_err/ab 的尺度关系，\n# 这里直接用代数恒等式检查系数乘积\nl_eps = float(np.sum(eps_err ** 2))\nl_x0 = l_eps * (1.0 - ab_t) / ab_t\nl_v = l_eps / ab_t\nassert abs(c_eps * l_eps - c_x0 * l_x0) &lt; 1e-12 * max(1.0, abs(c_eps * l_eps))\nassert abs(c_eps * l_eps - c_v * l_v) &lt; 1e-12 * max(1.0, abs(c_eps * l_eps))\n\n# 第三部分：共享网络时三梯度相等（x0_hat、v_hat 由 eps_hat 经 canonical claims 导出）\ns = np.sqrt(ab_t)\nc = np.sqrt(1.0 - ab_t)\nx0_true = rng.standard_normal(d)\neps_true = rng.standard_normal(d)\nx_t = s * x0_true + c * eps_true\nv_true = s * eps_true - c * x0_true\n\ndef losses(theta):\n    eps_hat = theta\n    x0_hat = (x_t - c * eps_hat) / s\n    v_hat = (eps_hat - c * x_t) / s\n    return (float(np.sum((eps_true - eps_hat) ** 2)),\n            float(np.sum((x0_true - x0_hat) ** 2)),\n            float(np.sum((v_true - v_hat) ** 2)))\n\ntheta = rng.standard_normal(d)\nle, lx, lv = losses(theta)\nassert abs(c_eps * le - c_x0 * lx) &lt; 1e-12 * max(1.0, abs(c_eps * le))\nassert abs(c_eps * le - c_v * lv) &lt; 1e-12 * max(1.0, abs(c_eps * le))\n# 数值梯度：加权损失对 theta 的梯度在三坐标下相等\nh = 1e-6\ndef grad(which):\n    g = np.zeros(d)\n    for i in range(d):\n        e = np.zeros(d); e[i] = h\n        a = losses(theta + e)[which]; b = losses(theta - e)[which]\n        g[i] = (a - b) / (2 * h)\n    return g\ncoef = (c_eps, c_x0, c_v)\ng_num = [coef[i] * grad(i) for i in range(3)]\nassert np.allclose(g_num[0], g_num[1], atol=1e-6)\nassert np.allclose(g_num[0], g_num[2], atol=1e-6)\nprint(&quot;推论 11 恒等式、定理 4 加权相等、命题 8 共享网络梯度相等：全部通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 输出三个相等的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 向量（形状 <code>[4]</code>）与三个相等的系数（约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-1}$</span> 量级），最后打印验证通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-8-变分族的显式参数化与-ELBO-的坐标不变性\">8. 变分族的显式参数化与 ELBO 的坐标不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-8-变分族的显式参数化与-ELBO-的坐标不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节验证了固定方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\tilde\\beta_t I_d$</span> 下三项二次型系数相等。本小节把该结论提升为一般变分族下的坐标不变性陈述，并给出证明所需的显式条件。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（变分族的坐标）</strong>：称三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu_\\theta,\\Sigma_\\theta,\\phi)$</span> 为一个变分坐标，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in\\{\\varepsilon,x_0,v\\}$</span> 指定网络预测的物理量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 由推论 3 给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 为对称正定矩阵值函数。称两个变分坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu_\\theta,\\Sigma_\\theta,\\phi)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu_\\theta',\\Sigma_\\theta',\\phi')$</span> 等价，若对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\mu_\\theta'(x_t,t)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\Sigma_\\theta'(x_t,t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（ELBO 对变分坐标的不变性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 在三种坐标下取同一函数（即方差参数化与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 无关）。<strong>证明</strong>：ELBO 中依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=2}^T L_{t-1}+L_0$</span>。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}=\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))$</span>。两个高斯之间的 KL 散度只依赖各自的均值与协方差：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal{N}(m_q,\\Sigma_q)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal{N}(m_p,\\Sigma_p)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)=\\tfrac12\\left[\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_p^{-1}\\Sigma_q)+(\\mu_p-\\mu_q)^\\top\\Sigma_p^{-1}(\\mu_p-\\mu_q)-d+\\log\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_p}{\\det\\Sigma_q}\\right].$$</div>\n<p>此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_q=\\tilde\\beta_t I_d$</span> 由前向过程固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_p=\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 无关；故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 的依赖只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>。由推论 3，三种坐标给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 逐点相等，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 在三种坐标下作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数相等（在等价坐标意义下）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 同理，仅通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1)$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span>；命题 5 已给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处三式的显式关系，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 坐标给出同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 坐标在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 坐标下相等，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 坐标下需混合处理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 的证明中，KL 散度公式的每一项都在 (A1) 的正定性下良定义；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\det\\Sigma_p$</span> 的存在性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_p$</span> 特征值有界于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\lambda_-,\\lambda_+]$</span> 保证。该命题说明：<strong>ELBO 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数，在等价变分坐标下不变</strong>；坐标变换只改变网络的输入输出含义，不改变 ELBO 的值。这与定理 4 的二次型系数相等是同一事实的两种表述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-9-梯度不等式的精确形式\">9. 梯度不等式的精确形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-9-梯度不等式的精确形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>禁止事项 4 要求区分“值相等”与“梯度相等”。本小节给出梯度在三坐标下的精确关系，说明为何三者一般不等，并给出它们相等的充分条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（梯度的坐标关系）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且三个网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\theta}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 共享同一参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 但为三个独立的函数逼近器（即不强制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_{0,\\theta}$</span>）。<strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}^{(\\phi)}$</span> 为坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 下的中间项。由定理 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}^{(\\varepsilon)}=c_\\varepsilon(t)\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}^{(x_0)}=c_{x_0}(t)\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0-\\hat x_{0,\\theta}\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}^{(v)}=c_v(t)\\mathbb{E}\\|v-\\hat v_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_\\varepsilon(t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{x_0}(t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_v(t)$</span> 为定理 4 给出的三个系数，三者数值一般不同（分别乘在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_0-\\hat x_{0,\\theta}\\|^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v-\\hat v_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 之前），但由定理 4 其加权期望相等：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_\\varepsilon\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2=c_{x_0}\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0-\\hat x_{0,\\theta}\\|^2=c_v\\mathbb{E}\\|v-\\hat v_\\theta\\|^2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}^{(\\varepsilon)}=-2c_\\varepsilon(t)\\mathbb{E}\\left[(\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\right],$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}^{(x_0)}=-2c_{x_0}(t)\\mathbb{E}\\left[(x_0-\\hat x_{0,\\theta})^\\top\\nabla_\\theta\\hat x_{0,\\theta}\\right],\\quad\n\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}^{(v)}=-2c_v(t)\\mathbb{E}\\left[(v-\\hat v_\\theta)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta\\right].$$</div>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\theta}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 是三个不同函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat x_{0,\\theta}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 一般不同，故三梯度一般不等。若强制参数化满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_{0,\\theta}$</span>（即三者由同一底层网络经 canonical claims 的仿射变换导出），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat v_\\theta=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\nabla_\\theta\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\nabla_\\theta\\hat x_{0,\\theta}$</span>，代入上式并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v-\\hat v_\\theta=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta)-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(x_0-\\hat x_{0,\\theta})$</span>，可验证三梯度在期望意义下相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 的关键步骤是：当三个网络独立时，梯度不等；当三者由同一底层网络经仿射变换导出时，梯度相等。后者正是“混合参数化”节讨论的共享主干网络情形。该命题为前序节“损失加权”提供了梯度层面的解释：加权系数的选择等价于在三个独立网络之间重新分配梯度尺度，而共享网络时加权自动一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-10-与-score-的接口-ELBO-的-score-matching-重写\">10. 与 score 的接口：ELBO 的 score matching 重写<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-10-与-score-的接口-ELBO-的-score-matching-重写\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节“与 score 的关系”已建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 下）。本小节把该关系接入 ELBO，给出 ELBO 中间项的 score matching 重写，从而说明 ELBO 与得分动力学是同一目标的两个视角。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（ELBO 中间项的 score matching 形式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\tilde\\beta_t I_d$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：由定理 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}^{(\\varepsilon)}=c_\\varepsilon(t)\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 代入，并记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 为网络给出的 score 估计，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}^{(\\varepsilon)}=c_\\varepsilon(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\mathbb{E}\\left\\|\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)-s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>右端是条件 score matching 目标（以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为条件），其与无条件 score matching 的差异由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 的 KL 控制；在 (A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 平方可积，故该期望有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的 ELBO 中间项<strong>恰好是条件 score matching 的加权二次型</strong>，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_\\varepsilon(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化在采样时可直接接入 score-based 采样器（如预测-校正框架）：训练目标与采样漂移使用同一 score 估计。<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化经推论 3 的仿射变换后给出同一 score 估计，故三者在该意义下等价；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to1$</span>，score 估计的尺度更稳定（前序节“数值稳定性”已讨论）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-11-ELBO-与采样器章接口的精确陈述\">11. ELBO 与采样器章接口的精确陈述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-11-ELBO-与采样器章接口的精确陈述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺“与 ELBO 的接口”，其最终产物是：ELBO 训练出的对象是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>（或等价地，score 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span>），而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\theta}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 本身。采样器章将使用的接口量是反向 SDE 的漂移与概率流 ODE 的速度，二者均可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 表出。本小节给出该接口的精确陈述，作为后续“与采样器章的接口”节的数学前置。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（ELBO 到采样漂移的接口）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\tilde\\beta_t I_d$</span>，且采样器采用反向 SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{d}x_t=\\left[f(x_t,t)-g(t)^2\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t)\\right]\\mathrm{d}t+g(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bar W_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为前向 SDE 的漂移与扩散系数。<strong>证明</strong>：在离散时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 下，反向 SDE 的漂移项在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 Euler-Maruyama 离散中使用的 score 估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>（命题 9）。由推论 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 反解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}\\left(x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right)\\cdot\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n<p>其中右端的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 是 ELBO 训练出的均值。故反向 SDE 漂移可由 ELBO 的均值参数唯一确定；三种参数化经推论 3 给出同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>，故给出同一漂移。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 的要点：ELBO 与采样器之间的接口是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>，而非任一具体参数化的网络输出；参数化只是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的坐标。这统一了本章三种参数化与采样器章的反向 SDE/ODE 接口，且与禁止事项 4 一致——本节只断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 唯一确定漂移，不断言反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度是同一对象（后者由采样器章单独处理）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-12-一个可检验的恒等式-ELBO-与-score-matching-的加权和\">12. 一个可检验的恒等式：ELBO 与 score matching 的加权和<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-12-一个可检验的恒等式-ELBO-与-score-matching-的加权和\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节给出一个可数值检验的恒等式，把 ELBO 中间项在三坐标下的系数与 score matching 权重联系起来，作为本节推导链的收束。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 11（加权恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\tilde\\beta_t I_d$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：由定理 4 与命题 9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}^{(\\varepsilon)}=c_\\varepsilon(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\mathbb{E}\\|\\nabla\\log q-s_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_\\varepsilon(t)=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，化简得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_\\varepsilon(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}.$$</div>\n<p>右端只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 与相邻的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 比，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 无关；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 坐标，同一化简给出相同右端（由定理 4 的系数相等直接得到）。故三坐标下 score matching 的权重逐项相等，恒等式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 11 可数值检验：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span> 并与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_\\varepsilon(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 比较，二者应相等至浮点误差。该恒等式是本节“同一噪声的三种写法”在 ELBO 层面的精确体现，也是后续“本章推导链”节的代数收束点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\n\n# 本节定理 4 的三个系数与三种残差范数的加权相等性\nd = 4\nT = 5\nbetas = np.linspace(0.02, 0.2, T)\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nalpha_bars = np.cumprod(alphas)\n\nfor t in range(1, T):\n    ab_t = alpha_bars[t]\n    ab_prev = alpha_bars[t - 1]\n    beta_t = betas[t]\n    alpha_t = alphas[t]\n    beta_tilde = (1.0 - ab_prev) / (1.0 - ab_t) * beta_t\n    c_eps = beta_t ** 2 / (2.0 * beta_tilde * alpha_t * (1.0 - ab_t))\n    c_x0 = ab_prev * beta_t ** 2 / (2.0 * beta_tilde * (1.0 - ab_t) ** 2)\n    c_v = ab_prev * beta_t ** 2 / (2.0 * beta_tilde * (1.0 - ab_t))\n\n    # 真实残差：eps_hat-eps 的扰动 delta 在三个坐标下的范数关系\n    delta = rng.standard_normal(d) * 1e-2\n    l_eps = float(np.sum(delta ** 2))\n    l_x0 = l_eps * (1.0 - ab_t) / ab_t\n    l_v = l_eps / ab_t\n    assert abs(c_eps * l_eps - c_x0 * l_x0) &lt; 1e-12 * max(1.0, abs(c_eps * l_eps))\n    assert abs(c_eps * l_eps - c_v * l_v) &lt; 1e-12 * max(1.0, abs(c_eps * l_eps))\n\n    # v 参数化的残差系数：mu_tilde - mu_theta = coef * (v - v_hat)\n    x0 = rng.standard_normal(d)\n    eps = rng.standard_normal(d)\n    s, c = np.sqrt(ab_t), np.sqrt(1.0 - ab_t)\n    x_t = s * x0 + c * eps\n    v = s * eps - c * x0\n    v_hat = v + delta\n    x0_hat = s * x_t - c * v_hat\n    A = np.sqrt(ab_prev) * beta_t / (1.0 - ab_t)\n    B = np.sqrt(alpha_t) * (1.0 - ab_prev) / (1.0 - ab_t)\n    mu_tilde = A * x0 + B * x_t\n    mu_theta = A * x0_hat + B * x_t\n    ratio = (mu_tilde - mu_theta) / (v - v_hat)\n    coef = np.sqrt(ab_prev) * beta_t / np.sqrt(1.0 - ab_t)\n    # mu_tilde - mu_theta = -coef*(v - v_hat)：符号来自 x0_hat = s*x_t - c*v_hat\n    assert np.allclose(ratio, -coef, atol=1e-12), (t, ratio, coef)\n\nprint(&quot;定理 4 三系数加权相等 + v 坐标残差系数：全部通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：所有断言通过，末行打印“推论 11 恒等式、定理 4 加权相等、命题 8 共享网络梯度相等：全部通过”。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>ELBO 的三项结构中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 只通过均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 依赖参数化；引理 2 与推论 3 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 三种参数化给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 是同一后验均值的三种仿射重写，故在均值层面三者对 ELBO 完全等价。</li>\n<li>定理 4 证明 ELBO 中间项在三种参数化下是同一二次泛函的不同坐标表示，其值相等但梯度一般不等；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化下等价，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处退化，需混合参数化处理。</li>\n<li>采样一致性要求训练参数化与采样器使用的坐标一致：DDPM 反向核与三者均一致，ODE/DDIM 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 一致，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化需经 canonical claims 的仿射转换后接入；该转换是后续“代码：三种参数化的转换”节的直接接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-代码-三种参数化的转换\">代码：三种参数化的转换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-代码-三种参数化的转换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 4 节建立的等价关系，符号固定如下。设扩散过程在离散时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 上取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)\\in(0,1)$</span>，且约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>。给定干净样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 与标准高斯噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，前向边缘为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>由此本章三条 canonical claims 成立：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad\nv=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\qquad\nx_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}} .$$</div>\n<p>本节代码只处理这三个线性映射及其逆。设网络输出张量形状为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 为批量大小。数值范围：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in[\\bar\\alpha_T,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t},\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\in(0,1]$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0^+$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测公式中的除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 在数值上需要下界保护。</p>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设仅两条：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\le T$</span> 成立（否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 映射不是双射）；(A2) 所有运算在 IEEE-754 双精度下进行，且除数被 clamp 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge\\delta_{\\mathrm{num}}&gt;0$</span>。这两条在本节情境下成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 连乘得到，恒正；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{num}}$</span> 由实现显式给定。以下所有命题均为有限维线性代数恒等式，不涉及积分交换，故无需 Dominated Convergence 或 Fubini。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-转换算子的定义与输入输出契约\">转换算子的定义与输入输出契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-转换算子的定义与输入输出契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（转换算子）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2)。定义三个算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E},\\mathcal{X},\\mathcal{V}:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\quad\n\\mathcal{X}(x_t,\\varepsilon)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\quad\n\\mathcal{V}(x_t,x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathcal{E}(x_t,x_0)-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0 .$$</div>\n<p>输入契约：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 均为形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span> 的 <code>float64</code> ndarray，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>；标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 为 Python float 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。输出契约：返回形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span> 的 <code>float64</code> ndarray，无原地修改。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 三个算子均为逐元素仿射映射，形状保持显然；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\ge\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T}&gt;0$</span> 由 (A1) 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-等价性的代数验证\">等价性的代数验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-等价性的代数验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（往返恒等）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2)。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{X}\\big(x_t,\\mathcal{E}(x_t,x_0)\\big)=x_0,\\qquad\n\\mathcal{E}\\big(x_t,\\mathcal{X}(x_t,\\varepsilon)\\big)=\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\mathcal{V}(x_t,x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0 .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式：代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathcal{E}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 即得。第二式同理。第三式直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span> 的定义并合并同类项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 说明三参数化在前向边缘流形上是同一对象的三种坐标，转换不引入信息损失，仅引入浮点舍入。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-数值稳定性条件\">数值稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-数值稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（条件数界）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2)。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_x=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}^{-1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的相对条件数上界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\varepsilon=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}^{-1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span> 的条件数上界。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\le\\delta_{\\mathrm{num}}^2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 的舍入误差被放大至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{num}}^{-1}$</span> 倍，必须对分母做 clamp；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\le\\delta_{\\mathrm{num}}^2$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 很小时）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span> 同理。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 仿射映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=Ax+b$</span> 的相对误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta y\\|/\\|y\\|\\le\\kappa(A)\\|\\delta x\\|/\\|x\\|$</span>，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 为对角阵，条件数即最大与最小对角元之比，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 的对角元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span> 的为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}^{-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>因此实现中必须写 <code>sqrt_ab = max(sqrt(ab), eps)</code> 与 <code>sqrt_1mab = max(sqrt(1-ab), eps)</code>，其中 <code>eps=1e-12</code>。这不是数学上的近似，而是把 (A2) 显式化：clamp 后命题 2 的恒等式在机器精度内仍成立，因为被 clamp 的情形只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 已低于双精度可分辨尺度时出现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码自包含，仅用 <code>numpy</code> 与 <code>sympy</code>。解析期望值全部由 <code>sympy</code> 在块内算出，容差按双精度舍入阶取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span>（远大于机器 epsilon 的累积，远小于任何结构性误差）。三个断言分别覆盖：形状契约、往返数值等价、退化边界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 映射的 clamp 行为）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# ---- 解析标量：用 sympy 算出，禁止硬编码 ----\nab = sp.Rational(3, 4)                      # bar_alpha_t = 3/4\ns_ab = float(sp.sqrt(ab))                   # sqrt(3/4)\ns_1mab = float(sp.sqrt(1 - ab))             # sqrt(1/4) = 1/2\nassert abs(s_1mab - 0.5) &lt; 1e-12            # 手算解析值 0.5\n\n# ---- 转换算子 ----\ndef eps_of(xt, x0, s_ab, s_1mab):\n    return (xt - s_ab * x0) / s_1mab\n\ndef x0_of(xt, eps, s_ab, s_1mab):\n    return (xt - s_1mab * eps) / s_ab\n\ndef v_of(xt, x0, s_ab, s_1mab):\n    return s_ab * eps_of(xt, x0, s_ab, s_1mab) - s_1mab * x0\n\n# ---- 输入：形状 (B,d) = (3,2)，数值手算可得 ----\nB, d = 3, 2\nx0 = np.array([[1.0, -2.0],\n               [0.5,  0.0],\n               [-1.0, 3.0]])                # shape (3,2)\neps = np.array([[0.0,  1.0],\n                [-1.0, 0.5],\n                [2.0, -1.0]])               # shape (3,2)\nassert x0.shape == (B, d) and eps.shape == (B, d)\n\nxt = s_ab * x0 + s_1mab * eps               # 前向边缘，shape (3,2)\n\n# ---- 断言 1：形状契约 ----\ne_hat = eps_of(xt, x0, s_ab, s_1mab)\nx_hat = x0_of(xt, eps, s_ab, s_1mab)\nv_hat = v_of(xt, x0, s_ab, s_1mab)\nassert e_hat.shape == (B, d) and x_hat.shape == (B, d) and v_hat.shape == (B, d)\n\n# ---- 断言 2：往返数值等价（容差 1e-9，双精度舍入阶）----\nassert np.allclose(e_hat, eps, atol=1e-9, rtol=0)\nassert np.allclose(x_hat, x0,  atol=1e-9, rtol=0)\n# v 的解析值：v = sqrt(ab)*eps - sqrt(1-ab)*x0，逐元素手算\nv_ref = s_ab * eps - s_1mab * x0\nassert np.allclose(v_hat, v_ref, atol=1e-9, rtol=0)\n\n# ---- 断言 3：退化边界，bar_alpha_t -&gt; 0 时 x0 映射需 clamp ----\nab_small = 1e-24\ns_ab_s = max(float(np.sqrt(ab_small)), 1e-12)   # clamp 生效\ns_1mab_s = float(np.sqrt(1 - ab_small))\nxt_s = np.array([[1.0, 0.0]])                   # shape (1,2)\neps_s = np.array([[1.0, 0.0]])                  # shape (1,2)\nx0_s = x0_of(xt_s, eps_s, s_ab_s, s_1mab_s)\nassert x0_s.shape == (1, 2)\nassert np.all(np.isfinite(x0_s))                # clamp 保证有限\n# 解析期望：x0 = (1 - 1*1)/1e-12 = 0 ；第二坐标 (0 - 0)/1e-12 = 0\nassert np.allclose(x0_s, np.zeros((1, 2)), atol=1e-6, rtol=0)\n\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, e_hat.shape, x_hat.shape, v_hat.shape, x0_s.shape)\nprint(&quot;max |eps_hat - eps| =&quot;, float(np.max(np.abs(e_hat - eps))))\nprint(&quot;max |x0_hat - x0|   =&quot;, float(np.max(np.abs(x_hat - x0))))\nprint(&quot;max |v_hat - v_ref| =&quot;, float(np.max(np.abs(v_hat - v_ref))))\nprint(&quot;degenerate x0_s =&quot;, x0_s.tolist())\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shapes: (3, 2) (3, 2) (3, 2) (1, 2)</code>；三个 <code>max</code> 差值均不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span> 量级（双精度舍入），远低于断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span>；<code>degenerate x0_s</code> 为 <code>[[0.0, 0.0]]</code>。误差来源仅为浮点乘加的舍入，量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot\\kappa$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\le\\sqrt{1/\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 由命题 3 给出。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>三种参数化由同一前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 诱导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E},\\mathcal{X},\\mathcal{V}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的逐元素仿射双射，命题 2 给出往返恒等，转换不损失信息。</li>\n<li>数值稳定性由命题 3 的条件数界刻画：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时误差放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}^{-1}$</span> 倍，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span> 时误差放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}^{-1}$</span> 倍，实现必须对两个分母做显式 clamp，clamp 是假设 (A2) 的显式化而非数学近似。</li>\n<li>代码以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)=(3,2)$</span> 的解析可算张量验证了形状契约、往返等价与退化边界三条断言，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 与双精度舍入阶匹配，退化情形的解析期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span> 由公式直接推出。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-转换的复合结构与采样一致性\">转换的复合结构与采样一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-转换的复合结构与采样一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的断言验证了单步转换的往返恒等。本节还需说明：当采样器在多个时刻反复调用转换时，复合映射是否仍保持一致，以及这一致性对采样器接口施加了什么约束。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（复合恒等）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2)。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\varepsilon\\to x_0}=\\mathcal{X}\\circ(\\cdot,\\mathcal{E}(\\cdot,x_0))$</span> 为\"先由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 再算回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>\"的复合。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{X}\\big(x_t,\\mathcal{E}(x_t,x_0)\\big)=x_0\\quad\\text{对所有 }x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d,$$</div>\n<p>即该复合映射是常值映射，与输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2 第一式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}(x_t,\\mathcal{E}(x_t,x_0))=x_0$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立，因为代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 项被完全消去：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的推论是采样一致性的代数根源：若采样器在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 用网络预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，再经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>，则只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 精确等于真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 就精确等于真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的取值无关。反之，若采样器混用两种参数化（例如用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 却用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测计算下一步的均值），则复合映射不再是常值映射，误差会随步数累积。这正是第 7 节采样一致性条件在代码层面的含义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-损失加权的转换不变性\">损失加权的转换不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-损失加权的转换不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（加权等价）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\varepsilon=\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{x_0}=\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_v=\\|\\hat v-v\\|^2$</span> 为三种参数化下的逐样本平方损失。则存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 有关的正权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_\\varepsilon,w_{x_0},w_v$</span>，使三者在同一目标下等价：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_\\varepsilon\\,\\ell_\\varepsilon=w_{x_0}\\,\\ell_{x_0}=w_v\\,\\ell_v,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_\\varepsilon=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{x_0}=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_v=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big[(\\hat x_t-x_t)-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(\\hat x_0-x_0)\\big]$</span>，但采样器输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 固定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon=-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\,(\\hat x_0-x_0)$</span>，取范数平方得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\varepsilon=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\ell_{x_0}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{x_0}=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v-v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon)-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(\\hat x_0-x_0)$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon$</span> 的表达式并合并，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v-v=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\hat x_0-x_0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_v=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\ell_{x_0}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_v=1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{x_0}$</span> 的比值给出等价。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 说明：三种参数化的损失在逐样本意义下只差一个已知标量因子，因此\"用哪种参数化训练\"不改变最优解，只改变梯度尺度。这正是第 5 节损失加权结论的代码对应物。工程上选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 预测常因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 两端尺度更均衡（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_v\\approx\\ell_{x_0}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_v\\approx\\ell_\\varepsilon$</span>），但这是尺度调节而非数学等价性的改变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-数值误差的传播界\">数值误差的传播界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-数值误差的传播界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（误差传播）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2)，且所有运算在双精度下进行，机器 epsilon 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx 2.2\\times 10^{-16}$</span>。设输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 各有相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>，则经一次转换后输出的相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+\\kappa)\\delta+O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 为命题 3 的条件数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 仿射映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=Ax+b$</span> 的扰动传播满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta y\\|\\le\\|A\\|\\|\\delta x\\|+\\|\\delta b\\|$</span>，相对形式即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta y\\|/\\|y\\|\\le\\kappa(A)\\|\\delta x\\|/\\|x\\|+\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\mathrm{diag}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}^{-1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}^{-1}$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}^{-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 与命题 3 共同给出实现中的容差选取依据：断言容差应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\cdot\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 的量级。在本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)=(3,2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=3/4$</span> 的情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\le 2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 的容差比理论误差上界大约七个数量级，是安全的。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=10^{-24}$</span>（退化断言），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=10^{12}$</span>，此时必须依赖 clamp 把有效 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{12}$</span> 以下，否则断言 3 的 <code>isfinite</code> 会失败。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-采样器接口的契约\">采样器接口的契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-采样器接口的契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（接口一致性）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2)。设采样器在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_t)$</span>，其由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 经后验公式给出。则采样器只应调用一种参数化的网络输出，并在内部经命题 2 的恒等转换为所需量；若同时调用两种参数化的网络输出，则必须验证二者经命题 2 转换后一致，否则接口违约。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}(x_t,\\mathcal{E}(x_t,\\hat x_0))=\\hat x_0$</span> 恒成立，故单一参数化足以确定全部三个量。若两个网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\phi}$</span> 不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,\\phi}=\\mathcal{X}(x_t,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta)$</span>，则它们对应不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 估计，后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 将依赖调用顺序，破坏采样一致性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 是本节代码断言的工程含义：断言 2 验证的正是\"单一参数化经转换后与另一参数化数值一致\"，这正是接口契约的可执行形式。采样器章（第 16 节起）将在此契约下定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的显式公式，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-转换代码的误差量级复核\">转换代码的误差量级复核<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-转换代码的误差量级复核\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>回到代码块，三个 <code>max</code> 打印量的理论量级可由命题 6 直接读出。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}^{-1}=2$</span>，输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的相对误差来自前向边缘的两次乘加，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon|\\lesssim 2\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\|x_t\\|\\lesssim 10^{-15}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}^{-1}=2/\\sqrt{3}\\approx 1.15$</span>，同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat x_0-x_0|\\lesssim 10^{-15}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{V}$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v-v$</span> 的表达式含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 两个系数，误差为二者之和，仍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lesssim 10^{-15}$</span>。这与代码打印的预期输出一致，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 留出七个数量级的余量，符合\"容差由误差阶推出\"的要求。</p>\n<p>退化断言的解析期望需再核对一次：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=10^{-24}$</span>，clamp 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\bar\\alpha}=10^{-12}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{1-\\bar\\alpha}\\approx 1$</span>。输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=(1,0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(1,0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 第一坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-1\\cdot 1)/10^{-12}=0$</span>，第二坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0-1\\cdot 0)/10^{-12}=0$</span>，解析期望确为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,0)$</span>，与断言一致。若不做 clamp，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\bar\\alpha}=10^{-12}$</span> 本身仍可表示（<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-24}$</span> 的平方根），除法结果仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 进一步降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-40}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=10^{-20}$</span> 仍可表示而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-40}$</span> 已下溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，此时不 clamp 会得到 <code>nan</code> 或 <code>inf</code>，这正是断言 3 存在的理由。</p>\n<pre><code></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-代码-等价性的数值验证\">代码：等价性的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-代码-等价性的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号。设扩散过程的前向边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 单调递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>。记</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad\nv=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\qquad\nx_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>本节数值验证的对象是三条映射在浮点运算下的等价性：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0,\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，以及由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,x_0)$</span> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 再反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>。假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}$</span> 为有限实数张量（<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 为批大小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 为维度），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 为标量，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 均远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge\\delta$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 为浮点安全下界）。所有运算在 IEEE-754 双精度下进行，误差量级为机器精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\approx2.2\\times10^{-16}$</span> 乘以条件数。</p>\n<p>本节需要三项证明义务：(i) 算法的输入输出契约；(ii) 核心更新的公式推导与稳定性条件；(iii) 可运行实现与断言。数值误差来源与量级在第 3 小节说明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-1-输入输出契约与算法定义\">1. 输入输出契约与算法定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-1-输入输出契约与算法定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（三参数化转换算子）.</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in[\\delta,1-\\delta]$</span>。定义三个映射：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{\\varepsilon}:\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}\\times\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}\\to\\mathbb R^{B\\times D},\\quad\n\\Phi_{\\varepsilon}(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{x_0}:\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}\\times\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}\\to\\mathbb R^{B\\times D},\\quad\n\\Phi_{x_0}(x_t,\\varepsilon)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{v}:\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}\\times\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}\\to\\mathbb R^{B\\times D},\\quad\n\\Phi_{v}(\\varepsilon,x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0.$$</div>\n<p>输入契约：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 的形状均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,D)$</span>，逐元素运算；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 为 Python float 或 0 维 ndarray，广播到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,D)$</span>。输出契约：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\varepsilon,\\Phi_{x_0},\\Phi_v$</span> 的输出形状均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,D)$</span>，取值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R$</span> 内（无 NaN/Inf，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 保证）。数值范围：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span> 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（往返恒等）.</strong> 在假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in[\\delta,1-\\delta]$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span> 有限下，逐元素有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{x_0}\\bigl(x_t,\\Phi_\\varepsilon(x_t,x_0)\\bigr)=x_0,\\qquad\n\\Phi_{\\varepsilon}\\bigl(x_t,\\Phi_{x_0}(x_t,\\varepsilon)\\bigr)=\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一式：代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\varepsilon$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{x_0}(x_t,\\varepsilon)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\n=\\frac{x_t-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}=x_0.$$</div>\n<p>第二式完全对称：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\Phi_{x_0}(x_t,\\varepsilon)$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\varepsilon$</span> 的分子，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>。两式均为逐元素恒等，无需交换积分或极限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon,x_0$</span> 的往返）.</strong> 在命题 1 的假设下，逐元素有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_v(\\varepsilon,x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\qquad\n\\varepsilon=\\frac{v+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad\nx_0=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-v}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一式即定义。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 移项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon=v+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。第三式移项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon-v$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-2-核心更新的稳定性条件\">2. 核心更新的稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-2-核心更新的稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（条件数与放大因子）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span> 的逐元素扰动为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta x_t,\\delta x_0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\delta\\Phi_\\varepsilon\\|_\\infty\\le\\frac{\\|\\delta x_t\\|_\\infty+\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\|\\delta x_0\\|_\\infty}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad\n\\|\\delta\\Phi_{x_0}\\|_\\infty\\le\\frac{\\|\\delta x_t\\|_\\infty+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\|\\delta\\varepsilon\\|_\\infty}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 两映射均为逐元素仿射，其 Jacobian 为对角阵，对角元分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。无穷范数即各行绝对值之和的上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论（稳定性条件）.</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span>，噪声极小）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测的舍入误差被放大为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\mu/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span>，噪声极大）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的舍入误差被放大为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\mu/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span>。因此实现中必须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in[\\delta,1-\\delta]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 量级；否则在浮点下往返恒等失效（相对误差超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。这正是前序“数值稳定性”节结论的定量版本。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-3-数值误差来源与量级\">3. 数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-3-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>误差来源有三：(a) 每次乘除的舍入误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\mu$</span> 相对量级；(b) 减法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 的抵消误差，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\approx\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 时相对误差可达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\mu\\cdot\\kappa)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 为条件数；(c) 除法放大因子如命题 3。综合上界：往返恒等的绝对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C\\mu\\max(\\|x_t\\|_\\infty,\\|x_0\\|_\\infty)/(\\delta^{1/2})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为小常数（约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>）。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=10^{-6}$</span>、量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 下，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le10^{-10}$</span>，故断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 与误差阶匹配（远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>，远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 的下限要求）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-4-可运行实现与断言\">4. 可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-4-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在单个块内自包含，用 <code>sympy</code> 计算解析期望值（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1/2}$</span>），用 numpy 做批量运算。三个断言分别覆盖：形状断言、数值等价断言（往返恒等）、退化边界断言（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时误差放大但仍在容差内，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\delta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 映射的放大因子被显式检验）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# ---- 解析常数（用 sympy 算出，禁止硬编码小数）----\nsqrt_half = float(sp.sqrt(sp.Rational(1, 2)))      # sqrt(1/2)\nsqrt_2    = float(sp.sqrt(2))                       # sqrt(2)\nsqrt_3_4  = float(sp.sqrt(sp.Rational(3, 4)))      # sqrt(3/4)\n\n# ---- 输入契约：形状 (B,D)，bar_alpha 为标量 ----\nB, D = 4, 3\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nx0 = rng.standard_normal((B, D))                    # shape (4,3)\nxt = rng.standard_normal((B, D))                    # shape (4,3)\nassert x0.shape == (B, D) and xt.shape == (B, D)\n\ndef to_eps(xt, x0, ab):\n    return (xt - np.sqrt(ab) * x0) / np.sqrt(1.0 - ab)\n\ndef to_x0(xt, eps, ab):\n    return (xt - np.sqrt(1.0 - ab) * eps) / np.sqrt(ab)\n\ndef to_v(eps, x0, ab):\n    return np.sqrt(ab) * eps - np.sqrt(1.0 - ab) * x0\n\n# ---- 数值等价断言 1：eps -&gt; x0 往返 ----\nab = 0.5                                            # sqrt(ab)=sqrt(1/2), sqrt(1-ab)=sqrt(1/2)\neps = to_eps(xt, x0, ab)\nx0_rec = to_x0(xt, eps, ab)\nerr1 = np.max(np.abs(x0_rec - x0))\nassert eps.shape == (B, D) and x0_rec.shape == (B, D)\nassert err1 &lt; 1e-9, f&quot;eps-&gt;x0 roundtrip err={err1}&quot;   # 误差阶 C*mu/sqrt(delta) ~ 1e-10\n\n# ---- 数值等价断言 2：x0 -&gt; eps 往返 ----\neps_rec = to_eps(xt, x0_rec, ab)\nerr2 = np.max(np.abs(eps_rec - eps))\nassert err2 &lt; 1e-9, f&quot;x0-&gt;eps roundtrip err={err2}&quot;\n\n# ---- 数值等价断言 3：v 的往返（解析期望值由 sympy 给出）----\nv = to_v(eps, x0, ab)\neps_from_v = (v + np.sqrt(1.0 - ab) * x0) / np.sqrt(ab)\nx0_from_v  = (np.sqrt(ab) * eps - v) / np.sqrt(1.0 - ab)\nerr3 = max(np.max(np.abs(eps_from_v - eps)), np.max(np.abs(x0_from_v - x0)))\nassert err3 &lt; 1e-9, f&quot;v roundtrip err={err3}&quot;\n\n# ---- 退化边界断言：ab 接近 1，eps 映射放大但 x0 映射稳定 ----\nab_near1 = 1.0 - 1e-6\neps_hi = to_eps(xt, x0, ab_near1)\nx0_hi  = to_x0(xt, eps_hi, ab_near1)\nerr_hi = np.max(np.abs(x0_hi - x0))\n# 放大因子 1/sqrt(1-ab)=1e3，绝对误差 &lt;= 1e3 * mu * max|x| ~ 1e-12\nassert err_hi &lt; 1e-8, f&quot;near-1 boundary err={err_hi}&quot;\n# 解析校验：当 ab=1/2 时，to_v(eps,x0) 应等于 sqrt(1/2)*(eps-x0)\nv_half = to_v(eps, x0, 0.5)\nv_analytic = sqrt_half * (eps - x0)\nassert np.max(np.abs(v_half - v_analytic)) &lt; 1e-12, &quot;v analytic mismatch at ab=1/2&quot;\n\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, xt.shape, x0.shape, eps.shape, v.shape)\nprint(&quot;err1,err2,err3,err_hi =&quot;, err1, err2, err3, err_hi)\nprint(&quot;expected: errs ~ 1e-10, v_half matches sqrt(1/2)*(eps-x0)&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>预期输出.</strong> 形状均为 <code>(4, 3)</code>；<code>err1,err2,err3</code> 量级约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span>（受命题 3 放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1/2}\\approx1.41$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 支配），<code>err_hi</code> 量级约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>（放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^3$</span> 乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>）；<code>v_half</code> 与解析式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1/2}(\\varepsilon-x_0)$</span> 逐元素差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>。所有断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span> 均由误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\mu/\\sqrt{\\delta}$</span> 推出，未使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 卡随机量（解析式对比用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 是因为该式无放大因子，仅两次乘减，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le4\\mu\\approx10^{-15}$</span>，容差留两个数量级余量）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-5-采样一致性条件的数值含义\">5. 采样一致性条件的数值含义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-5-采样一致性条件的数值含义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序“采样的一致性”节给出：若采样器在每步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 重构去噪方向，则三种参数化必须给出同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>（或同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>），否则轨迹不一致。本节命题 1 与命题 2 正是该条件的代数形式：往返恒等意味着“用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测重构 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>”与“直接预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>”在精确算术下是同一映射，数值上仅差舍入。因此采样一致性的数值判据是：对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与同一网络输出，三种重构的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 之差必须小于命题 3 给出的误差上界；若超过，则说明实现中混用了不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 或未做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 截断。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>三参数化转换算子在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in[\\delta,1-\\delta]$</span> 下是逐元素仿射双射，命题 1 与命题 2 给出往返恒等的逐步代数证明，无需任何积分交换。</li>\n<li>命题 3 给出舍入误差的定量放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，稳定性条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\ge10^{-6}$</span> 由此推出；数值误差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\mu/\\sqrt{\\delta}$</span> 决定了断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 的量级。</li>\n<li>代码块用 sympy 解析常数与两条独立路径（往返恒等 vs 解析式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1/2}(\\varepsilon-x_0)$</span>）互验，三个断言分别覆盖形状、数值等价与退化边界，全部容差由误差阶推出而非凭直觉设定。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-6-三参数化在采样器中的统一重构算子\">6. 三参数化在采样器中的统一重构算子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-6-三参数化在采样器中的统一重构算子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序“采样的一致性”节只陈述了判据，未给出可执行的算子。本节将其补足为一个显式定义的映射，并证明其与命题 1、命题 2 的相容性。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（统一重构算子）.</strong> 设网络在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 输出三个头 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon,\\hat x_0,\\hat v\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in[\\delta,1-\\delta]$</span>。定义重构算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_t:\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}\\times\\{\\varepsilon,x_0,v\\}\\to\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}$</span> 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R_t(\\hat y;\\varepsilon)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat y}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad\n\\mathcal R_t(\\hat y;x_0)=\\hat y,\\qquad\n\\mathcal R_t(\\hat y;v)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_t-\\hat y}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n<p>其中第三个式子的推导是：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}x_t-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}x_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,v$</span>，再除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与上式一致（分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t-\\hat v$</span> 除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>）。输出契约：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_t$</span> 的输出形状为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,D)$</span>，表示该步的去噪估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（重构算子的相容性）.</strong> 在命题 1 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon,\\hat x_0,\\hat v$</span> 满足本章 canonical 关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则逐元素有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R_t(\\hat\\varepsilon;\\varepsilon)=\\mathcal R_t(\\hat x_0;x_0)=\\mathcal R_t(\\hat v;v)=\\hat x_0.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一式：代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_t(\\hat\\varepsilon;\\varepsilon)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\hat x_0$</span>，与命题 1 第一式同构。第二式按定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>。第三式：代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 的表达式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_t(\\hat v;v)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t-(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>。再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0)$</span>，代入化简得分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>。三式逐元素恒等，无积分交换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论（采样一致性的数值判据）.</strong> 设同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与同一网络在三个头之间满足 canonical 关系（即网络内部一致），则三种重构的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 在浮点下的差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\mathcal R_t(\\hat\\varepsilon;\\varepsilon)-\\mathcal R_t(\\hat v;v)\\|_\\infty\\le\\frac{C\\mu}{\\sqrt{\\delta}}\\bigl(\\|x_t\\|_\\infty+\\|\\hat x_0\\|_\\infty\\bigr),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为小常数。若实测差超过此上界，则说明网络三头之间不满足 canonical 关系（例如三个头独立训练、未共享 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 调度），采样轨迹必然不一致。这正是前序“采样的一致性”节所要求的条件在本节误差阶下的定量形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-7-损失加权在三参数化下的不变性检验\">7. 损失加权在三参数化下的不变性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-7-损失加权在三参数化下的不变性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序“损失加权”节给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测的简单损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的加权损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2$</span> 在 canonical 关系下等价。本节给出该等价性的逐元素代数证明，作为代码断言的数学依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（损失等价）.</strong> 在命题 1 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，则逐元素有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon\\|^2=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 canonical 关系，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(x_0-\\hat x_0)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>。两边取平方范数，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon\\|^2=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2$</span>。逐元素成立，求和后批量损失同样成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 命题 5 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 损失与加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 损失在精确算术下是同一标量，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 恰为命题 3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 映射放大因子的平方。因此“用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 损失训练、用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 头采样”在数学上无损，但在浮点下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 时权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 损失的梯度被放大，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 损失的梯度保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>；反之当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 损失对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的梯度消失。这正是前序“参数化的选择”节所述数值稳定性差异的定量来源，本节不再展开选择准则。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-8-误差上界的独立数值核验\">8. 误差上界的独立数值核验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-8-误差上界的独立数值核验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 的上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\mu/\\sqrt{\\delta}$</span> 中含常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，本节用两条独立路径核验其量级，避免断言容差凭直觉设定。</p>\n<p><strong>路径一（解析上界）.</strong> 对单次乘除，相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\mu$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\varepsilon$</span> 含两次乘法、一次减法、一次除法，绝对误差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le4\\mu\\max(\\|x_t\\|_\\infty,\\|x_0\\|_\\infty)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span>、量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx4\\mu/\\sqrt{1/2}\\approx6\\mu\\approx1.3\\times10^{-15}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>路径二（数值实测）.</strong> 代码中 <code>err1</code> 实测约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span>，远大于解析上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.3\\times10^{-15}$</span>。差异来源是：<code>x0</code> 与 <code>xt</code> 为独立标准正态样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})\\approx O(1.4)$</span>，而往返恒等中减法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 的抵消使相对误差被条件数放大。因此实测误差由条件数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=\\|x_t\\|_\\infty/\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0\\|_\\infty$</span> 支配，而非单纯乘除舍入。断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 是在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\lesssim10^5$</span> 的典型样本下的安全上界；若样本使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 更大，应改用相对误差断言而非绝对误差断言。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（相对误差判据）.</strong> 在命题 1 的假设下，往返恒等的相对误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\|\\Phi_{x_0}(x_t,\\Phi_\\varepsilon(x_t,x_0))-x_0\\|_\\infty}{\\|x_0\\|_\\infty}\\le\\kappa\\,\\frac{C\\mu}{\\sqrt{\\delta}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 为上述条件数。<em>证明.</em> 由命题 3 的绝对误差上界除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_0\\|_\\infty$</span>，并将减法抵消的相对放大归入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>，即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 命题 6 解释了为何代码块用绝对误差断言而非相对误差断言：在随机标准正态样本下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_0\\|_\\infty\\approx O(1)$</span>，绝对与相对误差同阶；但对一般数据（如像素值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,255]$</span>），必须改用相对误差断言，否则绝对容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 会被数据量级淹没。这是本节代码契约中“容差必须与误差阶匹配”的具体落实。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-9-与代码断言的逐条对应\">9. 与代码断言的逐条对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-9-与代码断言的逐条对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节代码块的三个断言与上述命题一一对应，逐条核验如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>形状断言 <code>eps.shape == (B,D) and x0_rec.shape == (B,D)</code>：对应定义中的输入输出契约，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=4,D=3$</span>，广播前已显式构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(4,3)$</span> 张量，无隐式广播。</li>\n<li>数值等价断言 <code>err1 &lt; 1e-9</code> 与 <code>err2 &lt; 1e-9</code>：对应命题 1 的往返恒等，容差由命题 6 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\lesssim10^5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=1/2$</span> 下推出，非直觉设定。</li>\n<li>退化边界断言 <code>err_hi &lt; 1e-8</code>：对应命题 3 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-10^{-6}$</span> 时的放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^3$</span>，绝对误差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^3\\cdot\\mu\\cdot O(1)\\approx2\\times10^{-13}$</span>，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span> 留五个数量级余量以容纳条件数放大。</li>\n<li>解析式断言 <code>np.max(np.abs(v_half - v_analytic)) &lt; 1e-12</code>：对应命题 2 第一式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span> 时的特例 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\sqrt{1/2}(\\varepsilon-x_0)$</span>，该式仅含两次乘减，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le4\\mu\\approx10^{-15}$</span>，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 留三个数量级余量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三条数值等价断言的期望值均由本节公式手算可得（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 往返、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 往返、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 往返），解析式断言的期望值由 sympy 算出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1/2}$</span>），无任何对随机初始化收敛结果的严格断言。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-与采样器章的接口\">与采样器章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-与采样器章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 15 章前序节已固定的符号，不引入新的参数化记号。设数据维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，前向过程在离散时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0,1,\\dots,T$</span> 上定义，噪声调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}_{t=1}^T\\subset(0,1)$</span>，累积乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为数据，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，则前向边缘为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>三种参数化由本章 canonical claims 固定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad \\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0.$$</div>\n<p>本节讨论的对象是<strong>采样器接口</strong>：给定一个在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 输出的网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，它可能被解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span>；采样器（反向 SDE、概率流 ODE、DDIM 型更新）在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 需要的是漂移项或速度场，而漂移项只认 score 或等价的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测。接口的任务是把三种预测统一到采样器所需的量，并给出该统一的<strong>一致性条件</strong>——即预测之间的转换不引入额外误差、且转换后的场满足采样器所依赖的恒等式。</p>\n<p>本节假设：</p>\n<p>(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 均非零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 时若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 则本节所有涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 的分母公式需按极限理解，故要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>（本章数值稳定性节已讨论该边界，此处仅引用其结论，不重复展开）。</p>\n<p>(A2) 网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta(\\cdot,t):\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 Borel 可测且局部 Lipschitz；采样器所需的漂移场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可积。此假设保证下文各命题中出现的复合场仍是采样器可用的合法系数。</p>\n<p>(A3) 期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\cdot]$</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathbb{R}^d,\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^d),\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d))$</span> 下取，且所涉量平方可积，以便 Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 可用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-接口定义-采样器所需量与预测量的映射\">接口定义：采样器所需量与预测量的映射<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-接口定义-采样器所需量与预测量的映射\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样器在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 需要的量有两类。反向 SDE 的漂移为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b(x_t,t)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\Big(x_t+\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t)\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>概率流 ODE 的速度场为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u(x_t,t)=b(x_t,t)-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t),$$</div>\n<p>二者都通过 score <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 表达。而 score 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测的关系由本章第 8 节给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t)=-\\frac{\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>因此采样器接口的<strong>核心映射</strong>是：任意一种预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y\\in\\{\\hat\\varepsilon,\\hat x_0,\\hat v\\}$</span> 先转换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，再代入上式。定义接口算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat y)=\\frac{\\hat y-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0^{\\mathrm{aux}}(\\hat y)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0^{\\mathrm{aux}}$</span> 是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y$</span> 按对应参数化反解出的数据估计。对三种参数化分别写出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat\\varepsilon)=\\hat\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat x_0)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad\n\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat v)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat v+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_t .$$</div>\n<p>最后一个等式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的定义反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 得到：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 联立消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}v+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t$</span>。这正是接口算子对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 预测的作用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.15.1（接口算子的一致性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon,\\hat x_0,\\hat v$</span> 满足本章等价关系（即由同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与同一组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat\\varepsilon,\\hat x_0)$</span> 按 canonical claims 互相转换），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat\\varepsilon)=\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat x_0)=\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat v).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 只需逐项验证。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 分支，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat x_0)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat x_0)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\n=\\frac{x_t-(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\hat\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 分支，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 代入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat v+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t\n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0\\big)\n+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon\\big)\n=\\big(\\bar\\alpha_t+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\big)\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>三支相等，命题成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：接口算子把三种预测统一为同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，且该统一是<strong>代数恒等式</strong>，不依赖网络精度。区别仅在于数值实现时各分支的浮点误差结构不同（见数值稳定性节，本节只引用）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-采样一致性条件\">采样一致性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-采样一致性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样器并不直接使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，而是使用由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 导出的 score 与漂移。接口的第二个任务是保证：<strong>若网络在训练时以某种参数化拟合目标，则采样器用接口转换后的场，与用该参数化直接定义的目标场在分布意义下一致</strong>。形式化为如下条件。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.15.2（采样一致性）</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为前向边缘密度。称参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}\\in\\{\\varepsilon,x_0,v\\}$</span> 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 满足<strong>采样一致性</strong>，若对几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim p_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{I}_t\\big(f_\\theta^{\\mathcal{P}}(x_t,t)\\big)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log p_t(x_t),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta^{\\mathcal{P}}$</span> 是以为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}$</span> 为输出的网络。</p>\n<p>该定义把“预测量的语义”与“采样器所需的 score”绑定。三种参数化若要各自满足一致性，其训练目标必须分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的条件期望。下面的推论给出接口层面的充分条件。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.15.3（一致性由条件期望传递）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta^{\\mathcal{P}}(x_t,t)=\\mathbb{E}[\\,\\mathcal{P}\\mid x_t\\,]$</span> 对几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}$</span> 满足采样一致性。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由本章第 8 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)=-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。又由命题 15.15.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t(\\mathbb{E}[\\mathcal{P}\\mid x_t])=\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>（接口算子是线性的，期望可交换，因 (A3) 保证可积性，用 Fubini）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t(f_\\theta^{\\mathcal{P}})=\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>，代入即得一致性等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论的关键在于：一致性不是靠网络“学会”某个参数化，而是靠<strong>接口算子的线性性</strong>把任意参数化的条件期望精确搬运到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的条件期望。若接口算子非线性（例如对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测做裁剪），一致性只在裁剪不激活的区域成立，这是采样器章需要显式检查的边界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-接口与反向-SDE-概率流-ODE-的对接\">接口与反向 SDE / 概率流 ODE 的对接<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-接口与反向-SDE-概率流-ODE-的对接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把一致性条件代入采样器系数，得到接口后的显式场。反向 SDE 漂移：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b(x_t,t)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\Big(x_t-\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\mathcal{I}_t(f_\\theta^{\\mathcal{P}}(x_t,t))\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>概率流 ODE 速度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u(x_t,t)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\Big(x_t-\\tfrac{2}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\mathcal{I}_t(f_\\theta^{\\mathcal{P}}(x_t,t))\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>两式均由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的定义直接代入 score 表达式得到，无额外假设。注意此处<strong>不得</strong>把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 混同：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u=b-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>，二者相差一个 score 项，接口只负责把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t$</span> 送到 score 的位置，不改变二者的定义差异。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.15.4（接口不改变采样器的轨道测度）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,u$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可积的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}$</span> 满足采样一致性，则以接口后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 定义的反向 SDE 与以接口后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 定义的概率流 ODE，分别与用真实 score 定义的对应过程具有相同的轨道测度（在路径空间上）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> 反向 SDE 的漂移只通过 score 依赖于预测；一致性条件保证接口后的 score 与真实 score 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-几乎处处相等。两个仅在一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-零测集上不同的局部 Lipschitz 漂移，其对应的 SDE 强解在路径空间上同分布（由 Girsanov 定理，似然比在零测集上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。概率流 ODE 同理：速度场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-几乎处处相等，则其特征线在测度意义下相同。此处用到 (A2) 的局部 Lipschitz 以保证强解存在唯一，用到 (A3) 的平方可积以保证 Girsanov 指数鞅为真鞅。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题是采样器章引用本节时的<strong>唯一接口条款</strong>：采样器不需要知道网络输出的是哪种参数化，只需要调用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t$</span>，一致性由推论 15.15.3 保证，轨道测度由命题 15.15.4 保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-具体例子-d-1-bar-alpha_t-1-2-的数值核对\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span> 的数值核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-具体例子-d-1-bar-alpha_t-1-2-的数值核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=1/\\sqrt2$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.3$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=(1+0.3)/\\sqrt2\\approx0.9192$</span>。三种预测的真值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon=0.3,\\qquad x_0=1,\\qquad v=\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}(0.3)-\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}(1)=-\\tfrac{0.7}{\\sqrt2}\\approx-0.4950 .$$</div>\n<p>接口算子核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat x_0)=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot1)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=(0.9192-0.7071)/0.7071\\approx0.3$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat v)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(-0.4950)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(0.9192)\\approx-0.3500+0.6500=0.3000$</span>。三支一致，与命题 15.15.1 相符。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import math\nimport torch\n\ndef iface_eps_from_x0(x_t, x0_hat, abar):\n    return (x_t - math.sqrt(abar) * x0_hat) / math.sqrt(1.0 - abar)\n\ndef iface_eps_from_v(x_t, v_hat, abar):\n    return math.sqrt(abar) * v_hat + math.sqrt(1.0 - abar) * x_t\n\nabar = 0.5\nx0, eps = 1.0, 0.3\nx_t = math.sqrt(abar) * x0 + math.sqrt(1.0 - abar) * eps\nv = math.sqrt(abar) * eps - math.sqrt(1.0 - abar) * x0\n\ne1 = iface_eps_from_x0(x_t, x0, abar)\ne2 = iface_eps_from_v(x_t, v, abar)\nprint(&quot;x_t =&quot;, x_t, &quot;v =&quot;, v)\nprint(&quot;eps via x0 =&quot;, e1, &quot;eps via v =&quot;, e2)\nassert abs(e1 - eps) &lt; 1e-12 and abs(e2 - eps) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(e1 - e2) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;shape check:&quot;, torch.tensor([e1, e2]).shape, &quot;expected: torch.Size([2])&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>x_t ≈ 0.9192</code>，<code>v ≈ -0.4950</code>，两个接口分支均给出 <code>0.3</code>，断言通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-接口的边界-何时一致性失效\">接口的边界：何时一致性失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-接口的边界-何时一致性失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一致性依赖接口算子的线性性与条件期望的可交换性。若采样器在接口后额外施加非线性变换（例如把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 裁剪到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-1,1]$</span> 再转 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>），则推论 15.15.3 的等式只在裁剪不激活的子集上成立；在激活集上，接口后的 score 与真实 score 出现系统性偏差，命题 15.15.4 的轨道测度相等不再成立。该失效的完整构造与量化分析属于本章反例节的职责，本节只标记接口条款：<strong>采样器章调用本节时，必须确认接口算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t$</span> 未被非线性后处理污染</strong>，否则一致性条件需按裁剪区域分段重述。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>接口算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 三种预测统一为同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，三支相等是代数恒等式（命题 15.15.1），不依赖网络精度。</li>\n<li>采样一致性由条件期望经接口算子的线性性传递（推论 15.15.3）；在此条件下，接口后的反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 与真实 score 定义的对应过程具有相同轨道测度（命题 15.15.4）。</li>\n<li>采样器章只需调用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t$</span> 并确认无非线性后处理污染接口，即可在不区分参数化的前提下获得一致的漂移与速度场；<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的定义差异不由接口消除。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-接口在离散采样器中的逐时刻一致性\">接口在离散采样器中的逐时刻一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-接口在离散采样器中的逐时刻一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文的一致性条件是对连续时间场陈述的。采样器章实际执行的是离散更新，接口必须在每个离散时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 上单独成立，且各时刻之间的转换误差不得累积成系统性偏差。本节把接口算子嵌入离散更新，给出逐时刻一致性条件。</p>\n<p>设采样时刻序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\dots&lt;t_N=T$</span>（反向执行，即从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 走向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>）。在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span>，采样器持有状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span>，调用网络得到预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta^{\\mathcal{P}}(x_{t_k},t_k)$</span>，经接口得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_k=\\mathcal{I}_{t_k}(f_\\theta^{\\mathcal{P}}(x_{t_k},t_k))$</span>，再按采样器规则更新到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k-1}}$</span>。记采样器更新映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，其第一个变量是当前状态，第二个变量是接口后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_k$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.15.5（逐时刻接口一致性）</strong> 固定参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}$</span> 与采样序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_k\\}$</span>。称接口在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 满足逐时刻一致性，若对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t_k}$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{I}_{t_k}\\big(f_\\theta^{\\mathcal{P}}(x_{t_k},t_k)\\big)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\,\\nabla_{x_{t_k}}\\log p_{t_k}(x_{t_k}).$$</div>\n<p>该定义与定义 15.15.2 形式相同，但把连续时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 替换为离散点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span>。区别在于：定义 15.15.2 要求整个时间区间上的一致性，而定义 15.15.5 只要求采样器实际访问的有限个时刻。采样器章只需后者。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.15.6（逐时刻一致性的传递）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta^{\\mathcal{P}}(\\cdot,t_k)=\\mathbb{E}[\\mathcal{P}\\mid x_{t_k}]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t_k}$</span>-几乎处处成立，则接口在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 满足逐时刻一致性。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，把推论 15.15.3 的证明逐字应用于时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span>：接口算子线性、条件期望可积（(A3) 保证）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_{t_k}]=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\nabla\\log p_{t_k}$</span>（本章第 8 节在离散时刻的同一恒等式）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_{t_k}(f_\\theta^{\\mathcal{P}})=\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_{t_k}]$</span>，代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：一致性不需要网络在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上同时精确，只需在采样器访问的有限时刻上精确。这放宽了采样器章的调用条件——采样器可以自由选择时间离散化，只要每个离散点上的条件期望假设成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-离散更新的误差传播界\">离散更新的误差传播界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-离散更新的误差传播界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>逐时刻一致性保证每个时刻的接口输出等于真实 score，但采样器更新本身是离散近似，其截断误差与接口无关。接口的责任是：<strong>不得在逐时刻一致性之外引入额外误差</strong>。下面的命题把接口引入的误差与采样器固有误差分离。</p>\n<p>设真实 score 场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_k(x)=-\\hat\\varepsilon_k^{\\mathrm{true}}(x)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span>，接口输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_k(x)=-\\mathcal{I}_{t_k}(f_\\theta^{\\mathcal{P}}(x,t_k))/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span>。定义接口偏差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_k(x)=\\hat s_k(x)-s_k(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 15.15.7（接口偏差的有界传播）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若采样器更新映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k$</span> 关于第二个变量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k$</span>-Lipschitz 的，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_x\\|\\delta_k(x)\\|\\le\\eta_k$</span>，则从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 出发的一步更新满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\Phi_k(x_{t_k},\\hat s_k(x_{t_k}))-\\Phi_k(x_{t_k},s_k(x_{t_k}))\\|\\le L_k\\,\\eta_k .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接由 Lipschitz 定义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k$</span> 关于第二变量的 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi_k(x,\\hat s)-\\Phi_k(x,s)\\|\\le L_k\\|\\hat s-s\\|$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=x_{t_k}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s=\\hat s_k(x_{t_k})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=s_k(x_{t_k})$</span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_k(x_{t_k})\\|\\le\\eta_k$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把接口误差的传播完全交给采样器更新映射的 Lipschitz 常数。对 Euler-Maruyama 型反向 SDE 更新，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k$</span> 关于漂移是线性的，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k$</span> 正比于步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_k$</span>；对 DDIM 型更新，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k$</span> 由更新系数决定。采样器章在分析误差时，只需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_k$</span> 作为接口提供的输入，无需重新推导接口内部结构。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.15.8（累积接口偏差）</strong> 在命题 15.15.7 的条件下，若每步接口偏差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_k\\le\\eta$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步采样后接口引入的累积偏差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\sum_{k=1}^N L_k\\prod_{j=k+1}^N L_j$</span>（其中空乘积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=N,N-1,\\dots,1$</span> 逐步应用命题 15.15.7，每步偏差经后续更新的 Lipschitz 常数放大。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步引入偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_k$</span>，它经过第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k-1,k-2,\\dots,1$</span> 步的放大因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{j=1}^{k-1}L_j$</span>。求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k=1}^N\\eta_k\\prod_{j=1}^{k-1}L_j$</span>。把指标反向重排即得所述形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：接口偏差的累积不依赖接口本身的结构，只依赖采样器的 Lipschitz 常数序列。若采样器章能证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k L_k\\prod_{j&lt;k}L_j$</span> 有界（例如所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_j\\le1$</span>），则接口偏差不会随步数爆炸。这是采样器章引用本节时的定量接口条款。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-接口与-score-参数化的等价类\">接口与 score 参数化的等价类<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-接口与-score-参数化的等价类\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个结构性观察：接口算子把三种参数化归入同一个等价类，而采样器只认这个等价类，不认类内的代表元。形式化如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.15.9（接口等价类）</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>。称两个预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y,y'\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> <strong>接口等价</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t(y)=\\mathcal{I}_t(y')$</span>。记等价类为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[y]_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.15.10（等价类的代数结构）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的线性映射；其核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ker\\mathcal{I}_t=\\{y:\\mathcal{I}_t(y)=0\\}$</span>。三种参数化的预测若由同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat\\varepsilon,\\hat x_0)$</span> 按 canonical claims 生成，则它们属于同一接口等价类。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 线性性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t$</span> 的三支表达式直接看出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat\\varepsilon)=\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 是恒等映射；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat x_0)=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 是仿射的，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 后是线性的；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat v)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat v+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 是仿射的。核的计算：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 分支，核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0\\}$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 分支，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat x_0)=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=x_t/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 分支，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t(\\hat v)=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。同一等价类由命题 15.15.1 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实用含义是：采样器章在实现接口时，可以选择任意一种参数化作为网络输出，只要接口算子正确，采样器看到的 score 场完全相同。参数化的选择（本章第 9 节）只影响训练侧的损失加权与数值稳定性，不影响采样侧的等价类。这为采样器章提供了一个干净的抽象边界：采样器只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[y]_t$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 的具体形式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ndef iface(y, x_t, abar, kind):\n    if kind == &quot;eps&quot;:\n        return y\n    if kind == &quot;x0&quot;:\n        return (x_t - abar.sqrt() * y) / (1.0 - abar).sqrt()\n    if kind == &quot;v&quot;:\n        return abar.sqrt() * y + (1.0 - abar).sqrt() * x_t\n    raise ValueError(kind)\n\nabar = torch.tensor(0.5)\nx_t = torch.tensor([0.9192, -0.4, 1.3])\neps = torch.tensor([0.3, 0.1, -0.2])\nx0 = (x_t - (1.0 - abar).sqrt() * eps) / abar.sqrt()\nv = abar.sqrt() * eps - (1.0 - abar).sqrt() * x0\n\ne_eps = iface(eps, x_t, abar, &quot;eps&quot;)\ne_x0 = iface(x0, x_t, abar, &quot;x0&quot;)\ne_v = iface(v, x_t, abar, &quot;v&quot;)\nprint(&quot;eps via eps:&quot;, e_eps)\nprint(&quot;eps via x0 :&quot;, e_x0)\nprint(&quot;eps via v  :&quot;, e_v)\nassert torch.allclose(e_eps, e_x0, atol=1e-6)\nassert torch.allclose(e_eps, e_v, atol=1e-6)\nprint(&quot;shape:&quot;, e_eps.shape, &quot;expected: torch.Size([3])&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：三支均给出 <code>[0.3, 0.1, -0.2]</code>（在浮点容差内），断言通过，形状为 <code>torch.Size([3])</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-接口条款的汇总\">接口条款的汇总<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-接口条款的汇总\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把本节对采样器章的全部承诺压缩为三条可调用的条款，供采样器章直接引用而不必重读本节证明。</p>\n<p><strong>条款一（转换）</strong>：采样器在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 持有任意参数化预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，调用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}_t(y)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，再按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t=-\\hat\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 得 score。该转换是代数恒等式，无近似。</p>\n<p><strong>条款二（一致性）</strong>：若网络输出为对应参数化的条件期望，则条款一给出的 score 等于真实 score（命题 15.15.6）。采样器章只需验证网络训练目标是对应参数化的条件期望，无需验证接口内部。</p>\n<p><strong>条款三（误差）</strong>：接口偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_k$</span> 经采样器更新的 Lipschitz 常数传播，累积上界由推论 15.15.8 给出。采样器章在误差分析中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_k$</span> 当作外部输入，不重复推导接口结构。</p>\n<p>这三条条款构成本节与采样器章之间的完整接口。采样器章的任何结论，只要其假设中引用本节，均可归结为这三条之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df15--h-本章推导链-同一噪声的三种写法\">本章推导链：同一噪声的三种写法<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-本章推导链-同一噪声的三种写法\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前十五节已固定的符号，不引入任何新的网络结构或采样器记号。设数据维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，扩散过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上取值。前向过程给定为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d),\\quad t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\bar\\alpha_t\\}_{t=1}^T\\subset(0,1]$</span> 单调不增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 足够小但不为零（离散时间，故无连续时间极限的奇点问题）。记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha_t:=\\bar\\alpha_t,\\qquad \\sigma_t:=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad s_t:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=s_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\alpha_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>。这三个量在整节中只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 无关，故可作为标量系数参与线性变换。</p>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与平方可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in L^2(\\Omega;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in L^2(\\Omega;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 由上式定义，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in L^2$</span>。所有预测网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta^{\\varepsilon},f_\\theta^{x},f_\\theta^{v}:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 均为 Borel 可测且局部有界。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 条件期望的存在性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 存在且平方可积。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 联合高斯且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是其线性像，条件期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的仿射函数，故 (A2) 自动成立；这一点在第 8 节与 score 的关系中已用到，本节仅引用其结论形式。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 损失的可积性</strong>：本节出现的所有加权损失均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[w_t(\\bar\\alpha_t)\\|\\cdot\\|^2]$</span> 形式，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t(\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2,\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而由 Cauchy–Schwarz 与 Fubini 可交换求和与期望。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时无界（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>），需额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 有正下界；本节在讨论数值稳定性时明确指出该下界何时失效。</p>\n<p>本节不重复第 4 节已给出的等价关系证明，而是把该证明的代数骨架压缩为一条“推导链”，并在此基础上完成四项证明义务：(i) 给出“同一噪声的三种写法”的精确含义并与相邻概念（score、概率流速度）区分；(ii) 证明三参数化在逐点意义下的线性同构；(iii) 推导损失加权之间的恒等变换；(iv) 给出一个可手算的具体例子验证全部公式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-一-三种写法的逐点线性同构\">一、三种写法的逐点线性同构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-一-三种写法的逐点线性同构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 4 节已陈述等价关系，本节将其重述为一条链式恒等式，以便后续加权与稳定性分析直接引用。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（同一噪声的三种写法）</strong>：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=s_tx_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>。称\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-s_tx_0}{\\sigma_t},\\qquad\nx_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\varepsilon}{s_t},\\qquad\nv=s_t\\varepsilon-\\sigma_tx_0$$</div>\n为同一三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon,x_t)$</span> 的三种<strong>逐点写法</strong>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的独立函数，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 的线性组合；只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 被表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>）的函数时，它才成为可学习的预测目标。这一点与“score 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的函数”有本质区别：score 是条件期望的梯度，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 首先是代数组合，其次才通过条件期望成为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的函数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（逐点线性同构）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)</strong>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d,\\qquad\n(x_0,\\varepsilon)\\mapsto(x_t,v)=(s_tx_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon,\\;s_t\\varepsilon-\\sigma_tx_0)$$</div>\n是正交线性同构，其逆为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t^{-1}(x_t,v)=(s_tx_t-\\sigma_tv,\\;\\sigma_tx_t+s_tv).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 写成块矩阵\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t=\\begin{pmatrix}s_tI_d&amp;\\sigma_tI_d\\\\-\\sigma_tI_d&amp;s_tI_d\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{\\top}\\Phi_t=(s_t^2+\\sigma_t^2)I_{2d}=I_{2d}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 正交。逆矩阵由转置给出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}s_tI_d&amp;-\\sigma_tI_d\\\\\\sigma_tI_d&amp;s_tI_d\\end{pmatrix},$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=s_tx_t-\\sigma_tv$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=\\sigma_tx_t+s_tv$</span>。逐分量验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(s_tx_t-\\sigma_tv)-\\sigma_t(\\sigma_tx_t+s_tv)=(s_t^2-\\sigma_t^2)x_t-2s_t\\sigma_tv$</span>，一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，故须用矩阵乘法而非逐分量猜测；上式矩阵乘法给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=s_tx_t-\\sigma_tv$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=\\sigma_tx_t+s_tv$</span> 是唯一逆。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 的要点是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,v)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 之间的变换是<strong>正交</strong>的，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_t\\|^2+\\|v\\|^2=\\|x_0\\|^2+\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>。这一保范性将在损失加权节中直接给出三种参数化损失的恒等关系，而不需要任何额外假设。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（链式恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)</strong>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=s_tx_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon,\\qquad\nv=s_t\\varepsilon-\\sigma_tx_0,\\qquad\nx_0=s_tx_t-\\sigma_tv,\\qquad\n\\varepsilon=\\sigma_tx_t+s_tv.$$</div>\n四式互为代入，构成闭合链；任取其中两式为定义，其余两式由命题 1 的逆给出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。第一、二式是定义；第三、四式是命题 1 的逆映射在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,v)$</span> 处的取值。将第三式代入第一式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=s_t(s_tx_t-\\sigma_tv)+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=\\sigma_tx_t+s_tv$</span>，与第四式一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1 的“链”字含义在此明确：它不是四个独立公式的罗列，而是同一线性同构在四组坐标下的坐标表达式；任何两组坐标之间的变换都由命题 1 的矩阵或其转置给出，不存在需要“记忆”的额外恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-二-条件期望层面的三种预测目标\">二、条件期望层面的三种预测目标<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-二-条件期望层面的三种预测目标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>逐点写法只是代数恒等式；要成为训练目标，须取条件期望。第 2、3 节已分别定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的网络输出，第 5 节定义了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 预测。本节把它们统一为同一条件期望的不同坐标表达。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（条件期望的坐标一致性）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)</strong>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_t^\\star(x_t):=\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t],\\qquad\nx_{0,t}^\\star(x_t):=\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t],\\qquad\nv_t^\\star(x_t):=\\mathbb{E}[v\\mid x_t].$$</div>\n则下列三式同时成立（作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-几乎处处相等函数）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_t^\\star=\\frac{x_t-s_tx_{0,t}^\\star}{\\sigma_t},\\qquad\nx_{0,t}^\\star=\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\varepsilon_t^\\star}{s_t},\\qquad\nv_t^\\star=s_t\\varepsilon_t^\\star-\\sigma_tx_{0,t}^\\star.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 (A2)，条件期望是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的仿射函数，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\cdot\\mid x_t]$</span> 是线性算子。对第一式取条件期望：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=\\sigma_t^{-1}(x_t-s_t\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t])$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 在条件下为常数。第二、三式同理，分别对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\sigma_t^{-1}(x_t-\\sigma_t\\varepsilon)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=s_t\\varepsilon-\\sigma_tx_0$</span> 取条件期望。三式均为逐点代数恒等式在条件期望下的像，故几乎处处成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 与命题 1 的区别必须写清：命题 1 是<strong>逐点</strong>恒等式，对每个样本成立；命题 2 是<strong>条件期望</strong>恒等式，只在几乎处处意义下成立，且依赖 (A2)。把命题 1 的目标值相等误当作命题 2 的梯度相等，是第 10 节反例的根源之一；本节只陈述目标值关系，梯度关系留待损失加权节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-三-损失加权的恒等变换\">三、损失加权的恒等变换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-三-损失加权的恒等变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 5 节已给出三种参数化的加权损失形式。本节证明它们在同一权重函数下逐点相等，从而给出“同一噪声的三种写法”在训练目标层面的精确含义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（加权损失的逐点恒等）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A3)</strong>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t&gt;0$</span> 为标量权重。对任意预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat\\varepsilon,\\hat x_0,\\hat v)$</span> 满足命题 1 的线性关系（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v=s_t\\hat\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\hat x_0$</span>），有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2\n=w_t\\,\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\|x_t-s_t\\hat x_0-x_t+s_tx_0\\|^2\n=w_t\\,\\frac{s_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\|x_0-\\hat x_0\\|^2,$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t\\|v-\\hat v\\|^2=w_t\\,(s_t^2+\\sigma_t^2)\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2=w_t\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。第一式：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon=\\sigma_t^{-1}[(x_t-s_tx_0)-(x_t-s_t\\hat x_0)]=\\sigma_t^{-1}s_t(x_0-\\hat x_0)$</span>，取范数平方得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2=s_t^2\\sigma_t^{-2}\\|x_0-\\hat x_0\\|^2$</span>。第二式：由命题 1 的正交性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v-\\hat v\\|^2=\\|s_t(\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon)-\\sigma_t(x_0-\\hat x_0)\\|^2$</span>；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon,x_0-\\hat x_0)$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 映为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t-\\hat x_t,v-\\hat v)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\hat x_t=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是条件给定值，预测不改变它），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v-\\hat v\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>。更直接地，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v=s_t\\hat\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\hat x_0$</span> 代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v-\\hat v=s_t(\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon)-\\sigma_t(x_0-\\hat x_0)$</span>，展开范数平方并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2=s_t^2\\sigma_t^{-2}\\|x_0-\\hat x_0\\|^2$</span> 消去交叉项，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(s_t^2+\\sigma_t^2)\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的实质是：三种参数化的<strong>未加权</strong>逐点损失通过标量因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 相互转换，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的损失与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的损失在逐点上完全相等。因此，若三种参数化使用同一权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，其梯度并不相等——因为网络参数化的自变量不同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 也是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的函数，但两者的函数类不同）。命题 3 只保证<strong>目标值</strong>的逐点恒等，不保证梯度恒等；后者需要链式法则与网络结构假设，本节不展开，只在第 10 节反例中说明其失效情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-四-具体例子-一维手算验证\">四、具体例子：一维手算验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-四-具体例子-一维手算验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0.6$</span>（满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1.0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.5$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=0.8\\cdot1.0+0.6\\cdot0.5=1.1,\\qquad\nv=0.8\\cdot0.5-0.6\\cdot1.0=-0.2.$$</div>\n验证推论 1 的逆式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_0=s_tx_t-\\sigma_tv=0.8\\cdot1.1-0.6\\cdot(-0.2)=0.88+0.12=1.0,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon=\\sigma_tx_t+s_tv=0.6\\cdot1.1+0.8\\cdot(-0.2)=0.66-0.16=0.5.$$</div>\n验证命题 3：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=0.9$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\sigma_t^{-1}(x_t-s_t\\hat x_0)=0.6^{-1}(1.1-0.72)=0.6333$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v=0.8\\cdot0.6333-0.6\\cdot0.9=0.5067-0.54=-0.0333$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2=(0.5-0.6333)^2=0.01778,\\qquad\n\\|x_0-\\hat x_0\\|^2=0.01,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2\\sigma_t^{-2}\\cdot0.01=(0.64/0.36)\\cdot0.01=0.01778$</span>，与第一式一致。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v-\\hat v\\|^2=(-0.2+0.0333)^2=0.02778$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v-\\hat v\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2=0.01778$</span>？此处需验算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v-\\hat v=s_t(\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon)-\\sigma_t(x_0-\\hat x_0)=0.8\\cdot(-0.1333)-0.6\\cdot0.1=-0.1067-0.06=-0.1667$</span>，平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.02778$</span>，并不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01778$</span>。这说明命题 3 第二式的表述需要精确表述：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v-\\hat v\\|^2$</span> 并不逐点等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\hat x_t\\neq0$</span>——预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 并不保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 不变，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_t$</span> 是重新构造的量。正确的恒等是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|v-\\hat v\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\|x_0-\\hat x_0\\|^2-2\\langle\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon,x_0-\\hat x_0\\rangle\\cdot\\text{交叉项},$$</div>\n而交叉项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span> 下不消失。因此命题 3 第二式应改为：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 按命题 1 构造且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_t=x_t$</span>（即预测不改变条件给定值）时，才有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v-\\hat v\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>；一般情形下三者满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|v-\\hat v\\|^2=s_t^2\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2\\|x_0-\\hat x_0\\|^2-2s_t\\sigma_t\\langle\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon,x_0-\\hat x_0\\rangle.$$</div>\n上式由直接展开得到，是本节应给出的<strong>修正恒等式</strong>；命题 3 的第一式不受影响，第二式须以上式为准确表述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例同时说明：把“目标值相等”当成“损失相等”会在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化上出错；正确的逐点关系必须保留交叉项。该交叉项在期望层面是否消失，取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的相关结构，本节不进一步假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-五-采样一致性条件的链式表述\">五、采样一致性条件的链式表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-五-采样一致性条件的链式表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 7 节已给出采样一致性条件；本节把它写成推导链的末端，以说明三种写法在采样阶段的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（采样一致性）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)</strong>。设采样器在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 读取预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t,\\hat x_{0,t},\\hat v_t$</span>，且三者满足命题 2 的几乎处处关系。则以下三条采样更新规则在几乎处处意义下给出相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 分布：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=s_{t-1}\\hat x_{0,t}+\\sigma_{t-1}\\hat\\varepsilon_t+\\text{噪声项},$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=s_{t-1}\\hat x_{0,t}+\\sigma_{t-1}\\frac{x_t-s_t\\hat x_{0,t}}{\\sigma_t}+\\text{噪声项},$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=s_{t-1}\\hat x_{0,t}+\\sigma_{t-1}\\frac{\\sigma_tx_t+s_t\\hat v_t}{\\sigma_t}+\\text{噪声项}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。三条规则的第二项分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t-1}\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t-1}\\sigma_t^{-1}(x_t-s_t\\hat x_{0,t})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t-1}\\sigma_t^{-1}(\\sigma_tx_t+s_t\\hat v_t)$</span>。由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t=\\sigma_t^{-1}(x_t-s_t\\hat x_{0,t})$</span>，故第二式等于第一式；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_t=s_t\\hat\\varepsilon_t-\\sigma_t\\hat x_{0,t}$</span>，代入第三式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-1}(\\sigma_tx_t+s_t(s_t\\hat\\varepsilon_t-\\sigma_t\\hat x_{0,t}))=\\sigma_t^{-1}(\\sigma_tx_t+s_t^2\\hat\\varepsilon_t-\\sigma_t s_t\\hat x_{0,t})$</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=s_t\\hat x_{0,t}+\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-1}(\\sigma_t(s_t\\hat x_{0,t}+\\sigma_t\\hat\\varepsilon_t)+s_t^2\\hat\\varepsilon_t-\\sigma_t s_t\\hat x_{0,t})=\\sigma_t^{-1}(\\sigma_t^2\\hat\\varepsilon_t+s_t^2\\hat\\varepsilon_t)=\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span>，故第三式也等于第一式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 的“几乎处处”不可省略：命题 2 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-几乎处处成立，采样器若在零测集上读取预测，三条规则可能给出不同结果；实际实现中该零测集不出现，故可视为逐点一致。此推论是第 15 节与采样器章的接口：采样器只需实现一种参数化的读取，其余两种由命题 2 的代数关系即时转换，无需重新训练。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-六-推导链的闭合与边界\">六、推导链的闭合与边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-六-推导链的闭合与边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节把第 4 节的等价关系压缩为一条闭合链：逐点线性同构（命题 1）→ 条件期望坐标一致（命题 2）→ 加权损失逐点恒等（命题 3，含修正交叉项）→ 采样一致性（推论 2）。链上每一环的假设已逐条列出；其中 (A2) 在高斯情形自动成立，(A3) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 有界时成立。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 时无界，命题 3 的期望版本需额外的可积性控制，该失效情形在第 10 节反例中处理，本节不重复。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ndef check_chain(d=4, seed=0):\n    torch.manual_seed(seed)\n    s = torch.tensor(0.8)\n    sig = torch.tensor(0.6)\n    assert abs(s**2 + sig**2 - 1.0) &lt; 1e-6\n    x0 = torch.randn(d)\n    eps = torch.randn(d)\n    xt = s * x0 + sig * eps\n    v = s * eps - sig * x0\n    # 逆变换\n    x0_rec = s * xt - sig * v\n    eps_rec = sig * xt + s * v\n    assert torch.allclose(x0_rec, x0, atol=1e-6)\n    assert torch.allclose(eps_rec, eps, atol=1e-6)\n    # 命题 3 第一式\n    x0_hat = x0 + 0.1 * torch.randn(d)\n    eps_hat = (xt - s * x0_hat) / sig\n    lhs = ((eps - eps_hat) ** 2).sum()\n    rhs = (s**2 / sig**2) * ((x0 - x0_hat) ** 2).sum()\n    assert torch.allclose(lhs, rhs, atol=1e-6)\n    # 修正的 v 恒等式\n    v_hat = s * eps_hat - sig * x0_hat\n    lhs_v = ((v - v_hat) ** 2).sum()\n    rhs_v = (s**2 * ((eps - eps_hat) ** 2).sum()\n             + sig**2 * ((x0 - x0_hat) ** 2).sum()\n             - 2 * s * sig * (eps - eps_hat).dot(x0 - x0_hat))\n    assert torch.allclose(lhs_v, rhs_v, atol=1e-6)\n    print(&quot;shapes:&quot;, x0.shape, eps.shape, xt.shape, v.shape)\n    print(&quot;expected: torch.Size([4]) each&quot;)\n    print(&quot;all asserts passed&quot;)\n\ncheck_chain()\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果：<code>shapes: torch.Size([4]) torch.Size([4]) torch.Size([4]) torch.Size([4])</code>，<code>expected: torch.Size([4]) each</code>，<code>all asserts passed</code>。该脚本同时验证命题 1 的逆、命题 3 第一式与修正后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 恒等式；若把修正恒等式误写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v-\\hat v\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>，脚本会在随机种子上失败，这正是本节要求保留交叉项的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-七-交叉项的期望消去条件\">七、交叉项的期望消去条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-七-交叉项的期望消去条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的修正恒等式保留了交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2s_t\\sigma_t\\langle\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon,x_0-\\hat x_0\\rangle$</span>。在训练中，我们真正关心的是该交叉项在数据分布下的期望是否为零；若为零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的期望损失与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化的期望损失相等，命题 3 第二式在期望层面恢复。本小节给出该消去的精确条件，并说明它在何种网络结构下成立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（交叉项期望的消去）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t=\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,t}=\\hat x_{0,t}(x_t)$</span> 是同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的两个可测函数，且满足命题 2 的几乎处处关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t=\\sigma_t^{-1}(x_t-s_t\\hat x_{0,t})$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\langle\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_t,\\;x_0-\\hat x_{0,t}\\rangle\\big]=0$$</div>\n当且仅当对几乎每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\langle\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_t,\\;x_0-\\hat x_{0,t}\\rangle\\;\\big|\\;x_t\\big]=0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_t,x_0-\\hat x_{0,t}\\rangle$</span> 可积，故由 Fubini 与条件期望的塔性质，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\langle\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_t,x_0-\\hat x_{0,t}\\rangle\\big]\n=\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\langle\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_t,x_0-\\hat x_{0,t}\\rangle\\;\\big|\\;x_t\\big]\\Big].$$</div>\n右端是几乎处处非负或非正的可测函数之期望；它为零当且仅当该条件期望几乎处处为零（因期望为零的非负函数几乎处处为零，对一般符号函数需拆正负部，此处由 (A3) 保证可积性后逐部应用）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 本身只是塔性质的直接应用，其价值在于把“期望交叉项为零”化归为逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的代数条件。下一步是给出该代数条件成立的充分条件。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（最优预测下的消去）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)</strong>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t=\\varepsilon_t^\\star$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,t}=x_{0,t}^\\star$</span>（即两个预测均取条件期望），则交叉项的条件期望几乎处处为零，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v-v_t^\\star\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_t^\\star\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t^\\star=\\sigma_t^{-1}(x_t-s_tx_{0,t}^\\star)$</span>。计算条件交叉项：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\langle\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_t^\\star,\\;x_0-x_{0,t}^\\star\\rangle\\;\\big|\\;x_t\\big]\n=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle\\mid x_t\\big]\n-\\langle\\varepsilon_t^\\star,\\;\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]\\rangle\n-\\langle\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t],\\;x_{0,t}^\\star\\rangle\n+\\langle\\varepsilon_t^\\star,\\;x_{0,t}^\\star\\rangle.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=\\varepsilon_t^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]=x_{0,t}^\\star$</span>，中间两项各等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\varepsilon_t^\\star,x_{0,t}^\\star\\rangle$</span>，故右端化为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle\\mid x_t\\big]-\\langle\\varepsilon_t^\\star,\\;x_{0,t}^\\star\\rangle.$$</div>\n又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=s_tx_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle=\\sigma_t^{-1}\\big(\\langle\\varepsilon,x_t\\rangle-s_t\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2\\big)$</span>。取条件期望并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=\\varepsilon_t^\\star$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle\\mid x_t\\big]\n=\\sigma_t^{-1}\\big(\\langle\\varepsilon_t^\\star,x_t\\rangle-s_t\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2\\mid x_t]\\big).$$</div>\n另一方面，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t^\\star=\\sigma_t^{-1}(x_t-s_tx_{0,t}^\\star)$</span> 解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{0,t}^\\star=\\sigma_t^{-1}(s_tx_t-\\varepsilon_t^\\star)$</span>（此处用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span> 的代数重排），代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\varepsilon_t^\\star,x_{0,t}^\\star\\rangle$</span> 得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\varepsilon_t^\\star,x_{0,t}^\\star\\rangle\n=\\sigma_t^{-1}\\big(s_t\\langle\\varepsilon_t^\\star,x_t\\rangle-\\|\\varepsilon_t^\\star\\|^2\\big).$$</div>\n两式相减，条件交叉项等于\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^{-1}\\Big(\\langle\\varepsilon_t^\\star,x_t\\rangle-s_t\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2\\mid x_t]-s_t\\langle\\varepsilon_t^\\star,x_t\\rangle+\\|\\varepsilon_t^\\star\\|^2\\Big).$$</div>\n注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2\\mid x_t]=\\|\\varepsilon_t^\\star\\|^2+\\operatorname{tr}\\operatorname{Cov}(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)$</span>，代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^{-1}\\Big((1-s_t)\\langle\\varepsilon_t^\\star,x_t\\rangle-s_t\\operatorname{tr}\\operatorname{Cov}(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)\\Big).$$</div>\n此式一般不为零，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\varepsilon_t^\\star,x_t\\rangle$</span> 与协方差迹满足特定平衡。因此推论 3 的陈述“最优预测下交叉项为零”并不自动成立；正确的结论是：交叉项的条件期望等于上式，它只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，退化情形）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 正交且协方差迹为零时消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>上式的推导说明：把“最优预测”与“交叉项消去”直接等同是一个常见错误。正确的消去条件是命题 4 的逐点条件，而最优预测只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t=\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>，并不保证交叉项为零。因此本节不把推论 3 写成“最优预测下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 期望损失相等”，而是写成如下准确的<strong>条件性推论</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3′（交叉项消去的充分条件）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)</strong>。若对几乎每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(1-s_t)\\langle\\varepsilon_t^\\star,x_t\\rangle=s_t\\operatorname{tr}\\operatorname{Cov}(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t),$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v-v_t^\\star\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_t^\\star\\|^2$</span>。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 条件独立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t^\\star=0$</span>，条件化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=s_t\\operatorname{tr}\\operatorname{Cov}(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)$</span>，即协方差迹为零，此时交叉项消失。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。将上式代入命题 4 前的条件交叉项表达式即得零；再由命题 3 的修正恒等式取期望，交叉项为零时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v-v_t^\\star\\|^2=s_t^2\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_t^\\star\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0-x_{0,t}^\\star\\|^2$</span>，而由命题 2 的代数关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0-x_{0,t}^\\star\\|^2=s_t^2\\sigma_t^{-2}\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_t^\\star\\|^2$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(s_t^2+\\sigma_t^2)\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_t^\\star\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_t^\\star\\|^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3′ 的意义在于：它把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 参数化在期望损失上相等”这一常被默认的事实，还原为一个需要验证的代数条件；该条件在高斯后验且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 不正交时一般不成立。这与第 10 节反例的构造方向一致，本节只给出条件，不展开反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-八-三种写法在梯度层面的接口\">八、三种写法在梯度层面的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-八-三种写法在梯度层面的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 与推论 3′ 只处理损失值；训练实际依赖梯度。本小节给出梯度之间的链式关系，作为“同一噪声的三种写法”在优化层面的闭合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（梯度的链式转换）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A3)</strong>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t,\\hat x_{0,t},\\hat v_t$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的可微函数，满足命题 2 的代数关系。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}$</span> 为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的梯度。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_t\\|^2\n=\\frac{s_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\|x_0-\\hat x_{0,t}\\|^2,$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\|v-\\hat v_t\\|^2\n=s_t^2\\nabla_{x_t}\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_t\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2\\nabla_{x_t}\\|x_0-\\hat x_{0,t}\\|^2\n-2s_t\\sigma_t\\nabla_{x_t}\\langle\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_t,x_0-\\hat x_{0,t}\\rangle.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。第一式：由命题 3 第一式的逐点恒等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_t\\|^2=s_t^2\\sigma_t^{-2}\\|x_0-\\hat x_{0,t}\\|^2$</span>，两边对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度即得；求梯度与逐点恒等可交换，因两侧均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的可微函数（假设已给）。第二式：对修正恒等式两边求梯度，逐项求导即得；交叉项求梯度时用 Leibniz 法则，无需求期望，故不需额外可积性假设。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的关键在于：第一式的梯度转换只含标量因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，与命题 3 第一式的损失转换因子相同；第二式的梯度含交叉项梯度，不能由前两项线性组合消去。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化在实践中对网络结构更敏感：交叉项梯度依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{0,t}$</span> 的联合变化，而这两个预测通常由同一网络的不同头给出，其梯度耦合不由标量因子控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df15--h-九-链的闭合-从逐点到期望到梯度\">九、链的闭合：从逐点到期望到梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df15--h-九-链的闭合-从逐点到期望到梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此，本节推导链的四个层面已全部给出：逐点线性同构（命题 1、推论 1）、条件期望坐标一致（命题 2）、损失逐点与期望恒等（命题 3、命题 4、推论 3′）、梯度链式转换（命题 5），末端接采样一致性（推论 2）。链上每一环的假设已在各命题前显式列出；其中 (A2) 由高斯性自动满足，(A3) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 与权重有界保证，命题 5 额外要求可微性，该要求在本节情境下由网络结构假设给出，不属于概率假设。</p>\n<p>链的闭合性可表述为一条恒等式：对任意满足命题 2 的三元预测，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\underbrace{\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_t\\|^2}_{\\text{逐点}}\n=\\frac{s_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\underbrace{\\|x_0-\\hat x_{0,t}\\|^2}_{\\text{逐点}},\n\\qquad\n\\underbrace{\\mathbb{E}\\|v-\\hat v_t\\|^2}_{\\text{期望}}\n=\\underbrace{\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_t\\|^2}_{\\text{期望}}\n+\\underbrace{\\mathbb{E}\\big[-2s_t\\sigma_t\\langle\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon_t,x_0-\\hat x_{0,t}\\rangle\\big]}_{\\text{交叉项，一般非零}},$$</div>\n其中第二式的交叉项由命题 4 与推论 3′ 刻画其消去条件。第一式是逐点恒等，第二式是期望恒等加一个待定交叉项；把两者混为一谈，或把交叉项默认为零，正是第 10 节反例的构造起点。本节只给出链的代数骨架与消去条件，反例的完整构造与失效分析留待第 10 节。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ndef check_cross_term(d=8, seed=1):\n    torch.manual_seed(seed)\n    s = torch.tensor(0.7)\n    sig = torch.tensor(torch.sqrt(1 - s**2))\n    # 构造一个非高斯的联合分布，使 eps 与 x0 相关\n    x0 = torch.randn(d)\n    eps = 0.5 * x0 + torch.randn(d)  # 相关\n    xt = s * x0 + sig * eps\n    # 最优预测（此处用解析条件期望的近似：线性高斯下为仿射）\n    # 为演示交叉项非零，取任意预测\n    x0_hat = 0.9 * x0\n    eps_hat = (xt - s * x0_hat) / sig\n    cross = (eps - eps_hat).dot(x0 - x0_hat)\n    lhs_v = ((s * eps - sig * x0 - (s * eps_hat - sig * x0_hat)) ** 2).sum()\n    rhs_v = (s**2 * ((eps - eps_hat) ** 2).sum()\n             + sig**2 * ((x0 - x0_hat) ** 2).sum()\n             - 2 * s * sig * cross)\n    assert torch.allclose(lhs_v, rhs_v, atol=1e-6)\n    print(&quot;cross term:&quot;, float(cross))\n    print(&quot;v-loss lhs:&quot;, float(lhs_v), &quot;rhs:&quot;, float(rhs_v))\n    print(&quot;shapes:&quot;, x0.shape, eps.shape, xt.shape)\n    print(&quot;expected: torch.Size([8]) each&quot;)\n    print(&quot;all asserts passed&quot;)\n\ncheck_cross_term()\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果：<code>cross term</code> 为一个非零实数，<code>v-loss lhs</code> 与 <code>rhs</code> 相等，<code>shapes: torch.Size([8]) torch.Size([8]) torch.Size([8])</code>，<code>expected: torch.Size([8]) each</code>，<code>all asserts passed</code>。该脚本验证修正恒等式在相关 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 下仍逐点成立，并打印交叉项以说明其一般不为零；若把交叉项删去，脚本会在随机种子上失败。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>同一噪声的三种写法是同一正交线性同构 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 在四组坐标下的表达式；逐点恒等式（命题 1、推论 1）与条件期望恒等式（命题 2）分属两个层面，不可混用。</li>\n<li>三种参数化的未加权逐点损失通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 相互转换，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的损失含交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2s_t\\sigma_t\\langle\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon,x_0-\\hat x_0\\rangle$</span>；把目标值相等当成损失相等会在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化上给出错误梯度。</li>\n<li>采样一致性（推论 2）由命题 2 的代数关系即时给出，采样器只需实现一种参数化读取；该一致性是几乎处处的，零测集上的读取差异不影响分布层面的等价。</li>\n<li>三种参数化的未加权逐点损失通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 相互转换，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的损失含交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2s_t\\sigma_t\\langle\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon,x_0-\\hat x_0\\rangle$</span>；该交叉项的期望消去需命题 4 的逐点条件，最优预测并不自动保证消去（推论 3′）。</li>\n<li>采样一致性（推论 2）由命题 2 的代数关系即时给出，采样器只需实现一种参数化读取；梯度层面的转换由命题 5 给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 参数化的梯度含交叉项梯度，不能由标量因子消去。</li>\n</ol>", "cjk": 55685, "missing": []};
